<Worksheet ss:Name="ManualReview">
<Table>
<Row ss:StyleID="Header"><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">hex</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">hex_name</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">chinese</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">translator</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">field_key</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">field_label</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">section_order</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">runtime_text</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">epub_verbatim_text</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">auto_match</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">user_match</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">user_notes</Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INSTRUCCIONES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Copia runtime_text y compáralo con tu libro/EPUB. Marca user_match: OK / FAIL / ?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">epub_verbatim_text es referencia digital del EPUB del proyecto.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien (represents) what is great and originating, penetrating, advantageous, correct and firm.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien (represents) what is great and originating, penetrating, advantageous, correct and firm.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven, in its motion, (gives the idea of) strength. The superior man, in accordance with this, nerves himself to ceaseless activity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven, in its motion, (gives the idea of) strength. The superior man, in accordance with this, nerves himself to ceaseless activity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the first (or lowest) line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon lying hid (in the deep). It is not the time for active doing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the first (or lowest) line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon lying hid (in the deep). It is not the time for active doing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the second line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon appearing in the field. It will be advantageous to meet with the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the second line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon appearing in the field. It will be advantageous to meet with the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the third line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the superior man active and vigilant all the day, and in the evening still careful and apprehensive. (The position is) dangerous, but there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the third line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the superior man active and vigilant all the day, and in the evening still careful and apprehensive. (The position is) dangerous, but there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fourth line, undivided, (we see its subject as the dragon looking) as if he were leaping up, but still in the deep. There will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fourth line, undivided, (we see its subject as the dragon looking) as if he were leaping up, but still in the deep. There will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fifth line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon on the wing in the sky. It will be advantageous to meet with the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fifth line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon on the wing in the sky. It will be advantageous to meet with the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the sixth (or topmost) line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon exceeding the proper limits. There will be occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the sixth (or topmost) line, undivided, (we see its subject as) the dragon exceeding the proper limits. There will be occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">yongJiu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">用九</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The lines of this hexagram are all strong and undivided, as appears from) the use of the number line. If the host of dragons (thus) appearing were to divest themselves of their heads, there would be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The lines of this hexagram are all strong and undivided, as appears from) the use of the number line. If the host of dragons (thus) appearing were to divest themselves of their heads, there would be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CREATIVE works sublime success,&#10;Furthering through perseverance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CREATIVE works sublime success,&#10;Furthering through perseverance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The movement of heaven is full of power.&#10;Thus the superior man makes himself strong and untiring.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The movement of heaven is full of power.&#10;Thus the superior man makes himself strong and untiring.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hidden dragon. Do not act.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hidden dragon. Do not act.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dragon appearing in the field.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dragon appearing in the field.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All day long the superior man is creatively active.&#10;At nightfall his mind is still beset with cares.&#10;Danger. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All day long the superior man is creatively active.&#10;At nightfall his mind is still beset with cares.&#10;Danger. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wavering flight over the depths.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wavering flight over the depths.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Flying dragon in the heavens.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Flying dragon in the heavens.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Arrogant dragon will have cause to repent.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Arrogant dragon will have cause to repent.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Initiating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">乾</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">yongJiu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">用九</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There appears a flight of dragons without heads.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There appears a flight of dragons without heads.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwăn (represents) what is great and originating, penetrating, advantageous, correct and having the firmness of a mare. When the superior man (here intended) has to make any movement, if he take the initiative, he will go astray; if he follow, he will find his (proper) lord. The advantageousness will be seen in his getting friends in the south-west, and losing friends in the north-east. If he rest in correctness and firmness, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwăn (represents) what is great and originating, penetrating, advantageous, correct and having the firmness of a mare. When the superior man (here intended) has to make any movement, if he take the initiative, he will go astray; if he follow, he will find his (proper) lord. The advantageousness will be seen in his getting friends in the south-west, and losing friends in the north-east. If he rest in correctness and firmness, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The (capacity and sustaining) power of the earth is what is denoted by Khwăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, with his large virtue supports (men and) things.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The (capacity and sustaining) power of the earth is what is denoted by Khwăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, with his large virtue supports (men and) things.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the first line, divided, (we see its subject) treading on hoarfrost. The strong ice will come (by and by).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the first line, divided, (we see its subject) treading on hoarfrost. The strong ice will come (by and by).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, (shows the attribute of) being straight, square, and great. (Its operation), without repeated efforts, will be in every respect advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, (shows the attribute of) being straight, square, and great. (Its operation), without repeated efforts, will be in every respect advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, (shows its subject) keeping his excellence under restraint, but firmly maintaining it. If he should have occasion to engage in the king’s service, though he will not claim the success (for himself), he will bring affairs to a good issue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, (shows its subject) keeping his excellence under restraint, but firmly maintaining it. If he should have occasion to engage in the king’s service, though he will not claim the success (for himself), he will bring affairs to a good issue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, (shows the symbol of) a sack tied up. There will be no ground for blame or for praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, (shows the symbol of) a sack tied up. There will be no ground for blame or for praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, (shows) the yellow lower garment. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, (shows) the yellow lower garment. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided (shows) dragons fighting in the wild. Their blood is purple and yellow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided (shows) dragons fighting in the wild. Their blood is purple and yellow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">yongLiu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">用六</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The lines of this hexagram are all weak and divided, as appears from) the use of the number six. If those (who are thus represented) be perpetually correct and firm, advantage will arise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The lines of this hexagram are all weak and divided, as appears from) the use of the number six. If those (who are thus represented) be perpetually correct and firm, advantage will arise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE RECEPTIVE brings about sublime success,&#10;Furthering through the perseverance of a mare.&#10;If the superior man undertakes something and tries to lead,&#10;He goes astray;&#10;But if he follows, he finds guidance.&#10;It is favorable to find friends in the west and south,&#10;To forego friends in the east and north.&#10;Quiet perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE RECEPTIVE brings about sublime success,&#10;Furthering through the perseverance of a mare.&#10;If the superior man undertakes something and tries to lead,&#10;He goes astray;&#10;But if he follows, he finds guidance.&#10;It is favorable to find friends in the west and south,&#10;To forego friends in the east and north.&#10;Quiet perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The earth’s condition is receptive devotion.&#10;Thus the superior man who has breadth of character&#10;Carries the outer world.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The earth’s condition is receptive devotion.&#10;Thus the superior man who has breadth of character&#10;Carries the outer world.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When there is hoarfrost underfoot,&#10;Solid ice is not far off.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When there is hoarfrost underfoot,&#10;Solid ice is not far off.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Straight, square, great.&#10;Without purpose,&#10;Yet nothing remains unfurthered.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Straight, square, great.&#10;Without purpose,&#10;Yet nothing remains unfurthered.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hidden lines.&#10;One is able to remain persevering.&#10;If by chance you are in the service of a king,&#10;Seek not works, but bring to completion.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hidden lines.&#10;One is able to remain persevering.&#10;If by chance you are in the service of a king,&#10;Seek not works, but bring to completion.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A tied-up sack. No blame, no praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A tied-up sack. No blame, no praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A yellow lower garment brings supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A yellow lower garment brings supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dragons fight in the meadow.&#10;Their blood is black and yellow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dragons fight in the meadow.&#10;Their blood is black and yellow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Responding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">yongLiu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">用六</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lasting perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lasting perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun (indicates that in the case which it presupposes) there will be great progress and success, and the advantage will come from being correct and firm. (But) any movement in advance should not be (lightly) undertaken. There will be advantage in appointing feudal princes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun (indicates that in the case which it presupposes) there will be great progress and success, and the advantage will come from being correct and firm. (But) any movement in advance should not be (lightly) undertaken. There will be advantage in appointing feudal princes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) clouds and (that representing) thunder form Kun. The superior man, in accordance with this, (adjusts his measures of government) as in sorting the threads of the warp and woof.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) clouds and (that representing) thunder form Kun. The superior man, in accordance with this, (adjusts his measures of government) as in sorting the threads of the warp and woof.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows the difficulty (its subject has) in advancing. It will be advantageous for him to abide correct and firm; advantageous (also) to be made a feudal ruler.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows the difficulty (its subject has) in advancing. It will be advantageous for him to abide correct and firm; advantageous (also) to be made a feudal ruler.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows (its subject) distressed and obliged to return; (even) the horses of her chariot (also) seem to be retreating. (But) not by a spoiler (is she assailed), but by one who seeks her to be his wife. The young lady maintains her firm correctness, and declines a union. After ten years she will be united, and have children.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows (its subject) distressed and obliged to return; (even) the horses of her chariot (also) seem to be retreating. (But) not by a spoiler (is she assailed), but by one who seeks her to be his wife. The young lady maintains her firm correctness, and declines a union. After ten years she will be united, and have children.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one following the deer without (the guidance of) the forester, and only finding himself in the midst of the forest. The superior man, acquainted with the secret risks, thinks it better to give up the chase. If he went forward, he would regret it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one following the deer without (the guidance of) the forester, and only finding himself in the midst of the forest. The superior man, acquainted with the secret risks, thinks it better to give up the chase. If he went forward, he would regret it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows (its subject as a lady), the horses of whose chariot appear in retreat. She seeks, however, (the help of) him who seeks her to be his wife. Advance will be fortunate; all will turn out advantageously.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows (its subject as a lady), the horses of whose chariot appear in retreat. She seeks, however, (the help of) him who seeks her to be his wife. Advance will be fortunate; all will turn out advantageously.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the difficulties in the way of (its subject’s) dispensing the rich favours that might be expected from him. With firmness and correctness there will be good fortune in small things; (even) with them in great things there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the difficulties in the way of (its subject’s) dispensing the rich favours that might be expected from him. With firmness and correctness there will be good fortune in small things; (even) with them in great things there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows (its subject) with the horses of his chariot obliged to retreat, and weeping tears of blood in streams.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows (its subject) with the horses of his chariot obliged to retreat, and weeping tears of blood in streams.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Difficulty at the Beginning works supreme success,&#10;Furthering through perseverance.&#10;Nothing should be undertaken.&#10;It furthers one to appoint helpers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Difficulty at the Beginning works supreme success,&#10;Furthering through perseverance.&#10;Nothing should be undertaken.&#10;It furthers one to appoint helpers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clouds and thunder:&#10;The image of Difficulty at the Beginning.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Brings order out of confusion.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clouds and thunder:&#10;The image of Difficulty at the Beginning.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Brings order out of confusion.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hesitation and hindrance.&#10;It furthers one to remain persevering.&#10;It furthers one to appoint helpers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hesitation and hindrance.&#10;It furthers one to remain persevering.&#10;It furthers one to appoint helpers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Difficulties pile up.&#10;Horse and wagon part.&#10;He is not a robber;&#10;He wants to woo when the time comes.&#10;The maiden is chaste,&#10;She does not pledge herself.&#10;Ten years—then she pledges herself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Difficulties pile up.&#10;Horse and wagon part.&#10;He is not a robber;&#10;He wants to woo when the time comes.&#10;The maiden is chaste,&#10;She does not pledge herself.&#10;Ten years—then she pledges herself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Whoever hunts deer without the forester&#10;Only loses his way in the forest.&#10;The superior man understands the signs of the time&#10;And prefers to desist.&#10;To go on brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Whoever hunts deer without the forester&#10;Only loses his way in the forest.&#10;The superior man understands the signs of the time&#10;And prefers to desist.&#10;To go on brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Horse and wagon part.&#10;Strive for union.&#10;To go brings good fortune.&#10;Everything acts to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Horse and wagon part.&#10;Strive for union.&#10;To go brings good fortune.&#10;Everything acts to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Difficulties in blessing.&#10;A little perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Great perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Difficulties in blessing.&#10;A little perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Great perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Beginning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">屯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Horse and wagon part.&#10;Bloody tears flow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Horse and wagon part.&#10;Bloody tears flow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Măng (indicates that in the case which it presupposes) there will be progress and success. I do not (go and) seek the youthful and inexperienced, but he comes and seeks me. When he shows (the sincerity that marks) the first recourse to divination, I instruct him. If he apply a second and third time, that is troublesome; and I do not instruct the troublesome. There will be advantage in being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Măng (indicates that in the case which it presupposes) there will be progress and success. I do not (go and) seek the youthful and inexperienced, but he comes and seeks me. When he shows (the sincerity that marks) the first recourse to divination, I instruct him. If he apply a second and third time, that is troublesome; and I do not instruct the troublesome. There will be advantage in being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain, and beneath it that for a spring issuing forth form Măng. The superior man, in accordance with this, strives to be resolute in his conduct and nourishes his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain, and beneath it that for a spring issuing forth form Măng. The superior man, in accordance with this, strives to be resolute in his conduct and nourishes his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, (has respect to) the dispelling of ignorance. It will be advantageous to use punishment (for that purpose), and to remove the shackles (from the mind). But going on in that way (of punishment) will give occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, (has respect to) the dispelling of ignorance. It will be advantageous to use punishment (for that purpose), and to remove the shackles (from the mind). But going on in that way (of punishment) will give occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, (shows its subject) exercising forbearance with the ignorant, in which there will be good fortune; and admitting (even the goodness of women, which will also be fortunate. (He may be described also as) a son able to (sustain the burden of) his family.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, (shows its subject) exercising forbearance with the ignorant, in which there will be good fortune; and admitting (even the goodness of women, which will also be fortunate. (He may be described also as) a son able to (sustain the burden of) his family.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, (seems to say) that one should not marry a woman whose emblem it might be, for that, when she sees a man of wealth, she will not keep her person from him, and in no wise will advantage come from her.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, (seems to say) that one should not marry a woman whose emblem it might be, for that, when she sees a man of wealth, she will not keep her person from him, and in no wise will advantage come from her.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, (shows its subject as if) bound in chains of ignorance. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, (shows its subject as if) bound in chains of ignorance. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject as a simple lad without experience. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject as a simple lad without experience. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the topmost line, undivided, we see one smiting the ignorant (youth). But no advantage will come from doing him an injury. Advantage would come from warding off injury from him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the topmost line, undivided, we see one smiting the ignorant (youth). But no advantage will come from doing him an injury. Advantage would come from warding off injury from him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YOUTHFUL FOLLY has success.&#10;It is not I who seek the young fool;&#10;The young fool seeks me.&#10;At the first oracle I inform him.&#10;If he asks two or three times, it is importunity.&#10;If he importunes, I give him no information.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YOUTHFUL FOLLY has success.&#10;It is not I who seek the young fool;&#10;The young fool seeks me.&#10;At the first oracle I inform him.&#10;If he asks two or three times, it is importunity.&#10;If he importunes, I give him no information.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A spring wells up at the foot of the mountain:&#10;The image Of YOUTH.&#10;Thus the superior man fosters his character&#10;By thoroughness in all that he does.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A spring wells up at the foot of the mountain:&#10;The image Of YOUTH.&#10;Thus the superior man fosters his character&#10;By thoroughness in all that he does.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To make a fool develop&#10;It furthers one to apply discipline.&#10;The fetters should be removed.&#10;To go on in this way brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To make a fool develop&#10;It furthers one to apply discipline.&#10;The fetters should be removed.&#10;To go on in this way brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To bear with fools in kindliness brings good fortune.&#10;To know how to take women&#10;Brings good fortune.&#10;The son is capable of taking charge of the household.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To bear with fools in kindliness brings good fortune.&#10;To know how to take women&#10;Brings good fortune.&#10;The son is capable of taking charge of the household.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Take not a maiden who, when she sees a man of bronze,&#10;Loses possession of herself.&#10;Nothing furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Take not a maiden who, when she sees a man of bronze,&#10;Loses possession of herself.&#10;Nothing furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Entangled folly brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Entangled folly brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childlike folly brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childlike folly brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Childhood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蒙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In punishing folly&#10;It does not further one&#10;To commit transgressions.&#10;The only thing that furthers&#10;Is to prevent transgressions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In punishing folly&#10;It does not further one&#10;To commit transgressions.&#10;The only thing that furthers&#10;Is to prevent transgressions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsü intimates that, with the sincerity which is declared in it, there will be brilliant success. With firmness there will be good fortune; and it will be advantageous to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsü intimates that, with the sincerity which is declared in it, there will be brilliant success. With firmness there will be good fortune; and it will be advantageous to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) clouds ascending over that for the sky forms Hsü. The superior man, in accordance with this, eats and drinks, feasts and enjoys himself (as if there were nothing else to employ him).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) clouds ascending over that for the sky forms Hsü. The superior man, in accordance with this, eats and drinks, feasts and enjoys himself (as if there were nothing else to employ him).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject waiting in the distant border. It will be well for him constantly to maintain (the purpose thus shown), in which case there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject waiting in the distant border. It will be well for him constantly to maintain (the purpose thus shown), in which case there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject waiting on the sand (of the mountain stream). He will (suffer) the small (injury of) being spoken (against), but in the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject waiting on the sand (of the mountain stream). He will (suffer) the small (injury of) being spoken (against), but in the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject in the mud (close by the stream). He thereby invites the approach of injury.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject in the mud (close by the stream). He thereby invites the approach of injury.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject waiting in (the place of) blood. But he will get out of the cavern.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject waiting in (the place of) blood. But he will get out of the cavern.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject waiting amidst the appliances of a feast. Through his firmness and correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject waiting amidst the appliances of a feast. Through his firmness and correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject entered into the cavern. (But) there are three guests coming, without being urged, (to his help). If he receive them respectfully, there will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject entered into the cavern. (But) there are three guests coming, without being urged, (to his help). If he receive them respectfully, there will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">WAITING. If you are sincere,&#10;You have light and success.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">WAITING. If you are sincere,&#10;You have light and success.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clouds rise up to heaven:&#10;The image of WAITING.&#10;Thus the superior man eats and drinks,&#10;Is joyous and of good cheer.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Clouds rise up to heaven:&#10;The image of WAITING.&#10;Thus the superior man eats and drinks,&#10;Is joyous and of good cheer.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting in the meadow.&#10;It furthers one to abide in what endures.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting in the meadow.&#10;It furthers one to abide in what endures.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting on the sand.&#10;There is some gossip.&#10;The end brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting on the sand.&#10;There is some gossip.&#10;The end brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting in the mud&#10;Brings about the arrival of the enemy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting in the mud&#10;Brings about the arrival of the enemy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting in blood.&#10;Get out of the pit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting in blood.&#10;Get out of the pit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting at meat and drink.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Waiting at meat and drink.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Needing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">需</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One falls into the pit.&#10;Three uninvited guests arrive.&#10;Honor them, and in the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One falls into the pit.&#10;Three uninvited guests arrive.&#10;Honor them, and in the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung intimates how, though there is sincerity in one’s contention, he will yet meet with opposition and obstruction; but if he cherish an apprehensive caution, there will be good fortune, while, if he must prosecute the contention to the (bitter) end, there will be evil. It will be advantageous to see the great man; it will not be advantageous to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung intimates how, though there is sincerity in one’s contention, he will yet meet with opposition and obstruction; but if he cherish an apprehensive caution, there will be good fortune, while, if he must prosecute the contention to the (bitter) end, there will be evil. It will be advantageous to see the great man; it will not be advantageous to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) heaven and (that representing) water, moving away from each other, form Sung. The superior man, in accordance with this, in the transaction of affairs takes good counsel about his first steps.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) heaven and (that representing) water, moving away from each other, form Sung. The superior man, in accordance with this, in the transaction of affairs takes good counsel about his first steps.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject not perpetuating the matter about which (the contention is). He will suffer the small (injury) of being spoken against, but the end will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject not perpetuating the matter about which (the contention is). He will suffer the small (injury) of being spoken against, but the end will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject unequal to the contention. If he retire and keep concealed (where) the inhabitants of his city are (only) three hundred families, he will fall into no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject unequal to the contention. If he retire and keep concealed (where) the inhabitants of his city are (only) three hundred families, he will fall into no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject keeping in the old place assigned for his support, and firmly correct. Perilous as the position is, there will be good fortune in the end. Should he perchance engage in the king’s business, he will not (claim the merit of) achievement.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject keeping in the old place assigned for his support, and firmly correct. Perilous as the position is, there will be good fortune in the end. Should he perchance engage in the king’s business, he will not (claim the merit of) achievement.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject unequal to the contention. He returns to (the study of Heaven’s) ordinances, changes (his wish to contend), and rests in being firm and correct. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject unequal to the contention. He returns to (the study of Heaven’s) ordinances, changes (his wish to contend), and rests in being firm and correct. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject contending;—and with great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject contending;—and with great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows how its subject may have the leathern belt conferred on him (by the sovereign), and thrice it shall be taken from him in a morning.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows how its subject may have the leathern belt conferred on him (by the sovereign), and thrice it shall be taken from him in a morning.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CONFLICT. You are sincere&#10;And are being obstructed.&#10;A cautious halt halfway brings good fortune.&#10;Going through to the end brings misfortune.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.&#10;It does not further one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CONFLICT. You are sincere&#10;And are being obstructed.&#10;A cautious halt halfway brings good fortune.&#10;Going through to the end brings misfortune.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.&#10;It does not further one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven and water go their opposite ways:&#10;The image of CONFLICT.&#10;Thus in all his transactions the superior man&#10;Carefully considers the beginning.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven and water go their opposite ways:&#10;The image of CONFLICT.&#10;Thus in all his transactions the superior man&#10;Carefully considers the beginning.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one does not perpetuate the affair,&#10;There is a little gossip.&#10;In the end, good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one does not perpetuate the affair,&#10;There is a little gossip.&#10;In the end, good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One cannot engage in conflict;&#10;One returns home, gives way.&#10;The people of his town,&#10;Three hundred households,&#10;Remain free of guilt.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One cannot engage in conflict;&#10;One returns home, gives way.&#10;The people of his town,&#10;Three hundred households,&#10;Remain free of guilt.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To nourish oneself on ancient virtue induces perseverance.&#10;Danger. In the end, good fortune comes.&#10;If by chance you are in the service of a king,&#10;Seek not works.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To nourish oneself on ancient virtue induces perseverance.&#10;Danger. In the end, good fortune comes.&#10;If by chance you are in the service of a king,&#10;Seek not works.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One cannot engage in conflict.&#10;One turns back and submits to fate,&#10;Changes one’s attitude,&#10;And finds peace in perseverance.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One cannot engage in conflict.&#10;One turns back and submits to fate,&#10;Changes one’s attitude,&#10;And finds peace in perseverance.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To contend before him&#10;Brings supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To contend before him&#10;Brings supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contention</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">訟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Even if by chance a leather belt is bestowed on one,&#10;By the end of a morning&#10;It will have been snatched away three times.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Even if by chance a leather belt is bestowed on one,&#10;By the end of a morning&#10;It will have been snatched away three times.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze indicates how, in the case which it supposes, with firmness and correctness, and (a leader of) age and experience, there will be good fortune and no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze indicates how, in the case which it supposes, with firmness and correctness, and (a leader of) age and experience, there will be good fortune and no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and in the midst of it that representing water, form Sze. The superior man, in accordance with this, nourishes and educates the people, and collects (from among them) the multitudes (of the hosts).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and in the midst of it that representing water, form Sze. The superior man, in accordance with this, nourishes and educates the people, and collects (from among them) the multitudes (of the hosts).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the host going forth according to the rules (for such a movement). If these be not good, there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the host going forth according to the rules (for such a movement). If these be not good, there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows (the leader) in the midst of the host. There will be good fortune and no error. The king has thrice conveyed to him the orders (of his favour).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows (the leader) in the midst of the host. There will be good fortune and no error. The king has thrice conveyed to him the orders (of his favour).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows how the host may, possibly, have many inefficient leaders. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows how the host may, possibly, have many inefficient leaders. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows the host in retreat. There is no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows the host in retreat. There is no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows birds in the fields, which it will be advantageous to seize (and destroy). In that case there will be no error. If the oldest son leads the host, and younger men (idly occupy offices assigned to them), however firm and correct he may be, there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows birds in the fields, which it will be advantageous to seize (and destroy). In that case there will be no error. If the oldest son leads the host, and younger men (idly occupy offices assigned to them), however firm and correct he may be, there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sze</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows the great ruler delivering his charges, (appointing some) to be rulers of states, and others to undertake the headship of clans; but small men should not be employed (in such positions).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows the great ruler delivering his charges, (appointing some) to be rulers of states, and others to undertake the headship of clans; but small men should not be employed (in such positions).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE ARMY. The army needs perseverance&#10;And a strong man.&#10;Good fortune without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE ARMY. The army needs perseverance&#10;And a strong man.&#10;Good fortune without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the middle of the earth is water:&#10;The image of THE ARMY.&#10;Thus the superior man increases his masses&#10;By generosity toward the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the middle of the earth is water:&#10;The image of THE ARMY.&#10;Thus the superior man increases his masses&#10;By generosity toward the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">An army must set forth in proper order.&#10;If the order is not good, misfortune threatens.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">An army must set forth in proper order.&#10;If the order is not good, misfortune threatens.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the midst of the army.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.&#10;The king bestows a triple decoration.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the midst of the army.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.&#10;The king bestows a triple decoration.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perchance the army carries corpses in the wagon.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perchance the army carries corpses in the wagon.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The army retreats. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The army retreats. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is game in the field.&#10;It furthers one to catch it.&#10;Without blame.&#10;Let the eldest lead the army.&#10;The younger transports corpses;&#10;Then perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is game in the field.&#10;It furthers one to catch it.&#10;Without blame.&#10;Let the eldest lead the army.&#10;The younger transports corpses;&#10;Then perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Multitude</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">師</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The great prince issues commands,&#10;Founds states, vests families with fiefs.&#10;Inferior people should not be employed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The great prince issues commands,&#10;Founds states, vests families with fiefs.&#10;Inferior people should not be employed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pî indicates that (under the conditions which it supposes) there is good fortune. But let (the principal party intended in it) re-examine himself, (as if) by divination, whether his virtue be great, unintermitting, and firm. If it be so, there will be no error. Those who have not rest will then come to him; and with those who are (too) late in coming it will be ill.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pî indicates that (under the conditions which it supposes) there is good fortune. But let (the principal party intended in it) re-examine himself, (as if) by divination, whether his virtue be great, unintermitting, and firm. If it be so, there will be no error. Those who have not rest will then come to him; and with those who are (too) late in coming it will be ill.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth, and over it (that representing) water, form Pî. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, established the various states and maintained an affectionate relation to their princes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth, and over it (that representing) water, form Pî. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, established the various states and maintained an affectionate relation to their princes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject seeking by his sincerity to win the attachment of his object. There will be no error. Let (the breast) be full of sincerity as an earthenware vessel is of its contents, and it will in the end bring other advantages.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject seeking by his sincerity to win the attachment of his object. There will be no error. Let (the breast) be full of sincerity as an earthenware vessel is of its contents, and it will in the end bring other advantages.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the second line, divided, we see the movement towards union and attachment proceeding from the inward (mind). With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the second line, divided, we see the movement towards union and attachment proceeding from the inward (mind). With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the third line, divided, we see its subject seeking for union with such as ought not to be associated with.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the third line, divided, we see its subject seeking for union with such as ought not to be associated with.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fourth line, divided, we see its subject seeking for union with the one beyond himself. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fourth line, divided, we see its subject seeking for union with the one beyond himself. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, affords the most illustrious instance of seeking union and attachment. (We seem to see in it) the king urging his pursuit of the game (only) in three directions, and allowing the escape of all the animals before him, while the people of his towns do not warn one another (to prevent it). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, affords the most illustrious instance of seeking union and attachment. (We seem to see in it) the king urging his pursuit of the game (only) in three directions, and allowing the escape of all the animals before him, while the people of his towns do not warn one another (to prevent it). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the topmost line, divided, we see one seeking union and attachment without having taken the first step (to such an end). There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the topmost line, divided, we see one seeking union and attachment without having taken the first step (to such an end). There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HOLDING TOGETHER brings good fortune.&#10;Inquire of the oracle once again&#10;Whether you possess sublimity, constancy, and perseverance;&#10;Then there is no blame.&#10;Those who are uncertain gradually join.&#10;Whoever comes too late&#10;Meets with misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">HOLDING TOGETHER brings good fortune.&#10;Inquire of the oracle once again&#10;Whether you possess sublimity, constancy, and perseverance;&#10;Then there is no blame.&#10;Those who are uncertain gradually join.&#10;Whoever comes too late&#10;Meets with misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On the earth is water:&#10;The image of HOLDING TOGETHER.&#10;Thus the kings of antiquity&#10;Bestowed the different states as fiefs&#10;And cultivated friendly relations&#10;With the feudal lords.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On the earth is water:&#10;The image of HOLDING TOGETHER.&#10;Thus the kings of antiquity&#10;Bestowed the different states as fiefs&#10;And cultivated friendly relations&#10;With the feudal lords.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hold to him in truth and loyalty;&#10;This is without blame.&#10;Truth, like a full earthen bowl:&#10;Thus in the end&#10;Good fortune comes from without.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hold to him in truth and loyalty;&#10;This is without blame.&#10;Truth, like a full earthen bowl:&#10;Thus in the end&#10;Good fortune comes from without.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hold to him inwardly.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hold to him inwardly.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You hold together with the wrong people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You hold together with the wrong people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hold to him outwardly also.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hold to him outwardly also.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Manifestation of holding together.&#10;In the hunt the king uses beaters on three sides only&#10;And foregoes game that runs off in front.&#10;The citizens need no warning.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Manifestation of holding together.&#10;In the hunt the king uses beaters on three sides only&#10;And foregoes game that runs off in front.&#10;The citizens need no warning.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Union</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">比</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He finds no head for holding together.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He finds no head for holding together.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsiâo Khû indicates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and success. (We see) dense clouds, but no rain coming from our borders in the west.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsiâo Khû indicates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and success. (We see) dense clouds, but no rain coming from our borders in the west.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the sky, and that representing wind moving above it, form Hsiâo Khû The superior man, in accordance with this, adorns the outward manifestation of his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the sky, and that representing wind moving above it, form Hsiâo Khû The superior man, in accordance with this, adorns the outward manifestation of his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject returning and pursuing his own course. What mistake should he fall into? There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject returning and pursuing his own course. What mistake should he fall into? There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject, by the attraction (of the former line), returning (to the proper course). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject, by the attraction (of the former line), returning (to the proper course). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, suggests the idea of a carriage, the strap beneath which has been removed, or of a husband and wife looking on each other with averted eyes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, suggests the idea of a carriage, the strap beneath which has been removed, or of a husband and wife looking on each other with averted eyes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject possessed of sincerity. The danger of bloodshed is thereby averted, and his (ground for) apprehension dismissed. There will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject possessed of sincerity. The danger of bloodshed is thereby averted, and his (ground for) apprehension dismissed. There will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject possessed of sincerity, and drawing others to unite with him. Rich in resources, he employs his neighbours (in the same cause with himself).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject possessed of sincerity, and drawing others to unite with him. Rich in resources, he employs his neighbours (in the same cause with himself).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows how the rain has fallen, and the (onward progress) is stayed;—(so) must we value the full accumulation of the virtue (represented by the upper trigram). But a wife (exercising restraint), however firm and correct she may be, is in a position of peril, (and like) the moon approaching to the full. If the superior man prosecute his measures (in such circumstances), there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows how the rain has fallen, and the (onward progress) is stayed;—(so) must we value the full accumulation of the virtue (represented by the upper trigram). But a wife (exercising restraint), however firm and correct she may be, is in a position of peril, (and like) the moon approaching to the full. If the superior man prosecute his measures (in such circumstances), there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE TAMING POWER OF THE SMALL&#10;Has success.&#10;Dense clouds, no rain from our western region.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE TAMING POWER OF THE SMALL&#10;Has success.&#10;Dense clouds, no rain from our western region.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind drives across heaven:&#10;The image of THE TAMING POWER OF THE SMALL.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Refines the outward aspect of his nature.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind drives across heaven:&#10;The image of THE TAMING POWER OF THE SMALL.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Refines the outward aspect of his nature.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Return to the way.&#10;How could there be blame in this?&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Return to the way.&#10;How could there be blame in this?&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He allows himself to be drawn into returning.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He allows himself to be drawn into returning.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The spokes burst out of the wagon wheels.&#10;Man and wife roll their eyes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The spokes burst out of the wagon wheels.&#10;Man and wife roll their eyes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you are sincere, blood vanishes and fear gives way.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you are sincere, blood vanishes and fear gives way.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you are sincere and loyally attached,&#10;You are rich in your neighbor.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you are sincere and loyally attached,&#10;You are rich in your neighbor.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">9</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The rain comes, there is rest.&#10;This is due to the lasting effect of character.&#10;Perseverance brings the woman into danger.&#10;The moon is nearly full.&#10;If the superior man persists,&#10;Misfortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The rain comes, there is rest.&#10;This is due to the lasting effect of character.&#10;Perseverance brings the woman into danger.&#10;The moon is nearly full.&#10;If the superior man persists,&#10;Misfortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Lî suggests the idea of) one treading on the tail of a tiger, which does not bite him. There will be progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Lî suggests the idea of) one treading on the tail of a tiger, which does not bite him. There will be progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the sky above, and below it (that representing the waters of) a marsh, form Lî. The superior man, in accordance with this, discriminates between high and low, and gives settlement to the aims of the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the sky above, and below it (that representing the waters of) a marsh, form Lî. The superior man, in accordance with this, discriminates between high and low, and gives settlement to the aims of the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject treading his accustomed path. If he go forward, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject treading his accustomed path. If he go forward, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject treading the path that is level and easy;—a quiet and solitary man, to whom, if he be firm and correct, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject treading the path that is level and easy;—a quiet and solitary man, to whom, if he be firm and correct, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows a one-eyed man (who thinks he) can see; a lame man (who thinks he) can walk well; one who treads on the tail of a tiger and is bitten. (All this indicates) ill fortune. We have a (mere) bravo acting the part of a great ruler.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows a one-eyed man (who thinks he) can see; a lame man (who thinks he) can walk well; one who treads on the tail of a tiger and is bitten. (All this indicates) ill fortune. We have a (mere) bravo acting the part of a great ruler.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject treading on the tail of a tiger. He becomes full of apprehensive caution, and in the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject treading on the tail of a tiger. He becomes full of apprehensive caution, and in the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the resolute tread of its subject. Though he be firm and correct, there will be peril.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the resolute tread of its subject. Though he be firm and correct, there will be peril.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, tells us to look at (the whole course) that is trodden, and examine the presage which that gives. If it be complete and without failure, there will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, tells us to look at (the whole course) that is trodden, and examine the presage which that gives. If it be complete and without failure, there will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">TREADING. Treading upon the tail of the tiger.&#10;It does not bite the man. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">TREADING. Treading upon the tail of the tiger.&#10;It does not bite the man. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven above, the lake below:&#10;The image of TREADING.&#10;Thus the superior man discriminates between high and low,&#10;And thereby fortifies the thinking of the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven above, the lake below:&#10;The image of TREADING.&#10;Thus the superior man discriminates between high and low,&#10;And thereby fortifies the thinking of the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Simple conduct. Progress without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Simple conduct. Progress without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Treading a smooth, level course.&#10;The perseverance of a dark man&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Treading a smooth, level course.&#10;The perseverance of a dark man&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A one-eyed man is able to see,&#10;A lame man is able to tread.&#10;He treads on the tail of the tiger.&#10;The tiger bites the man.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;Thus does a warrior act on behalf of his great prince.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A one-eyed man is able to see,&#10;A lame man is able to tread.&#10;He treads on the tail of the tiger.&#10;The tiger bites the man.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;Thus does a warrior act on behalf of his great prince.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He treads on the tail of the tiger.&#10;Caution and circumspection&#10;Lead ultimately to good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He treads on the tail of the tiger.&#10;Caution and circumspection&#10;Lead ultimately to good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Resolute conduct.&#10;Perseverance with awareness of danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Resolute conduct.&#10;Perseverance with awareness of danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">10</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fulfillment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">履</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Look to your conduct and weigh the favorable signs.&#10;When everything is fulfilled, supreme good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Look to your conduct and weigh the favorable signs.&#10;When everything is fulfilled, supreme good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Thâi (we see) the little gone and the great come. (It indicates that) there will be good fortune, with progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Thâi (we see) the little gone and the great come. (It indicates that) there will be good fortune, with progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams for) heaven and earth in communication together form Thâi. The (sage) sovereign, in harmony with this, fashions and completes (his regulations) after the courses of heaven and earth, and assists the application of the adaptations furnished by them,—in order to benefit the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams for) heaven and earth in communication together form Thâi. The (sage) sovereign, in harmony with this, fashions and completes (his regulations) after the courses of heaven and earth, and assists the application of the adaptations furnished by them,—in order to benefit the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, suggests the idea of grass pulled up, and bringing with it other stalks with whose roots it is connected. Advance (on the part of its subject) will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, suggests the idea of grass pulled up, and bringing with it other stalks with whose roots it is connected. Advance (on the part of its subject) will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows one who can bear with the uncultivated, will cross the Ho without a boat, does not forget the distant, and has no (selfish) friendships. Thus does he prove himself acting in accordance with the course of the due Mean.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows one who can bear with the uncultivated, will cross the Ho without a boat, does not forget the distant, and has no (selfish) friendships. Thus does he prove himself acting in accordance with the course of the due Mean.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows that, while there is no state of peace that is not liable to be disturbed, and no departure (of evil men) so that they shall not return, yet when one is firm and correct, as he realises the distresses that may arise, he will commit no error. There is no occasion for sadness at the certainty (of such recurring changes); and in this mood the happiness (of the present) may be (long) enjoyed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows that, while there is no state of peace that is not liable to be disturbed, and no departure (of evil men) so that they shall not return, yet when one is firm and correct, as he realises the distresses that may arise, he will commit no error. There is no occasion for sadness at the certainty (of such recurring changes); and in this mood the happiness (of the present) may be (long) enjoyed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject fluttering (down);—not relying on his own rich resources, but calling in his neighbours. (They all come) not as having received warning, but in the sincerity (of their hearts).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject fluttering (down);—not relying on his own rich resources, but calling in his neighbours. (They all come) not as having received warning, but in the sincerity (of their hearts).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, reminds us of (king) Tî-yî’s (rule about the) marriage of his younger sister. By such a course there is happiness and there will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, reminds us of (king) Tî-yî’s (rule about the) marriage of his younger sister. By such a course there is happiness and there will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth six, divided, shows us the city wall returned into the moat. It is not the time to use the army. (The subject of the line) may, indeed, announce his orders to the people of his own city; but however correct and firm he may be, he will have cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth six, divided, shows us the city wall returned into the moat. It is not the time to use the army. (The subject of the line) may, indeed, announce his orders to the people of his own city; but however correct and firm he may be, he will have cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PEACE. The small departs,&#10;The great approaches.&#10;Good fortune. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PEACE. The small departs,&#10;The great approaches.&#10;Good fortune. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven and earth unite: the image of PEACE.&#10;Thus the ruler&#10;Divides and completes the course of heaven and earth;&#10;He furthers and regulates the gifts of heaven and earth,&#10;And so aids the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven and earth unite: the image of PEACE.&#10;Thus the ruler&#10;Divides and completes the course of heaven and earth;&#10;He furthers and regulates the gifts of heaven and earth,&#10;And so aids the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When ribbon grass is pulled up, the sod comes with it.&#10;Each according to his kind.&#10;Undertakings bring good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When ribbon grass is pulled up, the sod comes with it.&#10;Each according to his kind.&#10;Undertakings bring good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bearing with the uncultured in gentleness,&#10;Fording the river with resolution,&#10;Not neglecting what is distant,&#10;Not regarding one’s companions:&#10;Thus one may manage to walk in the middle.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bearing with the uncultured in gentleness,&#10;Fording the river with resolution,&#10;Not neglecting what is distant,&#10;Not regarding one’s companions:&#10;Thus one may manage to walk in the middle.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No plain not followed by a slope.&#10;No going not followed by a return.&#10;He who remains persevering in danger&#10;Is without blame.&#10;Do not complain about this truth;&#10;Enjoy the good fortune you still possess.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No plain not followed by a slope.&#10;No going not followed by a return.&#10;He who remains persevering in danger&#10;Is without blame.&#10;Do not complain about this truth;&#10;Enjoy the good fortune you still possess.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He flutters down, not boasting of his wealth,&#10;Together with his neighbor,&#10;Guileless and sincere.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He flutters down, not boasting of his wealth,&#10;Together with his neighbor,&#10;Guileless and sincere.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sovereign I&#10;Gives his daughter in marriage.&#10;This brings blessing&#10;And supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sovereign I&#10;Gives his daughter in marriage.&#10;This brings blessing&#10;And supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">11</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Advance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">泰</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wall falls back into the moat.&#10;Use no army now.&#10;Make your commands known within your own town.&#10;Perseverance brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wall falls back into the moat.&#10;Use no army now.&#10;Make your commands known within your own town.&#10;Perseverance brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Phî there is the want of good understanding between the (different classes of) men, and its indication is unfavourable to the firm and correct course of the superior man. We see in it the great gone and the little come.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Phî there is the want of good understanding between the (different classes of) men, and its indication is unfavourable to the firm and correct course of the superior man. We see in it the great gone and the little come.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams of) heaven and earth, not in intercommunication, form Phî. The superior man, in accordance with this, restrains (the manifestation) of) his virtue, and avoids the calamities (that threaten him). There is no opportunity of conferring on him the glory of emolument.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams of) heaven and earth, not in intercommunication, form Phî. The superior man, in accordance with this, restrains (the manifestation) of) his virtue, and avoids the calamities (that threaten him). There is no opportunity of conferring on him the glory of emolument.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, suggests the idea of grass pulled up, and bringing with it other stalks with whose roots it is connected. With firm correctness (on the part of its subject), there will be good fortune and progress.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, suggests the idea of grass pulled up, and bringing with it other stalks with whose roots it is connected. With firm correctness (on the part of its subject), there will be good fortune and progress.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject patient and obedient. To the small man (comporting himself so) there will be good fortune. If the great man (comport himself) as the distress and obstruction require, he will have success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject patient and obedient. To the small man (comporting himself so) there will be good fortune. If the great man (comport himself) as the distress and obstruction require, he will have success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject ashamed of the purpose folded (in his breast).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject ashamed of the purpose folded (in his breast).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject acting in accordance with the ordination (of Heaven), and committing no error. His companions will come and share in his happiness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject acting in accordance with the ordination (of Heaven), and committing no error. His companions will come and share in his happiness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fifth line, undivided, we see him who brings the distress and obstruction to a close,—the great man and fortunate. (But let him say), ‘We may perish! We may perish!’ (so shall the state of things become firm, as if) bound to a clump of bushy mulberry trees.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fifth line, undivided, we see him who brings the distress and obstruction to a close,—the great man and fortunate. (But let him say), ‘We may perish! We may perish!’ (so shall the state of things become firm, as if) bound to a clump of bushy mulberry trees.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the overthrow (and removal of) the condition of distress and obstruction. Before this there was that condition. Hereafter there will be joy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the overthrow (and removal of) the condition of distress and obstruction. Before this there was that condition. Hereafter there will be joy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">STANDSTILL. Evil people do not further&#10;The perseverance of the superior man.&#10;The great departs; the small approaches.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">STANDSTILL. Evil people do not further&#10;The perseverance of the superior man.&#10;The great departs; the small approaches.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven and earth do not unite:&#10;The image of STANDSTILL.&#10;Thus the superior man falls back upon his inner worth&#10;In order to escape the difficulties.&#10;He does not permit himself to be honored with revenue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven and earth do not unite:&#10;The image of STANDSTILL.&#10;Thus the superior man falls back upon his inner worth&#10;In order to escape the difficulties.&#10;He does not permit himself to be honored with revenue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When ribbon grass is pulled up, the sod comes with it.&#10;Each according to his kind.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When ribbon grass is pulled up, the sod comes with it.&#10;Each according to his kind.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">They bear and endure;&#10;This means good fortune for inferior people.&#10;The standstill serves to help the great man to attain success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">They bear and endure;&#10;This means good fortune for inferior people.&#10;The standstill serves to help the great man to attain success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">They bear shame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">They bear shame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who acts at the command of the highest&#10;Remains without blame.&#10;Those of like mind partake of the blessing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who acts at the command of the highest&#10;Remains without blame.&#10;Those of like mind partake of the blessing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Standstill is giving way.&#10;Good fortune for the great man.&#10;“What if it should fail, what if it should fail?”&#10;In this way he ties it to a cluster of mulberry shoots.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Standstill is giving way.&#10;Good fortune for the great man.&#10;“What if it should fail, what if it should fail?”&#10;In this way he ties it to a cluster of mulberry shoots.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">12</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hindrance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">否</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The standstill comes to an end.&#10;First standstill, then good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The standstill comes to an end.&#10;First standstill, then good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zăn (or ‘Union of men‘) appears here (as we find it) in the (remote districts of the) country, indicating progress and success. It will be advantageous to cross the great stream. It will be advantageous to maintain the firm correctness of the superior man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zăn (or ‘Union of men‘) appears here (as we find it) in the (remote districts of the) country, indicating progress and success. It will be advantageous to cross the great stream. It will be advantageous to maintain the firm correctness of the superior man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams for) heaven and fire form Thung Zăn. The superior man, in accordance with this), distinguishes things according to their kinds and classes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams for) heaven and fire form Thung Zăn. The superior man, in accordance with this), distinguishes things according to their kinds and classes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, (shows the representative of) the union of men just issuing from his gate. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, (shows the representative of) the union of men just issuing from his gate. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, (shows the representative of) the union of men in relation with his kindred. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, (shows the representative of) the union of men in relation with his kindred. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, (shows its subject) with his arms hidden in the thick grass, and at the top of a high mound. (But) for three years he makes no demonstration.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, (shows its subject) with his arms hidden in the thick grass, and at the top of a high mound. (But) for three years he makes no demonstration.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, (shows its subject) mounted on the city wall; but he does not proceed to make the attack (he contemplates). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, (shows its subject) mounted on the city wall; but he does not proceed to make the attack (he contemplates). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fifth line, undivided, (the representative of) the union of men first wails and cries out, and then laughs. His great host conquers, and he (and the subject of the second line) meet together.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the fifth line, undivided, (the representative of) the union of men first wails and cries out, and then laughs. His great host conquers, and he (and the subject of the second line) meet together.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thung Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, (shows the representative of) the union of men in the suburbs. There will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, (shows the representative of) the union of men in the suburbs. There will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">FELLOWSHIP WITH MEN in the open.&#10;Success.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;The perseverance of the superior man furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">FELLOWSHIP WITH MEN in the open.&#10;Success.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;The perseverance of the superior man furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven together with fire:&#10;The image of FELLOWSHIP WITH MEN.&#10;Thus the superior man organizes the clans&#10;And makes distinctions between things.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven together with fire:&#10;The image of FELLOWSHIP WITH MEN.&#10;Thus the superior man organizes the clans&#10;And makes distinctions between things.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fellowship with men at the gate.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fellowship with men at the gate.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fellowship with men in the clan.&#10;Humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fellowship with men in the clan.&#10;Humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He hides weapons in the thicket;&#10;He climbs the high hill in front of it.&#10;For three years he does not rise up.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He hides weapons in the thicket;&#10;He climbs the high hill in front of it.&#10;For three years he does not rise up.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He climbs up on his wall; he cannot attack.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He climbs up on his wall; he cannot attack.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Men bound in fellowship first weep and lament,&#10;But afterward they laugh.&#10;After great struggles they succeed in meeting.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Men bound in fellowship first weep and lament,&#10;But afterward they laugh.&#10;After great struggles they succeed in meeting.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">13</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking Harmony</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">同人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fellowship with men in the meadow.&#10;No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fellowship with men in the meadow.&#10;No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tâ Yû indicates that, (under the circumstances which it implies), there will be great progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tâ Yû indicates that, (under the circumstances which it implies), there will be great progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) heaven and (that of) fire above it form Tâ Yû The superior man, in accordance with this, represses what is evil and gives distinction to what is good, in sympathy with the excellent Heaven-conferred (nature).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) heaven and (that of) fire above it form Tâ Yû The superior man, in accordance with this, represses what is evil and gives distinction to what is good, in sympathy with the excellent Heaven-conferred (nature).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the first line, undivided, there is no approach to what is injurious, and there is no error. Let there be a realisation of the difficulty (and danger of the position), and there will be no error (to the end).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the first line, undivided, there is no approach to what is injurious, and there is no error. Let there be a realisation of the difficulty (and danger of the position), and there will be no error (to the end).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the second line, undivided, we have a large waggon with its load. In whatever direction advance is made, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the second line, undivided, we have a large waggon with its load. In whatever direction advance is made, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows us a feudal prince presenting his offerings to the Son of Heaven. A small man would be unequal (to such a duty).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows us a feudal prince presenting his offerings to the Son of Heaven. A small man would be unequal (to such a duty).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject keeping his great resources under restraint. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject keeping his great resources under restraint. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows the sincerity of its subject reciprocated by that of all the others (represented in the hexagram). Let him display a proper majesty, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows the sincerity of its subject reciprocated by that of all the others (represented in the hexagram). Let him display a proper majesty, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject with help accorded to him from Heaven. There will be good fortune, advantage in every respect.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject with help accorded to him from Heaven. There will be good fortune, advantage in every respect.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">POSSESSION IN GREAT MEASURE.&#10;Supreme success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">POSSESSION IN GREAT MEASURE.&#10;Supreme success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire in heaven above:&#10;The image of POSSESSION IN GREAT&#10;MEASURE.&#10;Thus the superior man curbs evil and furthers good,&#10;And thereby obeys the benevolent will of heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire in heaven above:&#10;The image of POSSESSION IN GREAT&#10;MEASURE.&#10;Thus the superior man curbs evil and furthers good,&#10;And thereby obeys the benevolent will of heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No relationship with what is harmful;&#10;There is no blame in this.&#10;If one remains conscious of difficulty,&#10;One remains without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No relationship with what is harmful;&#10;There is no blame in this.&#10;If one remains conscious of difficulty,&#10;One remains without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A big wagon for loading.&#10;One may undertake something.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A big wagon for loading.&#10;One may undertake something.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A prince offers it to the Son of Heaven.&#10;A petty man cannot do this.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A prince offers it to the Son of Heaven.&#10;A petty man cannot do this.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He makes a difference&#10;Between himself and his neighbor.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He makes a difference&#10;Between himself and his neighbor.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He whose truth is accessible, yet dignified,&#10;Has good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He whose truth is accessible, yet dignified,&#10;Has good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">14</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Harvest</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大有</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He is blessed by heaven.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;Nothing that does not further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He is blessed by heaven.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;Nothing that does not further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien indicates progress and success. The superior man, (being humble as it implies), will have a (good) issue (to his undertakings).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien indicates progress and success. The superior man, (being humble as it implies), will have a (good) issue (to his undertakings).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) the earth and (that of) a mountain in the midst of it form Khien. The superior man, in accordance with this, diminishes what is excessive (in himself), and increases where there is any defect, bringing about an equality, according to the nature of the case, in his treatment (of himself and others).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) the earth and (that of) a mountain in the midst of it form Khien. The superior man, in accordance with this, diminishes what is excessive (in himself), and increases where there is any defect, bringing about an equality, according to the nature of the case, in his treatment (of himself and others).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows us the superior man who adds humility to humility. (Even) the great stream may be crossed with this, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows us the superior man who adds humility to humility. (Even) the great stream may be crossed with this, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows us humility that has made itself recognised. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows us humility that has made itself recognised. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows the superior man of (acknowledged) merit. He will maintain his success to the end, and have good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows the superior man of (acknowledged) merit. He will maintain his success to the end, and have good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one, whose action would be in every way advantageous, stirring up (the more) his humility.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one, whose action would be in every way advantageous, stirring up (the more) his humility.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one who, without being rich, is able to employ his neighbours. He may advantageously use the force of arms. All his movements will be advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one who, without being rich, is able to employ his neighbours. He may advantageously use the force of arms. All his movements will be advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows us humility that has made itself recognised. The subject of it will with advantage put his hosts in motion; but (he will only) punish his own towns and state.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows us humility that has made itself recognised. The subject of it will with advantage put his hosts in motion; but (he will only) punish his own towns and state.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MODESTY creates success.&#10;The superior man carries things through.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">MODESTY creates success.&#10;The superior man carries things through.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Within the earth, a mountain:&#10;The image of MODESTY.&#10;Thus the superior man reduces that which is too much,&#10;And augments that which is too little.&#10;He weighs things and makes them equal.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Within the earth, a mountain:&#10;The image of MODESTY.&#10;Thus the superior man reduces that which is too much,&#10;And augments that which is too little.&#10;He weighs things and makes them equal.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A superior man modest about his modesty&#10;May cross the great water.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A superior man modest about his modesty&#10;May cross the great water.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Modesty that comes to expression.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Modesty that comes to expression.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A superior man of modesty and merit&#10;Carries things to conclusion.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A superior man of modesty and merit&#10;Carries things to conclusion.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nothing that would not further modesty&#10;In movement.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nothing that would not further modesty&#10;In movement.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No boasting of wealth before one’s neighbor.&#10;It is favorable to attack with force.&#10;Nothing that would not further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No boasting of wealth before one’s neighbor.&#10;It is favorable to attack with force.&#10;Nothing that would not further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">15</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Humbleness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">謙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Modesty that comes to expression.&#10;It is favorable to set armies marching&#10;To chastise one’s own city and one’s country.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Modesty that comes to expression.&#10;It is favorable to set armies marching&#10;To chastise one’s own city and one’s country.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yü indicates that, (in the state which it implies), feudal princes may be set up, and the hosts put in motion, with advantage.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yü indicates that, (in the state which it implies), feudal princes may be set up, and the hosts put in motion, with advantage.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams for) the earth and thunder issuing from it with its crashing noise form Yü. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, composed their music and did honour to virtue, presenting it especially and most grandly to God, when they associated with Him (at the service) their highest ancestor and their father.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams for) the earth and thunder issuing from it with its crashing noise form Yü. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, composed their music and did honour to virtue, presenting it especially and most grandly to God, when they associated with Him (at the service) their highest ancestor and their father.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject proclaiming his pleasure and satisfaction. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject proclaiming his pleasure and satisfaction. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one who is firm as a rock. (He sees a thing) without waiting till it has come to pass; with his firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one who is firm as a rock. (He sees a thing) without waiting till it has come to pass; with his firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one looking up (for favours), while he indulges the feeling of pleasure and satisfaction. If he would understand!—If he be late in doing so, there will indeed be occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one looking up (for favours), while he indulges the feeling of pleasure and satisfaction. If he would understand!—If he be late in doing so, there will indeed be occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows him from whom the harmony and satisfaction come. Great is the success which he obtains. Let him not allow suspicions to enter his mind, and thus friends will gather around him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows him from whom the harmony and satisfaction come. Great is the success which he obtains. Let him not allow suspicions to enter his mind, and thus friends will gather around him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows one with a chronic complaint, but who lives on without dying.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows one with a chronic complaint, but who lives on without dying.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost six, divided, shows its subject with darkened mind devoted to the pleasure and satisfaction (of the time); but if he change his course even when (it may be considered as) completed, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost six, divided, shows its subject with darkened mind devoted to the pleasure and satisfaction (of the time); but if he change his course even when (it may be considered as) completed, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ENTHUSIASM. It furthers one to install helpers&#10;And to set armies marching.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ENTHUSIASM. It furthers one to install helpers&#10;And to set armies marching.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder comes resounding out of the earth:&#10;The image of ENTHUSIASM.&#10;Thus the ancient kings made music&#10;In order to honor merit,&#10;And offered it with splendor&#10;To the Supreme Deity,&#10;Inviting their ancestors to be present.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder comes resounding out of the earth:&#10;The image of ENTHUSIASM.&#10;Thus the ancient kings made music&#10;In order to honor merit,&#10;And offered it with splendor&#10;To the Supreme Deity,&#10;Inviting their ancestors to be present.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Enthusiasm that expresses itself&#10;Brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Enthusiasm that expresses itself&#10;Brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Firm as a rock. Not a whole day.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Firm as a rock. Not a whole day.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Enthusiasm that looks upward creates remorse.&#10;Hesitation brings remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Enthusiasm that looks upward creates remorse.&#10;Hesitation brings remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The source of enthusiasm.&#10;He achieves great things.&#10;Doubt not.&#10;You gather friends around you&#10;As a hair clasp gathers the hair.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The source of enthusiasm.&#10;He achieves great things.&#10;Doubt not.&#10;You gather friends around you&#10;As a hair clasp gathers the hair.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Persistently ill, and still does not die.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Persistently ill, and still does not die.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">16</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Delight</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豫</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deluded enthusiasm.&#10;But if after completion one changes,&#10;There is no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deluded enthusiasm.&#10;But if after completion one changes,&#10;There is no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui indicates that (under its conditions) there will be great progress and success. But it will be advantageous to be firm and correct. There will (then) be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui indicates that (under its conditions) there will be great progress and success. But it will be advantageous to be firm and correct. There will (then) be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for the waters of) a marsh and (that for) thunder (hidden) in the midst of it form Sui. The superior man in accordance with this, when it is getting towards dark, enters (his house) and rests.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for the waters of) a marsh and (that for) thunder (hidden) in the midst of it form Sui. The superior man in accordance with this, when it is getting towards dark, enters (his house) and rests.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows us one changing the object of his pursuit; but if he be firm and correct, there will he good fortune. Going beyond (his own) gate to find associates, he will achieve merit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows us one changing the object of his pursuit; but if he be firm and correct, there will he good fortune. Going beyond (his own) gate to find associates, he will achieve merit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows us one who cleaves to the little boy, and lets go the man of age and experience.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows us one who cleaves to the little boy, and lets go the man of age and experience.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows us one who cleaves to the man of age and experience, and lets go. the little boy. Such following will get what it seeks; but it will be advantageous to adhere to what is firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows us one who cleaves to the man of age and experience, and lets go. the little boy. Such following will get what it seeks; but it will be advantageous to adhere to what is firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows us one followed and obtaining (adherents). Though he be firm and correct, there will be evil. If he be sincere (however) in his course, and make that evident, into what error will he fall?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows us one followed and obtaining (adherents). Though he be firm and correct, there will be evil. If he be sincere (however) in his course, and make that evident, into what error will he fall?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows us (the ruler) sincere in (fostering all) that is excellent. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows us (the ruler) sincere in (fostering all) that is excellent. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows us (that sincerity) firmly held and clung to, yea, and bound fast. (We see) the king with it presenting his offerings on the western mountain.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows us (that sincerity) firmly held and clung to, yea, and bound fast. (We see) the king with it presenting his offerings on the western mountain.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">FOLLOWING has supreme success.&#10;Perseverance furthers. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">FOLLOWING has supreme success.&#10;Perseverance furthers. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder in the middle of the lake:&#10;The image of FOLLOWING.&#10;Thus the superior man at nightfall&#10;Goes indoors for rest and recuperation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder in the middle of the lake:&#10;The image of FOLLOWING.&#10;Thus the superior man at nightfall&#10;Goes indoors for rest and recuperation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The standard is changing.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;To go out of the door in company&#10;Produces deeds.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The standard is changing.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;To go out of the door in company&#10;Produces deeds.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one clings to the little boy,&#10;One loses the strong man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one clings to the little boy,&#10;One loses the strong man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one clings to the strong man,&#10;One loses the little boy.&#10;Through following one finds what one seeks.&#10;It furthers one to remain persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one clings to the strong man,&#10;One loses the little boy.&#10;Through following one finds what one seeks.&#10;It furthers one to remain persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following creates success.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.&#10;To go one’s way with sincerity brings clarity.&#10;How could there be blame in this?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following creates success.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.&#10;To go one’s way with sincerity brings clarity.&#10;How could there be blame in this?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sincere in the good. Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sincere in the good. Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">17</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Following</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">隨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He meets with firm allegiance&#10;And is still further bound.&#10;The king introduces him&#10;To the Western Mountain.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He meets with firm allegiance&#10;And is still further bound.&#10;The king introduces him&#10;To the Western Mountain.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kû indicates great progress and success (to him who deals properly with the condition represented by it). There will be advantage in (efforts like that of) crossing the great stream. (He should weigh well, however, the events of) three days before the turning point, and those (to be done) three days after it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kû indicates great progress and success (to him who deals properly with the condition represented by it). There will be advantage in (efforts like that of) crossing the great stream. (He should weigh well, however, the events of) three days before the turning point, and those (to be done) three days after it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) a mountain, and below it that for wind, form Kû. The superior man, in accordance with this, (addresses himself to) help the people and nourish his own virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) a mountain, and below it that for wind, form Kû. The superior man, in accordance with this, (addresses himself to) help the people and nourish his own virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his father. If he be an (able) son, the father will escape the blame of having erred. The position is perilous, but there will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his father. If he be an (able) son, the father will escape the blame of having erred. The position is perilous, but there will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his mother. He should not (carry) his firm correctness (to the utmost).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his mother. He should not (carry) his firm correctness (to the utmost).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his father. There may be some small occasion for repentance, but there will not be any great error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his father. There may be some small occasion for repentance, but there will not be any great error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows (a son) viewing indulgently the troubles caused by his father. If he go forward, he will find cause to regret it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows (a son) viewing indulgently the troubles caused by his father. If he go forward, he will find cause to regret it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his father. He obtains the praise of using (the fit instrument for his work).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows (a son) dealing with the troubles caused by his father. He obtains the praise of using (the fit instrument for his work).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ku</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows us one who does not serve either king or feudal lord, but in a lofty spirit prefers (to attend to) his own affairs.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows us one who does not serve either king or feudal lord, but in a lofty spirit prefers (to attend to) his own affairs.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">WORK ON WHAT HAS BEEN SPOILED&#10;Has supreme success.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;Before the starting point, three days.&#10;After the starting point, three days.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">WORK ON WHAT HAS BEEN SPOILED&#10;Has supreme success.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;Before the starting point, three days.&#10;After the starting point, three days.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind blows low on the mountain:&#10;The image of DECAY.&#10;Thus the superior man stirs up the people&#10;And strengthens their spirit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind blows low on the mountain:&#10;The image of DECAY.&#10;Thus the superior man stirs up the people&#10;And strengthens their spirit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;If there is a son,&#10;No blame rests upon the departed father.&#10;Danger. In the end good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;If there is a son,&#10;No blame rests upon the departed father.&#10;Danger. In the end good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the mother.&#10;One must not be too persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the mother.&#10;One must not be too persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;There will be a little remorse. No great blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;There will be a little remorse. No great blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tolerating what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;In continuing one sees humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tolerating what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;In continuing one sees humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;One meets with praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Setting right what has been spoiled by the father.&#10;One meets with praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">18</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remedying</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蠱</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He does not serve kings and princes,&#10;Sets himself higher goals.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He does not serve kings and princes,&#10;Sets himself higher goals.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin (indicates that under the conditions supposed in it) there will be great progress and success, while it will be advantageous to be firmly correct. In the eighth month there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin (indicates that under the conditions supposed in it) there will be great progress and success, while it will be advantageous to be firmly correct. In the eighth month there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) the waters of a marsh and that for the earth above it form Lin. The superior man, in accordance with this, has his purposes of instruction that are inexhaustible, and nourishes and supports the people without limit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) the waters of a marsh and that for the earth above it form Lin. The superior man, in accordance with this, has his purposes of instruction that are inexhaustible, and nourishes and supports the people without limit.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject advancing in company (with the subject of the second line). Through his firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject advancing in company (with the subject of the second line). Through his firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject advancing in company (with the subject of the first line). There will be good fortune; (advancing) will be in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject advancing in company (with the subject of the first line). There will be good fortune; (advancing) will be in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one well pleased (indeed) to advance, (but whose action) will be in no way advantageous. If he become anxious about it (however), there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one well pleased (indeed) to advance, (but whose action) will be in no way advantageous. If he become anxious about it (however), there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one advancing in the highest mode. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one advancing in the highest mode. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows the advance of wisdom, such as befits the great ruler. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows the advance of wisdom, such as befits the great ruler. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows the advance of honesty and generosity. There will be good fortune, and no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows the advance of honesty and generosity. There will be good fortune, and no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">APPROACH has supreme success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;When the eighth month comes,&#10;There will be misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">APPPROACH has supreme success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;When the eighth month comes,&#10;There will be misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The earth above the lake:&#10;The image of APPROACH.&#10;Thus the superior man is inexhaustible&#10;In his will to teach,&#10;And without limits&#10;In his tolerance and protection of the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The earth above the lake:&#10;The image of APPROACH.&#10;Thus the superior man is inexhaustible&#10;In his will to teach,&#10;And without limits&#10;In his tolerance and protection of the people.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joint approach.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joint approach.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joint approach.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;Everything furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joint approach.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;Everything furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Comfortable approach.&#10;Nothing that would further.&#10;If one is induced to grieve over it,&#10;One becomes free of blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Comfortable approach.&#10;Nothing that would further.&#10;If one is induced to grieve over it,&#10;One becomes free of blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Complete approach.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Complete approach.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wise approach.&#10;This is right for a great prince.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wise approach.&#10;This is right for a great prince.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">19</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Approaching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">臨</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Greathearted approach.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Greathearted approach.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwân shows (how he whom it represents should be like) the worshipper who has washed his hands, but not (yet) presented his offerings;—with sincerity and an appearance of dignity (commanding reverent regard).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwân shows (how he whom it represents should be like) the worshipper who has washed his hands, but not (yet) presented his offerings;—with sincerity and an appearance of dignity (commanding reverent regard).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth, and that for wind moving above it, form Kwan. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, examined the (different) regions (of the kingdom), to see the (ways of the) people, and set forth their instructions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth, and that for wind moving above it, form Kwan. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, examined the (different) regions (of the kingdom), to see the (ways of the) people, and set forth their instructions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the looking of a lad;—not blamable in men of inferior rank, but matter for regret in superior men.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the looking of a lad;—not blamable in men of inferior rank, but matter for regret in superior men.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one peeping out from a door. It would be advantageous if it were (merely) the firm correctness of a female.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one peeping out from a door. It would be advantageous if it were (merely) the firm correctness of a female.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one looking at (the course of) his own life, to advance or recede (accordingly).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one looking at (the course of) his own life, to advance or recede (accordingly).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one contemplating the glory of the kingdom. It will be advantageous for him, being such as he is, (to seek) to be a guest of the king.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one contemplating the glory of the kingdom. It will be advantageous for him, being such as he is, (to seek) to be a guest of the king.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject contemplating his own life(-course). A superior man, he will (thus) fall into no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject contemplating his own life(-course). A superior man, he will (thus) fall into no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject contemplating his character to see if it be indeed that of a superior man. He will not fall into error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject contemplating his character to see if it be indeed that of a superior man. He will not fall into error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CONTEMPLATION. The ablution has been made,&#10;But not yet the offering.&#10;Full of trust they look up to him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">CONTEMPLATION. The ablution has been made,&#10;But not yet the offering.&#10;Full of trust they look up to him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind blows over the earth:&#10;The image of CONTEMPLATION.&#10;Thus the kings of old visited the regions of the world,&#10;Contemplated the people,&#10;And gave them instruction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind blows over the earth:&#10;The image of CONTEMPLATION.&#10;Thus the kings of old visited the regions of the world,&#10;Contemplated the people,&#10;And gave them instruction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Boylike contemplation.&#10;For an inferior man, no blame.&#10;For a superior man, humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Boylike contemplation.&#10;For an inferior man, no blame.&#10;For a superior man, humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation through the crack of the door.&#10;Furthering for the perseverance of a woman.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation through the crack of the door.&#10;Furthering for the perseverance of a woman.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of my life&#10;Decides the choice&#10;Between advance and retreat.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of my life&#10;Decides the choice&#10;Between advance and retreat.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of the light of the kingdom.&#10;It furthers one to exert influence as the guest of a king.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of the light of the kingdom.&#10;It furthers one to exert influence as the guest of a king.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of my life.&#10;The superior man is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of my life.&#10;The superior man is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">20</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Watching</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">觀</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of his life.&#10;The superior man is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contemplation of his life.&#10;The superior man is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho indicates successful progress (in the condition of things which it supposes). It will be advantageous to use legal constraints.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho indicates successful progress (in the condition of things which it supposes). It will be advantageous to use legal constraints.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams representing) thunder and lightning form Shih Ho. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, framed their penalties with intelligence, and promulgated their laws.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams representing) thunder and lightning form Shih Ho. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, framed their penalties with intelligence, and promulgated their laws.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows one with his feet in the stocks and deprived of his toes. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows one with his feet in the stocks and deprived of his toes. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one biting through the soft flesh, and (going on to) bite off the nose. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one biting through the soft flesh, and (going on to) bite off the nose. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one gnawing dried flesh, and meeting with what is disagreeable. There will be occasion for some small regret, but no (great) error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one gnawing dried flesh, and meeting with what is disagreeable. There will be occasion for some small regret, but no (great) error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows one gnawing the flesh dried on the bone, and getting the pledges of money and arrows. It will be advantageous to him to realise the difficulty of his task and be firm,—in which case there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows one gnawing the flesh dried on the bone, and getting the pledges of money and arrows. It will be advantageous to him to realise the difficulty of his task and be firm,—in which case there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one gnawing at dried flesh, and finding the yellow gold. Let him be firm and correct, realising the peril (of his position). There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one gnawing at dried flesh, and finding the yellow gold. Let him be firm and correct, realising the peril (of his position). There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shih Ho</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows one wearing the cangue, and deprived of his cars. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows one wearing the cangue, and deprived of his cars. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BITING THROUGH has success.&#10;It is favorable to let justice be administered.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BITING THROUGH has success.&#10;It is favorable to let justice be administered.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder and lightning:&#10;The image of BITING THROUGH.&#10;Thus the kings of former times made firm the laws&#10;Through clearly defined penalties.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder and lightning:&#10;The image of BITING THROUGH.&#10;Thus the kings of former times made firm the laws&#10;Through clearly defined penalties.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His feet are fastened in the stocks,&#10;So that his toes disappear.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His feet are fastened in the stocks,&#10;So that his toes disappear.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites through tender meat,&#10;So that his nose disappears.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites through tender meat,&#10;So that his nose disappears.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites on old dried meat&#10;And strikes on something poisonous.&#10;Slight humiliation. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites on old dried meat&#10;And strikes on something poisonous.&#10;Slight humiliation. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites on dried gristly meat.&#10;Receives metal arrows.&#10;It furthers one to be mindful of difficulties&#10;And to be persevering.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites on dried gristly meat.&#10;Receives metal arrows.&#10;It furthers one to be mindful of difficulties&#10;And to be persevering.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites on dried lean meat.&#10;Receives yellow gold.&#10;Perseveringly aware of danger.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bites on dried lean meat.&#10;Receives yellow gold.&#10;Perseveringly aware of danger.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">21</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eradicating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">噬嗑</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His neck is fastened in the wooden cangue,&#10;So that his ears disappear.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His neck is fastened in the wooden cangue,&#10;So that his ears disappear.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pî indicates that there should be free course (in what it denotes). There will be little advantage (however) if it be allowed to advance (and take the lead).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pî indicates that there should be free course (in what it denotes). There will be little advantage (however) if it be allowed to advance (and take the lead).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and that for fire under it form Pî. The superior man, in accordance with this, throws a brilliancy around his various processes of government, but does not dare (in a similar way) to decide cases of criminal litigation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and that for fire under it form Pî. The superior man, in accordance with this, throws a brilliancy around his various processes of government, but does not dare (in a similar way) to decide cases of criminal litigation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows one adorning (the way of) his feet. He can discard a carriage and walk on foot.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows one adorning (the way of) his feet. He can discard a carriage and walk on foot.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one adorning his beard.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one adorning his beard.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject with the appearance of being adorned and bedewed (with rich favours). But let him ever maintain his firm correctness, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject with the appearance of being adorned and bedewed (with rich favours). But let him ever maintain his firm correctness, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one looking as if adorned, but only in white. As if (mounted on) a white horse, and furnished with wings, (he seeks union with the subject of the first line), while (the intervening third pursues), not as a robber, but intent on a matrimonial alliance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one looking as if adorned, but only in white. As if (mounted on) a white horse, and furnished with wings, (he seeks union with the subject of the first line), while (the intervening third pursues), not as a robber, but intent on a matrimonial alliance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject adorned by (the occupants of) the heights and gardens. He bears his roll of silk, small and slight. He may appear stingy; but there will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject adorned by (the occupants of) the heights and gardens. He bears his roll of silk, small and slight. He may appear stingy; but there will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows one with white as his (only) ornament. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows one with white as his (only) ornament. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GRACE has success.&#10;In small matters&#10;It is favorable to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GRACE has success.&#10;In small matters&#10;It is favorable to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire at the foot of the mountain:&#10;The image of GRACE.&#10;Thus does the superior man proceed&#10;When clearing up current affairs.&#10;But he dare not decide controversial issues in this way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire at the foot of the mountain:&#10;The image of GRACE.&#10;Thus does the superior man proceed&#10;When clearing up current affairs.&#10;But he dare not decide controversial issues in this way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He lends grace to his toes, leaves the carriage, and walks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He lends grace to his toes, leaves the carriage, and walks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lends grace to the beard on his chin.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lends grace to the beard on his chin.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Graceful and moist.&#10;Constant perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Graceful and moist.&#10;Constant perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Grace or simplicity?&#10;A white horse comes as if on wings.&#10;He is not a robber,&#10;He will woo at the right time.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Grace or simplicity?&#10;A white horse comes as if on wings.&#10;He is not a robber,&#10;He will woo at the right time.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Grace in hills and gardens.&#10;The roll of silk is meager and small.&#10;Humiliation, but in the end good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Grace in hills and gardens.&#10;The roll of silk is meager and small.&#10;Humiliation, but in the end good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">22</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Adorning</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">賁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Simple grace. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Simple grace. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po indicates that (in the state which it symbolises) it will not be advantageous to make a movement in any direction whatever.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po indicates that (in the state which it symbolises) it will not be advantageous to make a movement in any direction whatever.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams representing) the earth, and (above it) that for a mountain, which adheres to the earth, form Po. Superiors, in accordance with this, seek to strengthen those below them, to secure the peace and stability of their own position.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams representing) the earth, and (above it) that for a mountain, which adheres to the earth, form Po. Superiors, in accordance with this, seek to strengthen those below them, to secure the peace and stability of their own position.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one overturning the couch by injuring its legs. (The injury will go on to) the destruction of (all) firm correctness, and there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one overturning the couch by injuring its legs. (The injury will go on to) the destruction of (all) firm correctness, and there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one overthrowing the couch by injuring its frame. (The injury will go on to) the destruction of (all) firm correctness, and there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one overthrowing the couch by injuring its frame. (The injury will go on to) the destruction of (all) firm correctness, and there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject among the overthrowers; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject among the overthrowers; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject having overthrown the couch, and (going to injure) the skin (of him who lies on it). There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject having overthrown the couch, and (going to injure) the skin (of him who lies on it). There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows (its subject leading on the others like) a string of fishes, and (obtaining for them) the favour that lights on the inmates of the palace. There will be advantage in every way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows (its subject leading on the others like) a string of fishes, and (obtaining for them) the favour that lights on the inmates of the palace. There will be advantage in every way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Po</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject (as) a great fruit which has not been eaten. The superior man finds (the people again) as a chariot carrying him. The small men (by their course) overthrow their own dwellings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject (as) a great fruit which has not been eaten. The superior man finds (the people again) as a chariot carrying him. The small men (by their course) overthrow their own dwellings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SPLITTING APART. It does not further one&#10;To go anywhere.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SPLITTING APART. It does not further one&#10;To go anywhere.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The mountain rests on the earth:&#10;The image of SPLITTING APART.&#10;Thus those above can ensure their position&#10;Only by giving generously to those below.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The mountain rests on the earth:&#10;The image of SPLITTING APART.&#10;Thus those above can ensure their position&#10;Only by giving generously to those below.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The leg of the bed is split.&#10;Those who persevere are destroyed.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The leg of the bed is split.&#10;Those who persevere are destroyed.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bed is split at the edge.&#10;Those who persevere are destroyed.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bed is split at the edge.&#10;Those who persevere are destroyed.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He splits with them. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He splits with them. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bed is split up to the skin.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bed is split up to the skin.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A shoal of fishes. Favor comes through the court ladies.&#10;Everything acts to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A shoal of fishes. Favor comes through the court ladies.&#10;Everything acts to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">23</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Falling Away</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">剝</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is a large fruit still uneaten.&#10;The superior man receives a carriage.&#10;The house of the inferior man is split apart.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is a large fruit still uneaten.&#10;The superior man receives a carriage.&#10;The house of the inferior man is split apart.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fû indicates that there will be free course and progress (in what it denotes). (The subject of it) finds no one to distress him in his exits and entrances; friends come to him, and no error is committed . He will return and repeat his (proper) course. In seven days comes his return. There will be advantage in whatever direction movement is made.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fû indicates that there will be free course and progress (in what it denotes). (The subject of it) finds no one to distress him in his exits and entrances; friends come to him, and no error is committed . He will return and repeat his (proper) course. In seven days comes his return. There will be advantage in whatever direction movement is made.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and that for thunder in the midst of it form Fû. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, on the day. of the (winter) solstice, shut the gates of the passes (from one state to another), so that the travelling merchants could not (then) pursue their journeys, nor the princes go on with the inspection of their states.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and that for thunder in the midst of it form Fû. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, on the day. of the (winter) solstice, shut the gates of the passes (from one state to another), so that the travelling merchants could not (then) pursue their journeys, nor the princes go on with the inspection of their states.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject returning (from an error) of no great extent, which would not proceed to anything requiring repentance. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject returning (from an error) of no great extent, which would not proceed to anything requiring repentance. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the admirable return (of its subject). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the admirable return (of its subject). There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one who has made repeated returns. The position is perilous, but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one who has made repeated returns. The position is perilous, but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject moving right in the centre (among those represented by the other divided lines), and yet returning alone (to his proper path).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject moving right in the centre (among those represented by the other divided lines), and yet returning alone (to his proper path).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows the noble return of its subject. There will be no ground for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows the noble return of its subject. There will be no ground for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject all astray on the subject of returning. There will be evil. There will be calamities and errors. If with his views he put the hosts in motion, the end will be a great defeat, whose issues will extend to the ruler of the state. Even in ten years he will not be able to repair the disaster.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject all astray on the subject of returning. There will be evil. There will be calamities and errors. If with his views he put the hosts in motion, the end will be a great defeat, whose issues will extend to the ruler of the state. Even in ten years he will not be able to repair the disaster.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RETURN. Success.&#10;Going out and coming in without error.&#10;Friends come without blame.&#10;To and fro goes the way.&#10;On the seventh day comes return.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RETURN. Success.&#10;Going out and coming in without error.&#10;Friends come without blame.&#10;To and fro goes the way.&#10;On the seventh day comes return.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder within the earth:&#10;The image of THE TURNING POINT.&#10;Thus the kings of antiquity closed the passes&#10;At the time of solstice.&#10;Merchants and strangers did not go about,&#10;And the ruler&#10;Did not travel through the provinces.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder within the earth:&#10;The image of THE TURNING POINT.&#10;Thus the kings of antiquity closed the passes&#10;At the time of solstice.&#10;Merchants and strangers did not go about,&#10;And the ruler&#10;Did not travel through the provinces.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Return from a short distance.&#10;No need for remorse.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Return from a short distance.&#10;No need for remorse.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiet return. Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Quiet return. Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Repeated return. Danger. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Repeated return. Danger. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Walking in the midst of others,&#10;One returns alone.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Walking in the midst of others,&#10;One returns alone.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Noblehearted return. No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Noblehearted return. No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">24</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning Back</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">復</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Missing the return. Misfortune.&#10;Misfortune from within and without.&#10;If armies are set marching in this way,&#10;One will in the end suffer a great defeat,&#10;Disastrous for the ruler of the country.&#10;For ten years&#10;It will not be possible to attack again.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Missing the return. Misfortune.&#10;Misfortune from within and without.&#10;If armies are set marching in this way,&#10;One will in the end suffer a great defeat,&#10;Disastrous for the ruler of the country.&#10;For ten years&#10;It will not be possible to attack again.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wû Wang indicates great progress and success, while there will be advantage in being firm and correct. If (its subject and his action) be not correct, he will fall into errors, and it will not be advantageous for him to move in any direction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wû Wang indicates great progress and success, while there will be advantage in being firm and correct. If (its subject and his action) be not correct, he will fall into errors, and it will not be advantageous for him to move in any direction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The thunder rolls all under the sky, and to (every)thing there is given (its nature), free from all insincerity. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, (made their regulations) in complete accordance with the seasons, thereby nourishing all things.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The thunder rolls all under the sky, and to (every)thing there is given (its nature), free from all insincerity. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, (made their regulations) in complete accordance with the seasons, thereby nourishing all things.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject free from all insincerity. His advance will be accompanied with good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject free from all insincerity. His advance will be accompanied with good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one who reaps without having ploughed (that he might reap), and gathers the produce of his third year’s fields without having cultivated them the first year for that end. To such a one there will be advantage in whatever direction he may move.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one who reaps without having ploughed (that he might reap), and gathers the produce of his third year’s fields without having cultivated them the first year for that end. To such a one there will be advantage in whatever direction he may move.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows calamity happening to one who is free from insincerity;—as in the case of an ox that has been tied up. A passer by finds it (and carries it off), while the people in the neighbourhood have the calamity (of being accused and. apprehended).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows calamity happening to one who is free from insincerity;—as in the case of an ox that has been tied up. A passer by finds it (and carries it off), while the people in the neighbourhood have the calamity (of being accused and. apprehended).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows (a case) in which, if its subject can remain firm and correct, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows (a case) in which, if its subject can remain firm and correct, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows one who is free from insincerity, and yet has fallen ill. Let him not use medicine, and he will have occasion for joy (in his recovery).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows one who is free from insincerity, and yet has fallen ill. Let him not use medicine, and he will have occasion for joy (in his recovery).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wu Wang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject free from insincerity, yet sure to fall into error, if he take action. (His action) will not be advantageous in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject free from insincerity, yet sure to fall into error, if he take action. (His action) will not be advantageous in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INNOCENCE. Supreme success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;If someone is not as he should be,&#10;He has misfortune,&#10;And it does not further him&#10;To undertake anything.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INNOCENCE. Supreme success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;If someone is not as he should be,&#10;He has misfortune,&#10;And it does not further him&#10;To undertake anything.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Under heaven thunder rolls:&#10;All things attain the natural state of innocence.&#10;Thus the kings of old,&#10;Rich in virtue, and in harmony with the time,&#10;Fostered and nourished all beings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Under heaven thunder rolls:&#10;All things attain the natural state of innocence.&#10;Thus the kings of old,&#10;Rich in virtue, and in harmony with the time,&#10;Fostered and nourished all beings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innocent behavior brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innocent behavior brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one does not count on the harvest while plowing,&#10;Nor on the use of the ground while clearing it,&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one does not count on the harvest while plowing,&#10;Nor on the use of the ground while clearing it,&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Undeserved misfortune.&#10;The cow that was tethered by someone&#10;Is the wanderer’s gain, the citizen’s loss.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Undeserved misfortune.&#10;The cow that was tethered by someone&#10;Is the wanderer’s gain, the citizen’s loss.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who can be persevering&#10;Remains without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who can be persevering&#10;Remains without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Use no medicine in an illness&#10;Incurred through no fault of your own.&#10;It will pass of itself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Use no medicine in an illness&#10;Incurred through no fault of your own.&#10;It will pass of itself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">25</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without Falsehood</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">無妄</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innocent action brings misfortune.&#10;Nothing furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innocent action brings misfortune.&#10;Nothing furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Under the conditions of Tâ Khû it will be advantageous to be firm and correct. (If its subject do not seek to) enjoy his revenues in his own family (without taking service at court), there will be good fortune. It will be advantageous for him to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Under the conditions of Tâ Khû it will be advantageous to be firm and correct. (If its subject do not seek to) enjoy his revenues in his own family (without taking service at court), there will be good fortune. It will be advantageous for him to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain, and in the midst of it that (representing) heaven, form Tâ Khû. The superior man, in accordance with this, stores largely in his memory the words and deeds of former men, to subserve the accumulation of his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain, and in the midst of it that (representing) heaven, form Tâ Khû. The superior man, in accordance with this, stores largely in his memory the words and deeds of former men, to subserve the accumulation of his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject in a position of peril. It will be advantageous for him to stop his advance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject in a position of peril. It will be advantageous for him to stop his advance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows a carriage with the strap under it removed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows a carriage with the strap under it removed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject urging his way with good horses. It will be advantageous for him to realise the difficulty (of his course), and to be firm and correct, exercising himself daily in his charioteering and methods of defence; then there will be advantage in whatever direction he may advance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject urging his way with good horses. It will be advantageous for him to realise the difficulty (of his course), and to be firm and correct, exercising himself daily in his charioteering and methods of defence; then there will be advantage in whatever direction he may advance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth six, divided, shows the young bull, (and yet) having the piece of wood over his horns. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth six, divided, shows the young bull, (and yet) having the piece of wood over his horns. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows the teeth of a castrated hog. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows the teeth of a castrated hog. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Khu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject (as) in command of the firmament of heaven. There will be progress.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject (as) in command of the firmament of heaven. There will be progress.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE TAMING POWER OF THE GREAT.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;Not eating at home brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE TAMING POWER OF THE GREAT.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;Not eating at home brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven within the mountain:&#10;The image of THE TAMING POWER OF&#10;THE GREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man acquaints himself with many sayings of antiquity&#10;And many deeds of the past,&#10;In order to strengthen his character thereby.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Heaven within the mountain:&#10;The image of THE TAMING POWER OF&#10;THE GREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man acquaints himself with many sayings of antiquity&#10;And many deeds of the past,&#10;In order to strengthen his character thereby.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Danger is at hand. It furthers one to desist.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Danger is at hand. It furthers one to desist.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The axletrees are taken from the wagon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The axletrees are taken from the wagon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A good horse that follows others.&#10;Awareness of danger,&#10;With perseverance, furthers.&#10;Practice chariot driving and armed defense daily.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A good horse that follows others.&#10;Awareness of danger,&#10;With perseverance, furthers.&#10;Practice chariot driving and armed defense daily.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The headboard of a young bull.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The headboard of a young bull.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The tusk of a gelded boar.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The tusk of a gelded boar.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">26</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Accumulation</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大畜</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One attains the way of heaven. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One attains the way of heaven. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Î indicates that with firm correctness there will be good fortune (in what is denoted by it). We must look at what we are seeking to nourish, and by the exercise of our thoughts seek for the proper aliment.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Î indicates that with firm correctness there will be good fortune (in what is denoted by it). We must look at what we are seeking to nourish, and by the exercise of our thoughts seek for the proper aliment.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and under it that for thunder form Î. The superior man, in accordance with this, (enjoins) watchfulness over our words, and the temperate regulation of our eating and drinking.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and under it that for thunder form Î. The superior man, in accordance with this, (enjoins) watchfulness over our words, and the temperate regulation of our eating and drinking.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, (seems to be thus addressed), ‘You leave your efficacious tortoise, and look at me till your lower jaw hangs down.’ There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, (seems to be thus addressed), ‘You leave your efficacious tortoise, and look at me till your lower jaw hangs down.’ There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one looking downwards for nourishment, which is contrary to what is proper; or seeking it from the height (above), advance towards which will lead to evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one looking downwards for nourishment, which is contrary to what is proper; or seeking it from the height (above), advance towards which will lead to evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one acting contrary to the method of nourishing. However firm he may be, there will be evil. For ten years let him not take any action, (for) it will not be in any way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows one acting contrary to the method of nourishing. However firm he may be, there will be evil. For ten years let him not take any action, (for) it will not be in any way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one looking downwards for (the power to) nourish. There will be good fortune. Looking with a tiger’s downward unwavering glare, and with his desire that impels him to spring after spring, he will fall into no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows one looking downwards for (the power to) nourish. There will be good fortune. Looking with a tiger’s downward unwavering glare, and with his desire that impels him to spring after spring, he will fall into no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one acting contrary to what is regular and proper; but if he abide in firmness, there will be good fortune. He should not, (however, try to) cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one acting contrary to what is regular and proper; but if he abide in firmness, there will be good fortune. He should not, (however, try to) cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows him from whom comes the nourishing. His position is perilous, but there will be good fortune. It will be advantageous to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows him from whom comes the nourishing. His position is perilous, but there will be good fortune. It will be advantageous to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CORNERS OF THE MOUTH.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Pay heed to the providing of nourishment&#10;And to what a man seeks&#10;To fill his own mouth with.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CORNERS OF THE MOUTH.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Pay heed to the providing of nourishment&#10;And to what a man seeks&#10;To fill his own mouth with.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the foot of the mountain, thunder:&#10;The image of PROVIDING&#10;NOURISHMENT.&#10;Thus the superior man is careful of his words&#10;And temperate in eating and drinking.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the foot of the mountain, thunder:&#10;The image of PROVIDING&#10;NOURISHMENT.&#10;Thus the superior man is careful of his words&#10;And temperate in eating and drinking.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You let your magic tortoise go,&#10;And look at me with the corners of your mouth drooping.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">You let your magic tortoise go,&#10;And look at me with the corners of your mouth drooping.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning to the summit for nourishment,&#10;Deviating from the path&#10;To seek nourishment from the hill.&#10;Continuing to do this brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning to the summit for nourishment,&#10;Deviating from the path&#10;To seek nourishment from the hill.&#10;Continuing to do this brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning away from nourishment.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.&#10;Do not act thus for ten years.&#10;Nothing serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning away from nourishment.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.&#10;Do not act thus for ten years.&#10;Nothing serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning to the summit&#10;For provision of nourishment&#10;Brings good fortune.&#10;Spying about with sharp eyes&#10;Like a tiger with insatiable craving.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning to the summit&#10;For provision of nourishment&#10;Brings good fortune.&#10;Spying about with sharp eyes&#10;Like a tiger with insatiable craving.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning away from the path.&#10;To remain persevering brings good fortune.&#10;One should not cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Turning away from the path.&#10;To remain persevering brings good fortune.&#10;One should not cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">27</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Nourishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">頤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The source of nourishment.&#10;Awareness of danger brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The source of nourishment.&#10;Awareness of danger brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tâ Kwo suggests to us a beam that is weak. There will be advantage in moving (under its conditions) in any direction whatever; there will be success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tâ Kwo suggests to us a beam that is weak. There will be advantage in moving (under its conditions) in any direction whatever; there will be success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) trees hidden beneath that for the waters of a marsh forms Tâ Kwo. The superior man, in accordance with this, stands up alone and has no fear, and keeps retired from the world without regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) trees hidden beneath that for the waters of a marsh forms Tâ Kwo. The superior man, in accordance with this, stands up alone and has no fear, and keeps retired from the world without regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one placing mats of the white mâo grass under things set on the ground. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one placing mats of the white mâo grass under things set on the ground. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows a decayed willow producing shoots, or an old husband in possession of his young wife. There will be advantage in every way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows a decayed willow producing shoots, or an old husband in possession of his young wife. There will be advantage in every way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows a beam that is weak. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows a beam that is weak. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows a beam curving upwards. There will be good fortune. If (the subject of it) looks for other (help but that of line one), there will be cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows a beam curving upwards. There will be good fortune. If (the subject of it) looks for other (help but that of line one), there will be cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows a decayed willow producing flowers, or an old wife in possession of her young husband. There will be occasion neither for blame nor for praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows a decayed willow producing flowers, or an old wife in possession of her young husband. There will be occasion neither for blame nor for praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Kwo</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject with extraordinary (boldness) wading through a stream, till the water hides the crown of his head. There will be evil, but no ground for blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject with extraordinary (boldness) wading through a stream, till the water hides the crown of his head. There will be evil, but no ground for blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PREPONDERANCE OF THE GREAT.&#10;The ridgepole sags to the breaking point.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.&#10;Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PREPONDERANCE OF THE GREAT.&#10;The ridgepole sags to the breaking point.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.&#10;Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The lake rises above the trees:&#10;The image of PREPONDERANCE OF&#10;THE GREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man, when he stands alone,&#10;Is unconcerned,&#10;And if he has to renounce the world,&#10;He is undaunted.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The lake rises above the trees:&#10;The image of PREPONDERANCE OF&#10;THE GREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man, when he stands alone,&#10;Is unconcerned,&#10;And if he has to renounce the world,&#10;He is undaunted.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To spread white rushes underneath.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To spread white rushes underneath.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A dry poplar sprouts at the root.&#10;An older man takes a young wife.&#10;Everything furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A dry poplar sprouts at the root.&#10;An older man takes a young wife.&#10;Everything furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ridgepole sags to the breaking point.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ridgepole sags to the breaking point.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ridgepole is braced. Good fortune.&#10;If there are ulterior motives, it is humiliating.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ridgepole is braced. Good fortune.&#10;If there are ulterior motives, it is humiliating.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A withered poplar puts forth flowers.&#10;An older woman takes a husband.&#10;No blame. No praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A withered poplar puts forth flowers.&#10;An older woman takes a husband.&#10;No blame. No praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">28</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One must go through the water.&#10;It goes over one’s head.&#10;Misfortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One must go through the water.&#10;It goes over one’s head.&#10;Misfortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan, here repeated, shows the possession of sincerity, through which the mind is. penetrating. Action (in accordance with this) will be of high value.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan, here repeated, shows the possession of sincerity, through which the mind is. penetrating. Action (in accordance with this) will be of high value.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The representation of) water flowing on continuously forms the repeated Khan. The superior man, in accordance with this, maintains constantly the virtue (of his heart) and (the integrity of) his conduct, and practises the business of instruction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The representation of) water flowing on continuously forms the repeated Khan. The superior man, in accordance with this, maintains constantly the virtue (of his heart) and (the integrity of) his conduct, and practises the business of instruction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject in the double defile, and (yet) entering a cavern within it. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject in the double defile, and (yet) entering a cavern within it. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject in all the peril of the defile. He will, however, get a little (of the deliverance) that he seeks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject in all the peril of the defile. He will, however, get a little (of the deliverance) that he seeks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject, whether he comes or goes ( =descends or ascends), confronted by a defile. All is peril to him and unrest. (His endeavours) will lead him into the cavern of the pit. There should be no action (in such a case).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject, whether he comes or goes ( =descends or ascends), confronted by a defile. All is peril to him and unrest. (His endeavours) will lead him into the cavern of the pit. There should be no action (in such a case).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject (at a feast), with (simply) a bottle of spirits, and a subsidiary basket of rice, while (the cups and bowls) are (only) of earthenware. He introduces his important lessons (as his ruler’s) intelligence admits. There will in the end be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject (at a feast), with (simply) a bottle of spirits, and a subsidiary basket of rice, while (the cups and bowls) are (only) of earthenware. He introduces his important lessons (as his ruler’s) intelligence admits. There will in the end be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the water of the defile not yet full, (so that it might flow away); but order will (soon) be brought about. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the water of the defile not yet full, (so that it might flow away); but order will (soon) be brought about. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject bound with cords of three strands or two strands, and placed in the thicket of thorns. But in three years he does not learn the course for him to pursue. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject bound with cords of three strands or two strands, and placed in the thicket of thorns. But in three years he does not learn the course for him to pursue. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Abysmal repeated.&#10;If you are sincere, you have success in your heart,&#10;And whatever you do succeeds.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Abysmal repeated.&#10;If you are sincere, you have success in your heart,&#10;And whatever you do succeeds.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water flows on uninterruptedly and reaches its goal:&#10;The image of the Abysmal repeated.&#10;Thus the superior man walks in lasting virtue&#10;And carries on the business of teaching.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water flows on uninterruptedly and reaches its goal:&#10;The image of the Abysmal repeated.&#10;Thus the superior man walks in lasting virtue&#10;And carries on the business of teaching.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Repetition of the Abysmal.&#10;In the abyss one falls into a pit.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Repetition of the Abysmal.&#10;In the abyss one falls into a pit.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The abyss is dangerous.&#10;One should strive to attain small things only.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The abyss is dangerous.&#10;One should strive to attain small things only.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Forward and backward, abyss on abyss.&#10;In danger like this, pause at first and wait,&#10;Otherwise you will fall into a pit in the abyss.&#10;Do not act in this way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Forward and backward, abyss on abyss.&#10;In danger like this, pause at first and wait,&#10;Otherwise you will fall into a pit in the abyss.&#10;Do not act in this way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A jug of wine, a bowl of rice with it;&#10;Earthen vessels&#10;Simply handed in through the window.&#10;There is certainly no blame in this.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A jug of wine, a bowl of rice with it;&#10;Earthen vessels&#10;Simply handed in through the window.&#10;There is certainly no blame in this.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The abyss is not filled to overflowing,&#10;It is filled only to the rim.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The abyss is not filled to overflowing,&#10;It is filled only to the rim.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">29</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">坎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bound with cords and ropes,&#10;Shut in between thorn-hedged prison walls:&#10;For three years one does not find the way.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bound with cords and ropes,&#10;Shut in between thorn-hedged prison walls:&#10;For three years one does not find the way.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lî indicates that, (in regard to what it denotes), it will be advantageous to be firm and correct, and that thus there will be free course and success. Let (its subject) also nourish (a docility like that of) the cow, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lî indicates that, (in regard to what it denotes), it will be advantageous to be firm and correct, and that thus there will be free course and success. Let (its subject) also nourish (a docility like that of) the cow, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) brightness, repeated, forms Lî. The great man, in accordance with this, cultivates more and more his brilliant (virtue), and diffuses its brightness over the four quarters (of the land).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram for) brightness, repeated, forms Lî. The great man, in accordance with this, cultivates more and more his brilliant (virtue), and diffuses its brightness over the four quarters (of the land).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows one ready to move with confused steps. But he treads at the same time reverently, and there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows one ready to move with confused steps. But he treads at the same time reverently, and there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject in his place in yellow. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject in his place in yellow. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject in a position like that of the declining sun. Instead of playing on his instrument of earthenware, and singing to it, he utters the groans of an old man of eighty. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject in a position like that of the declining sun. Instead of playing on his instrument of earthenware, and singing to it, he utters the groans of an old man of eighty. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the manner of its subject’s coming. How abrupt it is, as with fire, with death, to be rejected (by all)!</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the manner of its subject’s coming. How abrupt it is, as with fire, with death, to be rejected (by all)!</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject as one with tears flowing in torrents, and groaning in sorrow. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject as one with tears flowing in torrents, and groaning in sorrow. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Li</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows the king employing its subject in his punitive expeditions. Achieving admirable (merit), he breaks (only) the chiefs (of the rebels). Where his prisoners were not their associates, he does not punish. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows the king employing its subject in his punitive expeditions. Achieving admirable (merit), he breaks (only) the chiefs (of the rebels). Where his prisoners were not their associates, he does not punish. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CLINGING. Perseverance furthers.&#10;It brings success.&#10;Care of the cow brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CLINGING. Perseverance furthers.&#10;It brings success.&#10;Care of the cow brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">That which is bright rises twice:&#10;The image of FIRE.&#10;Thus the great man, by perpetuating this brightness,&#10;Illumines the four quarters of the world.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">That which is bright rises twice:&#10;The image of FIRE.&#10;Thus the great man, by perpetuating this brightness,&#10;Illumines the four quarters of the world.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The footprints run crisscross.&#10;If one is seriously intent, no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The footprints run crisscross.&#10;If one is seriously intent, no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yellow light. Supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yellow light. Supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the light of the setting sun,&#10;Men either beat the pot and sing&#10;Or loudly bewail the approach of old age.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the light of the setting sun,&#10;Men either beat the pot and sing&#10;Or loudly bewail the approach of old age.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Its coming is sudden;&#10;It flames up, dies down, is thrown away.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Its coming is sudden;&#10;It flames up, dies down, is thrown away.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tears in floods, sighing and lamenting.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tears in floods, sighing and lamenting.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">30</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brightness</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">離</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The king uses him to march forth and chastise.&#10;Then it is best to kill the leaders&#10;And take captive the followers. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The king uses him to march forth and chastise.&#10;Then it is best to kill the leaders&#10;And take captive the followers. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien indicates that, (on the fulfilment of the conditions implied in it), there will be free course and success. Its advantageousness will depend on the being firm and correct, (as) in marrying a young lady. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien indicates that, (on the fulfilment of the conditions implied in it), there will be free course and success. Its advantageousness will depend on the being firm and correct, (as) in marrying a young lady. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and above it that for (the waters of) a marsh form Hsien. The superior man, in accordance with this, keeps his mind free from pre-occupation, and open to receive (the influences of) others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and above it that for (the waters of) a marsh form Hsien. The superior man, in accordance with this, keeps his mind free from pre-occupation, and open to receive (the influences of) others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one moving his great toes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one moving his great toes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one moving the calves of his leg. There will be evil. If he abide (quiet in his place), there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows one moving the calves of his leg. There will be evil. If he abide (quiet in his place), there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one moving his thighs, and keeping close hold of those whom he follows. Going forward (in this way) will cause regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one moving his thighs, and keeping close hold of those whom he follows. Going forward (in this way) will cause regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows that firm correctness which will lead to good fortune, and prevent all occasion for repentance. If its subject be unsettled in his movements, (only) his friends will follow his purpose.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows that firm correctness which will lead to good fortune, and prevent all occasion for repentance. If its subject be unsettled in his movements, (only) his friends will follow his purpose.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows one moving the flesh along the spine above the heart. There will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows one moving the flesh along the spine above the heart. There will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows one moving his jaws and tongue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows one moving his jaws and tongue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Influence. Success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;To take a maiden to wife brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Influence. Success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;To take a maiden to wife brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A lake on the mountain:&#10;The image of influence.&#10;Thus the superior man encourages people to approach him&#10;By his readiness to receive them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A lake on the mountain:&#10;The image of influence.&#10;Thus the superior man encourages people to approach him&#10;By his readiness to receive them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the big toe.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the big toe.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the calves of the legs.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;Tarrying brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the calves of the legs.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;Tarrying brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the thighs.&#10;Holds to that which follows it.&#10;To continue is humiliating.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the thighs.&#10;Holds to that which follows it.&#10;To continue is humiliating.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.&#10;If a man is agitated in mind,&#10;And his thoughts go hither and thither,&#10;Only those friends&#10;On whom he fixes his conscious thoughts&#10;Will follow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.&#10;If a man is agitated in mind,&#10;And his thoughts go hither and thither,&#10;Only those friends&#10;On whom he fixes his conscious thoughts&#10;Will follow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the back of the neck.&#10;No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the back of the neck.&#10;No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">31</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mutual Influence</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">咸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the jaws, cheeks, and tongue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The influence shows itself in the jaws, cheeks, and tongue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hăng indicates successful progress and no error (in what it denotes). But the advantage will come from being firm and correct; and movement in any direction whatever will be advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hăng indicates successful progress and no error (in what it denotes). But the advantage will come from being firm and correct; and movement in any direction whatever will be advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) thunder and that for wind form Hăng. The superior man, in accordance with this, stands firm, and does not change his method (of operation).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) thunder and that for wind form Hăng. The superior man, in accordance with this, stands firm, and does not change his method (of operation).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject deeply (desirous) of long continuance. Even with firm correctness there will be evil; there will be no advantage in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject deeply (desirous) of long continuance. Even with firm correctness there will be evil; there will be no advantage in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows all occasion for repentance disappearing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows all occasion for repentance disappearing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one who does not continuously maintain his virtue. There are those who will impute this to him as a disgrace. However firm he may be, there will be ground for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one who does not continuously maintain his virtue. There are those who will impute this to him as a disgrace. However firm he may be, there will be ground for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows a field where there is no game.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows a field where there is no game.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject continuously maintaining the virtue indicated by it. In a wife this will be fortunate; in a husband, evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject continuously maintaining the virtue indicated by it. In a wife this will be fortunate; in a husband, evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject exciting himself to long continuance. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject exciting himself to long continuance. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DURATION. Success. No blame.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DURATION. Success. No blame.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder and wind: the image of&#10;DURATION.&#10;Thus the superior man stands firm&#10;And does not change his direction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder and wind: the image of&#10;DURATION.&#10;Thus the superior man stands firm&#10;And does not change his direction.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking duration too hastily brings misfortune persistently.&#10;Nothing that would further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seeking duration too hastily brings misfortune persistently.&#10;Nothing that would further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who does not give duration to his character&#10;Meets with disgrace.&#10;Persistent humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who does not give duration to his character&#10;Meets with disgrace.&#10;Persistent humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No game in the field.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No game in the field.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Giving duration to one’s character through perseverance.&#10;This is good fortune for a woman, misfortune for a man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Giving duration to one’s character through perseverance.&#10;This is good fortune for a woman, misfortune for a man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">32</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Long Lasting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">恆</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restlessness as an enduring condition brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restlessness as an enduring condition brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun indicates successful progress (in its circumstances). To a small extent it will (still) be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun indicates successful progress (in its circumstances). To a small extent it will (still) be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the sky and below it that for a mountain form Thun. The superior man, in accordance with this, keeps small men at a distance, not by showing that he hates them, but by his own. dignified gravity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the sky and below it that for a mountain form Thun. The superior man, in accordance with this, keeps small men at a distance, not by showing that he hates them, but by his own. dignified gravity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows a retiring tail. The position is perilous. No movement in any direction should be made.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows a retiring tail. The position is perilous. No movement in any direction should be made.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject holding (his purpose) fast as if by a (thong made from the) hide of a yellow ox, which cannot be broken.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject holding (his purpose) fast as if by a (thong made from the) hide of a yellow ox, which cannot be broken.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one retiring but bound,—to his distress and peril. (If he were to deal with his binders as in) nourishing a servant or concubine, it would be fortunate for him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one retiring but bound,—to his distress and peril. (If he were to deal with his binders as in) nourishing a servant or concubine, it would be fortunate for him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject retiring notwithstanding his likings. In a superior man this will lead to good fortune; a small man cannot attain to this.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject retiring notwithstanding his likings. In a superior man this will lead to good fortune; a small man cannot attain to this.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject retiring in an admirable way. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject retiring in an admirable way. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject retiring in a noble way. It will be advantageous in every respect.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject retiring in a noble way. It will be advantageous in every respect.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RETREAT. Success.&#10;In what is small, perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">RETREAT. Success.&#10;In what is small, perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mountain under heaven: the image of&#10;RETREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man keeps the inferior man at a distance,&#10;Not angrily but with reserve.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mountain under heaven: the image of&#10;RETREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man keeps the inferior man at a distance,&#10;Not angrily but with reserve.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the tail in retreat. This is dangerous.&#10;One must not wish to undertake anything.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the tail in retreat. This is dangerous.&#10;One must not wish to undertake anything.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He holds him fast with yellow oxhide.&#10;No one can tear him loose.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He holds him fast with yellow oxhide.&#10;No one can tear him loose.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A halted retreat&#10;Is nerve-wracking and dangerous.&#10;To retain people as men- and maidservants&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A halted retreat&#10;Is nerve-wracking and dangerous.&#10;To retain people as men- and maidservants&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Voluntary retreat brings good fortune to the superior man&#10;And downfall to the inferior man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Voluntary retreat brings good fortune to the superior man&#10;And downfall to the inferior man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Friendly retreat. Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Friendly retreat. Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">33</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Retreat</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">遁</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Cheerful retreat. Everything serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Cheerful retreat. Everything serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tâ Kwang indicates that (under the conditions which it symbolises) it will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tâ Kwang indicates that (under the conditions which it symbolises) it will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) heaven and above it that for thunder form Tâ Kwang. The superior man, in accordance with this, does not take a step which is not according to propriety.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) heaven and above it that for thunder form Tâ Kwang. The superior man, in accordance with this, does not take a step which is not according to propriety.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject manifesting his strength in his toes. But advance will lead to evil,—most certainly.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject manifesting his strength in his toes. But advance will lead to evil,—most certainly.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows that with firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows that with firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows, in the case of a small man, one using all his strength; and in the case of a superior man, one whose rule is not to do so. Even with firm correctness the position would be perilous. (The exercise of strength in it might be compared to the case of) a ram butting against a fence, and getting his horns entangled.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows, in the case of a small man, one using all his strength; and in the case of a superior man, one whose rule is not to do so. Even with firm correctness the position would be perilous. (The exercise of strength in it might be compared to the case of) a ram butting against a fence, and getting his horns entangled.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows (a case in which) firm correctness leads to good fortune, and occasion for repentance disappears. (We see) the fence opened without the horns being entangled. The strength is like that in the wheel-spokes of a large waggon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows (a case in which) firm correctness leads to good fortune, and occasion for repentance disappears. (We see) the fence opened without the horns being entangled. The strength is like that in the wheel-spokes of a large waggon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one who loses his ram(-like strength) in the ease of his position. (But) there will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows one who loses his ram(-like strength) in the ease of his position. (But) there will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ta Chwang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows (one who may be compared to) the ram butting against the fence, and unable either to retreat, or to advance as he would fain do. There will not be advantage in any respect; but if he realise the difficulty (of his position), there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows (one who may be compared to) the ram butting against the fence, and unable either to retreat, or to advance as he would fain do. There will not be advantage in any respect; but if he realise the difficulty (of his position), there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE POWER OF THE GREAT. Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE POWER OF THE GREAT. Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder in heaven above:&#10;The image of THE POWER OF THE&#10;GREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man does not tread upon paths&#10;That do not accord with established order.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder in heaven above:&#10;The image of THE POWER OF THE&#10;GREAT.&#10;Thus the superior man does not tread upon paths&#10;That do not accord with established order.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Power in the toes.&#10;Continuing brings misfortune.&#10;This is certainly true.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Power in the toes.&#10;Continuing brings misfortune.&#10;This is certainly true.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The inferior man works through power.&#10;The superior man does not act thus.&#10;To continue is dangerous.&#10;A goat butts against a hedge&#10;And gets its horns entangled.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The inferior man works through power.&#10;The superior man does not act thus.&#10;To continue is dangerous.&#10;A goat butts against a hedge&#10;And gets its horns entangled.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.&#10;The hedge opens; there is no entanglement.&#10;Power depends upon the axle of a big cart.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.&#10;The hedge opens; there is no entanglement.&#10;Power depends upon the axle of a big cart.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Loses the goat with ease.&#10;No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Loses the goat with ease.&#10;No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">34</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great Strength</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">大壯</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A goat butts against a hedge.&#10;It cannot go backward, it cannot go forward.&#10;Nothing serves to further.&#10;If one notes the difficulty, this brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A goat butts against a hedge.&#10;It cannot go backward, it cannot go forward.&#10;Nothing serves to further.&#10;If one notes the difficulty, this brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Žin we see a prince who secures the tranquillity (of the people) presented on that account with numerous horses (by the king), and three times in a day received at interviews.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In Žin we see a prince who secures the tranquillity (of the people) presented on that account with numerous horses (by the king), and three times in a day received at interviews.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and that for the bright (sun) coming forth above it form Žin. The superior man, according to this, gives himself to make more brilliant his bright virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and that for the bright (sun) coming forth above it form Žin. The superior man, according to this, gives himself to make more brilliant his bright virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one wishing to advance, and (at the same time) kept back. Let him be firm and correct, and there will be good fortune. If trust be not reposed in him, let him maintain a large and generous mind, and there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows one wishing to advance, and (at the same time) kept back. Let him be firm and correct, and there will be good fortune. If trust be not reposed in him, let him maintain a large and generous mind, and there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject with the appearance of advancing, and yet of being sorrowful. If he be firm and correct, there will be good fortune. He will receive this great blessing from his grandmother.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject with the appearance of advancing, and yet of being sorrowful. If he be firm and correct, there will be good fortune. He will receive this great blessing from his grandmother.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject trusted by all (around him). All occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject trusted by all (around him). All occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject with the appearance of advancing, but like a marmot. However firm and correct he may be, the position is one of peril.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject with the appearance of advancing, but like a marmot. However firm and correct he may be, the position is one of peril.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows how all occasion for repentance disappears (from its subject). (But) let him not concern himself about whether he shall fail or succeed. To advance will be fortunate, and in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows how all occasion for repentance disappears (from its subject). (But) let him not concern himself about whether he shall fail or succeed. To advance will be fortunate, and in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Zin</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows one advancing his horns. But he only uses them to punish the (rebellious people of his own) city. The position is perilous, but there will be good fortune. (Yet) however firm and correct he may be, there will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows one advancing his horns. But he only uses them to punish the (rebellious people of his own) city. The position is perilous, but there will be good fortune. (Yet) however firm and correct he may be, there will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PROGRESS. The powerful prince&#10;Is honored with horses in large numbers.&#10;In a single day he is granted audience three times.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PROGRESS. The powerful prince&#10;Is honored with horses in large numbers.&#10;In a single day he is granted audience three times.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sun rises over the earth:&#10;The image of PROGRESS.&#10;Thus the superior man himself&#10;Brightens his bright virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sun rises over the earth:&#10;The image of PROGRESS.&#10;Thus the superior man himself&#10;Brightens his bright virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Progressing, but turned back.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;If one meets with no confidence, one should remain calm.&#10;No mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Progressing, but turned back.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;If one meets with no confidence, one should remain calm.&#10;No mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Progressing, but in sorrow.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Then one obtains great happiness from one’s ancestress.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Progressing, but in sorrow.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Then one obtains great happiness from one’s ancestress.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All are in accord. Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">All are in accord. Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Progress like a hamster.&#10;Perseverance brings danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Progress like a hamster.&#10;Perseverance brings danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.&#10;Take not gain and loss to heart.&#10;Undertakings bring good fortune.&#10;Everything serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.&#10;Take not gain and loss to heart.&#10;Undertakings bring good fortune.&#10;Everything serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">35</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Forward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">晉</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Making progress with the horns is permissible&#10;Only for the purpose of punishing one’s own city.&#10;To be conscious of danger brings good fortune.&#10;No blame.&#10;Perseverance brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Making progress with the horns is permissible&#10;Only for the purpose of punishing one’s own city.&#10;To be conscious of danger brings good fortune.&#10;No blame.&#10;Perseverance brings humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming Î indicates that (in the circumstances which it denotes) it will be advantageous to realise the difficulty (of the position), and maintain firm correctness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming Î indicates that (in the circumstances which it denotes) it will be advantageous to realise the difficulty (of the position), and maintain firm correctness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and that for the bright (sun) entering within it form Ming Î. The superior man, in accordance with this, conducts his management of men;—he shows his intelligence by keeping it obscured.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) the earth and that for the bright (sun) entering within it form Ming Î. The superior man, in accordance with this, conducts his management of men;—he shows his intelligence by keeping it obscured.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject, (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, flying, but with drooping wings. When the superior man (is revolving) his going away, he may be for three days without eating. Wherever he goes, the people there may speak (derisively of him).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject, (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, flying, but with drooping wings. When the superior man (is revolving) his going away, he may be for three days without eating. Wherever he goes, the people there may speak (derisively of him).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject, (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, wounded in the left thigh. He saves himself by the strength of a (swift) horse; and is fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject, (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, wounded in the left thigh. He saves himself by the strength of a (swift) horse; and is fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject, (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, hunting in the south, and taking the great chief (of the darkness). He should not be eager to make (all) correct (at once).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject, (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, hunting in the south, and taking the great chief (of the darkness). He should not be eager to make (all) correct (at once).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth six, divided, shows its subject (just) entered into the left side of the belly (of the dark land). (But) he is able to carry out the mind appropriate (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, quitting the gate and courtyard (of the lord of darkness).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth six, divided, shows its subject (just) entered into the left side of the belly (of the dark land). (But) he is able to carry out the mind appropriate (in the condition indicated by) Ming Î, quitting the gate and courtyard (of the lord of darkness).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows how the count of Kî fulfilled the condition indicated by Ming Î. It will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows how the count of Kî fulfilled the condition indicated by Ming Î. It will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ming I</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth six, divided, shows the case where there is no light, but (only) obscurity. (Its subject) had at first ascended to (the top of) the sky; his future shall be to go into the earth.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth six, divided, shows the case where there is no light, but (only) obscurity. (Its subject) had at first ascended to (the top of) the sky; his future shall be to go into the earth.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DARKENING OF THE LIGHT. In adversity&#10;It furthers one to be persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DARKENING OF THE LIGHT. In adversity&#10;It furthers one to be persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The light has sunk into the earth:&#10;The image of DARKENING OF THE LIGHT.&#10;Thus does the superior man live with the great mass:&#10;He veils his light, yet still shines.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The light has sunk into the earth:&#10;The image of DARKENING OF THE LIGHT.&#10;Thus does the superior man live with the great mass:&#10;He veils his light, yet still shines.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light during flight.&#10;He lowers his wings.&#10;The superior man does not eat for three days&#10;On his wanderings.&#10;But he has somewhere to go.&#10;The host has occasion to gossip about him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light during flight.&#10;He lowers his wings.&#10;The superior man does not eat for three days&#10;On his wanderings.&#10;But he has somewhere to go.&#10;The host has occasion to gossip about him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light injures him in the left thigh.&#10;He gives aid with the strength of a horse.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light injures him in the left thigh.&#10;He gives aid with the strength of a horse.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light during the hunt in the south.&#10;Their great leader is captured.&#10;One must not expect perseverance too soon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light during the hunt in the south.&#10;Their great leader is captured.&#10;One must not expect perseverance too soon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He penetrates the left side of the belly.&#10;One gets at the very heart of the darkening of the light,&#10;And leaves gate and courtyard.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He penetrates the left side of the belly.&#10;One gets at the very heart of the darkening of the light,&#10;And leaves gate and courtyard.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light as with Prince Chi.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Darkening of the light as with Prince Chi.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">36</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Brilliance Injured</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">明夷</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not light but darkness.&#10;First he climbed up to heaven,&#10;Then he plunged into the depths of the earth.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not light but darkness.&#10;First he climbed up to heaven,&#10;Then he plunged into the depths of the earth.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For (the realisation of what is taught in) Kiâ Zăn, (or for the regulation of the family), what is most advantageous is that the wife be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">For (the realisation of what is taught in) Kiâ Zăn, (or for the regulation of the family), what is most advantageous is that the wife be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) fire, and that for wind coming forth from it, form Kiâ Zăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, orders his words according to (the truth of) things, and his conduct so that it is uniformly consistent.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) fire, and that for wind coming forth from it, form Kiâ Zăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, orders his words according to (the truth of) things, and his conduct so that it is uniformly consistent.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject establishing restrictive regulations in his household Occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject establishing restrictive regulations in his household Occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject taking nothing on herself, but in her central place attending to the preparation of the food. Through her firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject taking nothing on herself, but in her central place attending to the preparation of the food. Through her firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject (treating) the members of the household with stern severity. There will be occasion for repentance, there will be peril, (but) there will (also) be good fortune. If the wife and children were to be smirking and chattering, in the end there would be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject (treating) the members of the household with stern severity. There will be occasion for repentance, there will be peril, (but) there will (also) be good fortune. If the wife and children were to be smirking and chattering, in the end there would be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject enriching the family. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject enriching the family. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the influence of the king extending to his family. There need be no anxiety; there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the influence of the king extending to his family. There need be no anxiety; there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kia Zan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject possessed of sincerity and arrayed in majesty. In the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject possessed of sincerity and arrayed in majesty. In the end there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE FAMILY. The perseverance of the woman furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE FAMILY. The perseverance of the woman furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The image of THE FAMILY.&#10;Thus the superior man has substance in his words&#10;And duration in his way of life.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The image of THE FAMILY.&#10;Thus the superior man has substance in his words&#10;And duration in his way of life.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Firm seclusion within the family.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Firm seclusion within the family.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">She should not follow her whims.&#10;She must attend within to the food.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">She should not follow her whims.&#10;She must attend within to the food.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When tempers flare up in the family,&#10;Too great severity brings remorse.&#10;Good fortune nonetheless.&#10;When woman and child dally and laugh,&#10;It leads in the end to humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When tempers flare up in the family,&#10;Too great severity brings remorse.&#10;Good fortune nonetheless.&#10;When woman and child dally and laugh,&#10;It leads in the end to humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">She is the treasure of the house.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">She is the treasure of the house.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">As a king he approaches his family.&#10;Fear not.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">As a king he approaches his family.&#10;Fear not.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">37</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Household</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">家人</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His work commands respect.&#10;In the end good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His work commands respect.&#10;In the end good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei indicates that, (notwithstanding the condition of things which it denotes), in small matters there will (still) be good success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei indicates that, (notwithstanding the condition of things which it denotes), in small matters there will (still) be good success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) fire above, and that for (the waters of) a marsh below, form Khwei. The superior man, in accordance with this, where there is a general agreement, yet admits diversity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) fire above, and that for (the waters of) a marsh below, form Khwei. The superior man, in accordance with this, where there is a general agreement, yet admits diversity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows that (to its subject) occasion for repentance will disappear. He has lost his horses, but let him not seek for them;—they will return of themselves. Should he meet with bad men, he will not err (in communicating with them).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows that (to its subject) occasion for repentance will disappear. He has lost his horses, but let him not seek for them;—they will return of themselves. Should he meet with bad men, he will not err (in communicating with them).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject happening to meet with his lord in a bye-passage. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject happening to meet with his lord in a bye-passage. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the third line, divided, we see one whose carriage is dragged back, while the oxen in it are pushed back, and he is himself subjected to the shaving of his head and the cutting off of his nose. There is no good beginning, but there will be a good end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the third line, divided, we see one whose carriage is dragged back, while the oxen in it are pushed back, and he is himself subjected to the shaving of his head and the cutting off of his nose. There is no good beginning, but there will be a good end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject solitary amidst the (prevailing) disunion. (But) he meets with the good man (represented by the first line), and they blend their sincere desires together. The position is one of peril, but there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject solitary amidst the (prevailing) disunion. (But) he meets with the good man (represented by the first line), and they blend their sincere desires together. The position is one of peril, but there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows that (to its subject) occasion for repentance will disappear. With his relative (and minister he unites closely and readily) as if he were biting through a piece of skin. When he goes forward (with this help), what error can there be?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows that (to its subject) occasion for repentance will disappear. With his relative (and minister he unites closely and readily) as if he were biting through a piece of skin. When he goes forward (with this help), what error can there be?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Khwei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject solitary amidst the (prevailing) disunion. (In the subject of the third line, he seems to) see a pig bearing on its back a load of mud, (or fancies) there is a carriage full of ghosts. He first bends his bow against him, and afterwards unbends it, (for he discovers) that he is not an assailant to injure, but a near relative. Going forward, he shall meet with (genial) rain, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject solitary amidst the (prevailing) disunion. (In the subject of the third line, he seems to) see a pig bearing on its back a load of mud, (or fancies) there is a carriage full of ghosts. He first bends his bow against him, and afterwards unbends it, (for he discovers) that he is not an assailant to injure, but a near relative. Going forward, he shall meet with (genial) rain, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OPPOSITION. In small matters, good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OPPOSITION. In small matters, good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Above, fire; below, the lake:&#10;The image of OPPOSITION.&#10;Thus amid all fellowship&#10;The superior man retains his individuality.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Above, fire; below, the lake:&#10;The image of OPPOSITION.&#10;Thus amid all fellowship&#10;The superior man retains his individuality.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.&#10;If you lose your horse, do not run after it;&#10;It will come back of its own accord.&#10;When you see evil people,&#10;Guard yourself against mistakes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.&#10;If you lose your horse, do not run after it;&#10;It will come back of its own accord.&#10;When you see evil people,&#10;Guard yourself against mistakes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One meets his lord in a narrow street.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One meets his lord in a narrow street.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One sees the wagon dragged back,&#10;The oxen halted,&#10;A man’s hair and nose cut off.&#10;Not a good beginning, but a good end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One sees the wagon dragged back,&#10;The oxen halted,&#10;A man’s hair and nose cut off.&#10;Not a good beginning, but a good end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Isolated through opposition,&#10;One meets a like-minded man&#10;With whom one can associate in good faith.&#10;Despite the danger, no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Isolated through opposition,&#10;One meets a like-minded man&#10;With whom one can associate in good faith.&#10;Despite the danger, no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.&#10;The companion bites his way through the wrappings.&#10;If one goes to him,&#10;How could it be a mistake?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears.&#10;The companion bites his way through the wrappings.&#10;If one goes to him,&#10;How could it be a mistake?</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">38</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Diversity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">睽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Isolated through opposition,&#10;One sees one’s companion as a pig covered with dirt,&#10;As a wagon full of devils.&#10;First one draws a bow against him,&#10;Then one lays the bow aside.&#10;He is not a robber; he will woo at the right time.&#10;As one goes, rain falls; then good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Isolated through opposition,&#10;One sees one’s companion as a pig covered with dirt,&#10;As a wagon full of devils.&#10;First one draws a bow against him,&#10;Then one lays the bow aside.&#10;He is not a robber; he will woo at the right time.&#10;As one goes, rain falls; then good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the state indicated by) Kien advantage will be found in the south-west, and the contrary in the north-east. It will be advantageous (also) to meet with the great man. (In these circumstances), with firmness and correctness, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the state indicated by) Kien advantage will be found in the south-west, and the contrary in the north-east. It will be advantageous (also) to meet with the great man. (In these circumstances), with firmness and correctness, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain, and above it that for water, form Kien. The superior man, in accordance with this, turns round (and examines) himself, and cultivates his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain, and above it that for water, form Kien. The superior man, in accordance with this, turns round (and examines) himself, and cultivates his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">From the first line, divided, we learn that advance (on the part of its subject) will lead to (greater) difficulties, while remaining stationary will afford ground for praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">From the first line, divided, we learn that advance (on the part of its subject) will lead to (greater) difficulties, while remaining stationary will afford ground for praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the minister of the king struggling with difficulty on difficulty, and not with a view to his own advantage.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the minister of the king struggling with difficulty on difficulty, and not with a view to his own advantage.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject advancing, (but only) to (greater) difficulties. He remains stationary, and returns (to his former associates).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject advancing, (but only) to (greater) difficulties. He remains stationary, and returns (to his former associates).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject advancing, (but only) to (greater) difficulties. He remains stationary, and unites (with the subject of the line above).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject advancing, (but only) to (greater) difficulties. He remains stationary, and unites (with the subject of the line above).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject struggling with the greatest difficulties, while friends are coming to help him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject struggling with the greatest difficulties, while friends are coming to help him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject going forward, (only to increase) the difficulties, while his remaining stationary will be (productive of) great (merit). There will be good fortune, and it will be advantageous to meet with the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject going forward, (only to increase) the difficulties, while his remaining stationary will be (productive of) great (merit). There will be good fortune, and it will be advantageous to meet with the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OBSTRUCTION. The southwest furthers.&#10;The northeast does not further.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OBSTRUCTION. The southwest furthers.&#10;The northeast does not further.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water on the mountain:&#10;The image of OBSTRUCTION.&#10;Thus the superior man turns his attention to himself&#10;And molds his character.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water on the mountain:&#10;The image of OBSTRUCTION.&#10;Thus the superior man turns his attention to himself&#10;And molds his character.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions,&#10;Coming meets with praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions,&#10;Coming meets with praise.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The king’s servant is beset by obstruction upon obstruction,&#10;But it is not his own fault.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The king’s servant is beset by obstruction upon obstruction,&#10;But it is not his own fault.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions;&#10;Hence he comes back.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions;&#10;Hence he comes back.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions,&#10;Coming leads to union.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions,&#10;Coming leads to union.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the midst of the greatest obstructions,&#10;Friends come.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the midst of the greatest obstructions,&#10;Friends come.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">39</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hardship</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">蹇</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions,&#10;Coming leads to great good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going leads to obstructions,&#10;Coming leads to great good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the state indicated by) Kieh advantage will be found in the south-west. If no (further) operations be called for, there will be good fortune in coming back (to the old conditions). If some operations be called for, there will be good fortune in the early conducting of them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the state indicated by) Kieh advantage will be found in the south-west. If no (further) operations be called for, there will be good fortune in coming back (to the old conditions). If some operations be called for, there will be good fortune in the early conducting of them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) thunder and that for rain, with these phenomena in a state of manifestation, form Kieh. The superior man, in accordance with this, forgives errors, and deals gently with crimes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) thunder and that for rain, with these phenomena in a state of manifestation, form Kieh. The superior man, in accordance with this, forgives errors, and deals gently with crimes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows that its subject will commit no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows that its subject will commit no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject catch, in hunting, three foxes, and obtain the yellow (= golden) arrows. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject catch, in hunting, three foxes, and obtain the yellow (= golden) arrows. With firm correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows a porter with his burden, (yet) riding in a carriage. He will (only) tempt robbers to attack him. However firm and correct he may (try to) be, there will be cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows a porter with his burden, (yet) riding in a carriage. He will (only) tempt robbers to attack him. However firm and correct he may (try to) be, there will be cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(To the subject of) the fourth line, undivided, (it is said), ‘Remove your toes. Friends will (then) come, between you and whom there will be mutual confidence.’</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(To the subject of) the fourth line, undivided, (it is said), ‘Remove your toes. Friends will (then) come, between you and whom there will be mutual confidence.’</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows (its subject), the superior man (= the ruler), executing his function of removing (whatever is injurious to the idea of the hexagram), in which case there will he good fortune, and confidence in him will be shown even by the small men.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows (its subject), the superior man (= the ruler), executing his function of removing (whatever is injurious to the idea of the hexagram), in which case there will he good fortune, and confidence in him will be shown even by the small men.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the sixth line, divided, we see a feudal prince (with his bow) shooting at a falcon on the top of a high wall, and hitting it. (The effect of his action) will be in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the sixth line, divided, we see a feudal prince (with his bow) shooting at a falcon on the top of a high wall, and hitting it. (The effect of his action) will be in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DELIVERANCE. The southwest furthers.&#10;If there is no longer anything where one has to go,&#10;Return brings good fortune.&#10;If there is still something where one has to go,&#10;Hastening brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DELIVERANCE. The southwest furthers.&#10;If there is no longer anything where one has to go,&#10;Return brings good fortune.&#10;If there is still something where one has to go,&#10;Hastening brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder and rain set in:&#10;The image of DELIVERANCE.&#10;Thus the superior man pardons mistakes&#10;And forgives misdeeds.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder and rain set in:&#10;The image of DELIVERANCE.&#10;Thus the superior man pardons mistakes&#10;And forgives misdeeds.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One kills three foxes in the field&#10;And receives a yellow arrow.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One kills three foxes in the field&#10;And receives a yellow arrow.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If a man carries a burden on his back&#10;And nonetheless rides in a carriage,&#10;He thereby encourages robbers to draw near.&#10;Perseverance leads to humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If a man carries a burden on his back&#10;And nonetheless rides in a carriage,&#10;He thereby encourages robbers to draw near.&#10;Perseverance leads to humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deliver yourself from your great toe.&#10;Then the companion comes,&#10;And him you can trust.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Deliver yourself from your great toe.&#10;Then the companion comes,&#10;And him you can trust.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If only the superior man can deliver himself,&#10;It brings good fortune.&#10;Thus he proves to inferior men that he is in earnest.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If only the superior man can deliver himself,&#10;It brings good fortune.&#10;Thus he proves to inferior men that he is in earnest.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">40</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Relief</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">解</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The prince shoots at a hawk on a high wall.&#10;He kills it. Everything serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The prince shoots at a hawk on a high wall.&#10;He kills it. Everything serves to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (what is denoted by) Sun, if there be sincerity (in him who employs it), there will be great good fortune:—freedom from error; firmness and correctness that can be maintained; and advantage in every movement that shall be made. In what shall this (sincerity in the exercise of Sun) be employed? (Even) in sacrifice two baskets of grain, (though there be nothing else), may be presented.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (what is denoted by) Sun, if there be sincerity (in him who employs it), there will be great good fortune:—freedom from error; firmness and correctness that can be maintained; and advantage in every movement that shall be made. In what shall this (sincerity in the exercise of Sun) be employed? (Even) in sacrifice two baskets of grain, (though there be nothing else), may be presented.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and beneath it that for the waters of a marsh form Sun. The superior man, in accordance with this, restrains his wrath and represses his desires.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and beneath it that for the waters of a marsh form Sun. The superior man, in accordance with this, restrains his wrath and represses his desires.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject suspending his own affairs, and hurrying away (to help the subject of the fourth line). He will commit no error, but let him consider how far he should contribute of what is his (for the other).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject suspending his own affairs, and hurrying away (to help the subject of the fourth line). He will commit no error, but let him consider how far he should contribute of what is his (for the other).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows that it will be advantageous for its subject to maintain a firm correctness, and that action on his part will be evil. He can give increase (to his correlate) without taking from himself</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows that it will be advantageous for its subject to maintain a firm correctness, and that action on his part will be evil. He can give increase (to his correlate) without taking from himself</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows how of three men walking together, the number is diminished by one; and how one, walking, finds his friend.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows how of three men walking together, the number is diminished by one; and how one, walking, finds his friend.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject diminishing the ailment under which he labours by making (the subject of the first line) hasten (to his help), and make him glad. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject diminishing the ailment under which he labours by making (the subject of the first line) hasten (to his help), and make him glad. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows parties adding to (the stores of) its subject ten pairs of tortoise shells, and accepting no refusal. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows parties adding to (the stores of) its subject ten pairs of tortoise shells, and accepting no refusal. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject giving increase to others without taking from himself. There will be no error. With firm correctness there will be good fortune. There will be advantage in every movement that shall be made. He will find ministers more than can be counted by their clans.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject giving increase to others without taking from himself. There will be no error. With firm correctness there will be good fortune. There will be advantage in every movement that shall be made. He will find ministers more than can be counted by their clans.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DECREASE combined with sincerity&#10;Brings about supreme good fortune&#10;Without blame.&#10;One may be persevering in this.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.&#10;How is this to be carried out?&#10;One may use two small bowls for the sacrifice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DECREASE combined with sincerity&#10;Brings about supreme good fortune&#10;Without blame.&#10;One may be persevering in this.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.&#10;How is this to be carried out?&#10;One may use two small bowls for the sacrifice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the foot of the mountain, the lake:&#10;The image of DECREASE.&#10;Thus the superior man controls his anger&#10;And restrains his instincts.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the foot of the mountain, the lake:&#10;The image of DECREASE.&#10;Thus the superior man controls his anger&#10;And restrains his instincts.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going quickly when one’s tasks are finished&#10;Is without blame.&#10;But one must reflect on how much one may decrease others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Going quickly when one’s tasks are finished&#10;Is without blame.&#10;But one must reflect on how much one may decrease others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance furthers.&#10;To undertake something brings misfortune.&#10;Without decreasing oneself,&#10;One is able to bring increase to others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance furthers.&#10;To undertake something brings misfortune.&#10;Without decreasing oneself,&#10;One is able to bring increase to others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When three people journey together,&#10;Their number decreases by one.&#10;When one man journeys alone,&#10;He finds a companion.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When three people journey together,&#10;Their number decreases by one.&#10;When one man journeys alone,&#10;He finds a companion.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If a man decreases his faults,&#10;It makes the other hasten to come and rejoice.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If a man decreases his faults,&#10;It makes the other hasten to come and rejoice.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Someone does indeed increase him.&#10;Ten pairs of tortoises cannot oppose it.&#10;Supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Someone does indeed increase him.&#10;Ten pairs of tortoises cannot oppose it.&#10;Supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">41</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Decreasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">損</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one is increased without depriving others,&#10;There is no blame.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.&#10;One obtains servants&#10;But no longer has a separate home.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one is increased without depriving others,&#10;There is no blame.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.&#10;One obtains servants&#10;But no longer has a separate home.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yî indicates that (in the state which it denotes) there will be advantage in every movement which shall be undertaken, that it will be advantageous (even) to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yî indicates that (in the state which it denotes) there will be advantage in every movement which shall be undertaken, that it will be advantageous (even) to cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wind and that for thunder form Yî. The superior man, in accordance with this, when he sees what is good, moves towards it; and when he sees his errors, he turns from them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wind and that for thunder form Yî. The superior man, in accordance with this, when he sees what is good, moves towards it; and when he sees his errors, he turns from them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows that it will be advantageous for its subject in his position to make a great movement. If it be greatly fortunate, no blame will be imputed to him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows that it will be advantageous for its subject in his position to make a great movement. If it be greatly fortunate, no blame will be imputed to him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows parties adding to the stores of its subject ten pairs of tortoise shells whose oracles cannot be opposed. Let him persevere in being firm and correct, and there will be good fortune. Let the king, (having the virtues thus distinguished), employ them in presenting his offerings to God, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows parties adding to the stores of its subject ten pairs of tortoise shells whose oracles cannot be opposed. Let him persevere in being firm and correct, and there will be good fortune. Let the king, (having the virtues thus distinguished), employ them in presenting his offerings to God, and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows increase given to its subject by means of what is evil, so that he shall (be led to good), and be without blame. Let him be sincere and pursue the path of the Mean, (so shall he secure the recognition of the ruler, like) an officer who announces himself to his prince by the symbol of his rank.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows increase given to its subject by means of what is evil, so that he shall (be led to good), and be without blame. Let him be sincere and pursue the path of the Mean, (so shall he secure the recognition of the ruler, like) an officer who announces himself to his prince by the symbol of his rank.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject pursuing the due course. His advice to his prince is followed. He can with advantage be relied on in such a movement as that of removing the capital.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject pursuing the due course. His advice to his prince is followed. He can with advantage be relied on in such a movement as that of removing the capital.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject with sincere heart seeking to benefit (all below). There need be no question about it; the result will be great good fortune. (All below) will with sincere heart acknowledge his goodness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject with sincere heart seeking to benefit (all below). There need be no question about it; the result will be great good fortune. (All below) will with sincere heart acknowledge his goodness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Yi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the sixth line, undivided, we see one to whose increase none will contribute, while many will seek to assail him. He observes no regular rule in the ordering of his heart. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the sixth line, undivided, we see one to whose increase none will contribute, while many will seek to assail him. He observes no regular rule in the ordering of his heart. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INCREASE. It furthers one&#10;To undertake something.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INCREASE. It furthers one&#10;To undertake something.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wind and thunder: the image of&#10;INCREASE.&#10;Thus the superior man:&#10;If he sees good, he imitates it;&#10;If he has faults, he rids himself of them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wind and thunder: the image of&#10;INCREASE.&#10;Thus the superior man:&#10;If he sees good, he imitates it;&#10;If he has faults, he rids himself of them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It furthers one to accomplish great deeds.&#10;Supreme good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It furthers one to accomplish great deeds.&#10;Supreme good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Someone does indeed increase him;&#10;Ten pairs of tortoises cannot oppose it.&#10;Constant perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;The king presents him before God.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Someone does indeed increase him;&#10;Ten pairs of tortoises cannot oppose it.&#10;Constant perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;The king presents him before God.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One is enriched through unfortunate events.&#10;No blame, if you are sincere&#10;And walk in the middle,&#10;And report with a seal to the prince.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One is enriched through unfortunate events.&#10;No blame, if you are sincere&#10;And walk in the middle,&#10;And report with a seal to the prince.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you walk in the middle&#10;And report to the prince,&#10;He will follow.&#10;It furthers one to be used&#10;In the removal of the capital.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you walk in the middle&#10;And report to the prince,&#10;He will follow.&#10;It furthers one to be used&#10;In the removal of the capital.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If in truth you have a kind heart, ask not.&#10;Supreme good fortune.&#10;Truly, kindness will be recognized as your virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If in truth you have a kind heart, ask not.&#10;Supreme good fortune.&#10;Truly, kindness will be recognized as your virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">42</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Increasing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">益</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brings increase to no one.&#10;Indeed, someone even strikes him.&#10;He does not keep his heart constantly steady.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brings increase to no one.&#10;Indeed, someone even strikes him.&#10;He does not keep his heart constantly steady.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwâi requires (in him who would fulfil its meaning) the exhibition (of the culprit’s guilt) in the royal court, and a sincere and earnest appeal (for sympathy and support), with a consciousness of the peril (involved in cutting off the criminal). He should (also) make announcement in his own city, and show that it will not be well to have recourse at once to arms. (In this way) there will be advantage in whatever he shall go forward to.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwâi requires (in him who would fulfil its meaning) the exhibition (of the culprit’s guilt) in the royal court, and a sincere and earnest appeal (for sympathy and support), with a consciousness of the peril (involved in cutting off the criminal). He should (also) make announcement in his own city, and show that it will not be well to have recourse at once to arms. (In this way) there will be advantage in whatever he shall go forward to.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) heaven and that for the waters of a marsh mounting above it form Kwâi. The superior man, in accordance with this, bestows emolument on those below him, and dislikes allowing his gifts to accumulate (undispensed).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) heaven and that for the waters of a marsh mounting above it form Kwâi. The superior man, in accordance with this, bestows emolument on those below him, and dislikes allowing his gifts to accumulate (undispensed).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject in (the pride of) strength advancing with his toes. He goes forward, but will not succeed. There will be ground for blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject in (the pride of) strength advancing with his toes. He goes forward, but will not succeed. There will be ground for blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject full of apprehension and appealing (for sympathy and help). Late at night hostile measures may be (taken against him), but he need not be anxious about them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject full of apprehension and appealing (for sympathy and help). Late at night hostile measures may be (taken against him), but he need not be anxious about them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject (about to advance) with strong (and determined) looks. There will be evil. (But) the superior man, bent on cutting off (the criminal), will walk alone and encounter the rain, (till he be hated by his proper associates) as if he were contaminated (by the others). (In the end) there will be no blame against him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject (about to advance) with strong (and determined) looks. There will be evil. (But) the superior man, bent on cutting off (the criminal), will walk alone and encounter the rain, (till he be hated by his proper associates) as if he were contaminated (by the others). (In the end) there will be no blame against him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows one from whose buttocks the skin has been stripped, and who walks slowly and with difficulty. (If he could act) like. a sheep led (after its companions), occasion for repentance would disappear. But though he hear these words, he will not believe them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows one from whose buttocks the skin has been stripped, and who walks slowly and with difficulty. (If he could act) like. a sheep led (after its companions), occasion for repentance would disappear. But though he hear these words, he will not believe them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows (the small men like) a bed of purslain, which ought to be uprooted with the utmost determination. (The subject of the line having such determination), his action, in harmony with his central position, will lead to no error or blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows (the small men like) a bed of purslain, which ought to be uprooted with the utmost determination. (The subject of the line having such determination), his action, in harmony with his central position, will lead to no error or blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwai</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows its subject without any (helpers) on whom to call. His end will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows its subject without any (helpers) on whom to call. His end will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BREAK-THROUGH. One must resolutely make the matter known&#10;At the court of the king.&#10;It must be announced truthfully. Danger.&#10;It is necessary to notify one’s own city.&#10;It does not further to resort to arms.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BREAK-THROUGH. One must resolutely make the matter known&#10;At the court of the king.&#10;It must be announced truthfully. Danger.&#10;It is necessary to notify one’s own city.&#10;It does not further to resort to arms.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The lake has risen up to heaven:&#10;The image of BREAK-THROUGH.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Dispenses riches downward&#10;And refrains from resting on his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The lake has risen up to heaven:&#10;The image of BREAK-THROUGH.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Dispenses riches downward&#10;And refrains from resting on his virtue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mighty in the forward-striding toes.&#10;When one goes and is not equal to the task,&#10;One makes a mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mighty in the forward-striding toes.&#10;When one goes and is not equal to the task,&#10;One makes a mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A cry of alarm. Arms at evening and at night.&#10;Fear nothing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A cry of alarm. Arms at evening and at night.&#10;Fear nothing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be powerful in the cheekbones&#10;Brings misfortune.&#10;The superior man is firmly resolved.&#10;He walks alone and is caught in the rain.&#10;He is bespattered,&#10;And people murmur against him.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">To be powerful in the cheekbones&#10;Brings misfortune.&#10;The superior man is firmly resolved.&#10;He walks alone and is caught in the rain.&#10;He is bespattered,&#10;And people murmur against him.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no skin on his thighs,&#10;And walking comes hard.&#10;If a man were to let himself be led like a sheep,&#10;Remorse would disappear.&#10;But if these words are heard&#10;They will not be believed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no skin on his thighs,&#10;And walking comes hard.&#10;If a man were to let himself be led like a sheep,&#10;Remorse would disappear.&#10;But if these words are heard&#10;They will not be believed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In dealing with weeds,&#10;Firm resolution is necessary.&#10;Walking in the middle&#10;Remains free of blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In dealing with weeds,&#10;Firm resolution is necessary.&#10;Walking in the middle&#10;Remains free of blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">43</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Eliminating</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">夬</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No cry.&#10;In the end misfortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No cry.&#10;In the end misfortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kâu shows a female who is bold and strong. It will not be good to marry (such) a female.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kâu shows a female who is bold and strong. It will not be good to marry (such) a female.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wind and that for the sky above it form Kâu. The sovereign, in accordance with this, delivers his charges, and promulgates his announcements throughout the four quarters (of the kingdom).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wind and that for the sky above it form Kâu. The sovereign, in accordance with this, delivers his charges, and promulgates his announcements throughout the four quarters (of the kingdom).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows how its subject should be kept (like a carriage) tied and fastened to a metal drag, in which case with firm correctness there will be good fortune. (But) if he move in any direction, evil will appear. He will be (like) a lean pig, which is sure to keep jumping about.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows how its subject should be kept (like a carriage) tied and fastened to a metal drag, in which case with firm correctness there will be good fortune. (But) if he move in any direction, evil will appear. He will be (like) a lean pig, which is sure to keep jumping about.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject with a wallet of fish. There will be no error. But it will not be well to let (the subject of the first line) go forward to the guests.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject with a wallet of fish. There will be no error. But it will not be well to let (the subject of the first line) go forward to the guests.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one from whose buttocks the skin has been stripped so that he walks with difficulty. The position is perilous, but there will be no great error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows one from whose buttocks the skin has been stripped so that he walks with difficulty. The position is perilous, but there will be no great error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject with his wallet, but no fish in it. This will give rise to evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject with his wallet, but no fish in it. This will give rise to evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, (shows its subject as) a medlar tree overspreading the gourd (beneath it). If he keep his brilliant qualities concealed, (a good issue) will descend (as) from Heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, (shows its subject as) a medlar tree overspreading the gourd (beneath it). If he keep his brilliant qualities concealed, (a good issue) will descend (as) from Heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kau</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject receiving others on his horns. There will be occasion for regret, but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject receiving others on his horns. There will be occasion for regret, but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">COMING TO MEET. The maiden is powerful.&#10;One should not marry such a maiden.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">COMING TO MEET. The maiden is powerful.&#10;One should not marry such a maiden.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Under heaven, wind:&#10;The image of COMING TO MEET.&#10;Thus does the prince act when disseminating his commands&#10;And proclaiming them to the four quarters of heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Under heaven, wind:&#10;The image of COMING TO MEET.&#10;Thus does the prince act when disseminating his commands&#10;And proclaiming them to the four quarters of heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It must be checked with a brake of bronze.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;If one lets it take its course, one experiences misfortune.&#10;Even a lean pig has it in him to rage around.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">It must be checked with a brake of bronze.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;If one lets it take its course, one experiences misfortune.&#10;Even a lean pig has it in him to rage around.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is a fish in the tank. No blame.&#10;Does not further guests.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is a fish in the tank. No blame.&#10;Does not further guests.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no skin on his thighs,&#10;And walking comes hard.&#10;If one is mindful of the danger,&#10;No great mistake is made.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no skin on his thighs,&#10;And walking comes hard.&#10;If one is mindful of the danger,&#10;No great mistake is made.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No fish in the tank.&#10;This leads to misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No fish in the tank.&#10;This leads to misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A melon covered with willow leaves.&#10;Hidden lines.&#10;Then it drops down to one from heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A melon covered with willow leaves.&#10;Hidden lines.&#10;Then it drops down to one from heaven.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">44</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Encountering</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">姤</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He comes to meet with his horns.&#10;Humiliation. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He comes to meet with his horns.&#10;Humiliation. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the state denoted by) Žhui, the king will repair to his ancestral temple. It will be advantageous (also) to meet with the great man; and then there will be progress and success, though the advantage must come through firm correctness. The use of great victims will conduce to good fortune; and in whatever direction movement is made, it will be advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the state denoted by) Žhui, the king will repair to his ancestral temple. It will be advantageous (also) to meet with the great man; and then there will be progress and success, though the advantage must come through firm correctness. The use of great victims will conduce to good fortune; and in whatever direction movement is made, it will be advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the) earth and that for the waters of a marsh raised above it form Žhui. The superior man, in accordance with this, has his weapons of war put in good repair, to be prepared against unforeseen contingencies.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the) earth and that for the waters of a marsh raised above it form Žhui. The superior man, in accordance with this, has his weapons of war put in good repair, to be prepared against unforeseen contingencies.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject with a sincere desire (for union), but unable to carry it out, so that disorder is brought into the sphere of his union. If he cry out (for help to his proper correlate), all at once (his tears) will give place to smiles. He need not mind (the temporary difficulty); as he goes forward, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject with a sincere desire (for union), but unable to carry it out, so that disorder is brought into the sphere of his union. If he cry out (for help to his proper correlate), all at once (his tears) will give place to smiles. He need not mind (the temporary difficulty); as he goes forward, there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject led forward (by his correlate). There will be good fortune, and freedom from error. There is entire sincerity, and in that case (even the small offerings of) the vernal sacrifice are acceptable.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject led forward (by his correlate). There will be good fortune, and freedom from error. There is entire sincerity, and in that case (even the small offerings of) the vernal sacrifice are acceptable.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject striving after union and seeming to sigh, yet nowhere finding any advantage. If he go forward, he will not err, though there may be some small cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject striving after union and seeming to sigh, yet nowhere finding any advantage. If he go forward, he will not err, though there may be some small cause for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject in such a state that, if he be greatly fortunate, he will receive no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject in such a state that, if he be greatly fortunate, he will receive no blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the union (of all) under its subject in the place of dignity. There will be no error. If any do not have confidence in him, let him see to it that (his virtue) be great, long-continued, and firmly correct, and all occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the union (of all) under its subject in the place of dignity. There will be no error. If any do not have confidence in him, let him see to it that (his virtue) be great, long-continued, and firmly correct, and all occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tsui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject sighing and weeping; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject sighing and weeping; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GATHERING TOGETHER. Success.&#10;The king approaches his temple.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.&#10;This brings success. Perseverance furthers.&#10;To bring great offerings creates good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">GATHERING TOGETHER. Success.&#10;The king approaches his temple.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.&#10;This brings success. Perseverance furthers.&#10;To bring great offerings creates good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to undertake something.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Over the earth, the lake:&#10;The image of GATHERING TOGETHER.&#10;Thus the superior man renews his weapons&#10;In order to meet the unforeseen.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Over the earth, the lake:&#10;The image of GATHERING TOGETHER.&#10;Thus the superior man renews his weapons&#10;In order to meet the unforeseen.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you are sincere, but not to the end,&#10;There will sometimes be confusion, sometimes gathering together.&#10;If you call out,&#10;Then after one grasp of the hand you can laugh again.&#10;Regret not. Going is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If you are sincere, but not to the end,&#10;There will sometimes be confusion, sometimes gathering together.&#10;If you call out,&#10;Then after one grasp of the hand you can laugh again.&#10;Regret not. Going is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Letting oneself be drawn&#10;Brings good fortune and remains blameless.&#10;If one is sincere,&#10;It furthers one to bring even a small offering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Letting oneself be drawn&#10;Brings good fortune and remains blameless.&#10;If one is sincere,&#10;It furthers one to bring even a small offering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Gathering together amid sighs.&#10;Nothing that would further.&#10;Going is without blame.&#10;Slight humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Gathering together amid sighs.&#10;Nothing that would further.&#10;Going is without blame.&#10;Slight humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Great good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If in gathering together one has position,&#10;This brings no blame.&#10;If there are some who are not yet sincerely in the work,&#10;Sublime and enduring perseverance is needed.&#10;Then remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If in gathering together one has position,&#10;This brings no blame.&#10;If there are some who are not yet sincerely in the work,&#10;Sublime and enduring perseverance is needed.&#10;Then remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">45</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Bringing Together</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">萃</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lamenting and sighing, floods of tears.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lamenting and sighing, floods of tears.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shăng indicates that (under its conditions) there will be great progress and success. Seeking by (the qualities implied in it) to meet with the great man, its subject need have no anxiety. Advance to the south will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shăng indicates that (under its conditions) there will be great progress and success. Seeking by (the qualities implied in it) to meet with the great man, its subject need have no anxiety. Advance to the south will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wood and that for the earth with the wood growing in the midst of it form Shăng. The superior man, in accordance with this, pays careful attention to his virtue, and accumulates the small developments of it till it is high and great.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wood and that for the earth with the wood growing in the midst of it form Shăng. The superior man, in accordance with this, pays careful attention to his virtue, and accumulates the small developments of it till it is high and great.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject advancing upwards with the welcome (of those above him). There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject advancing upwards with the welcome (of those above him). There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject with that sincerity which will make even the (small) offerings of the vernal sacrifice acceptable. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject with that sincerity which will make even the (small) offerings of the vernal sacrifice acceptable. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject ascending upwards (as into) an empty city.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject ascending upwards (as into) an empty city.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject employed by the king to present his offerings on mount Khî. There will be good fortune; there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject employed by the king to present his offerings on mount Khî. There will be good fortune; there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows its subject firmly correct, and therefore enjoying good fortune. He ascends the stairs (with all due ceremony).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows its subject firmly correct, and therefore enjoying good fortune. He ascends the stairs (with all due ceremony).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shang</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth six, divided, shows its subject advancing upwards blindly. Advantage will be found in a ceaseless maintenance of firm correctness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth six, divided, shows its subject advancing upwards blindly. Advantage will be found in a ceaseless maintenance of firm correctness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PUSHING UPWARD has supreme success.&#10;One must see the great man.&#10;Fear not.&#10;Departure toward the south&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PUSHING UPWARD has supreme success.&#10;One must see the great man.&#10;Fear not.&#10;Departure toward the south&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Within the earth, wood grows:&#10;The image of PUSHING UPWARD.&#10;Thus the superior man of devoted character&#10;Heaps up small things&#10;In order to achieve something high and great.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Within the earth, wood grows:&#10;The image of PUSHING UPWARD.&#10;Thus the superior man of devoted character&#10;Heaps up small things&#10;In order to achieve something high and great.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pushing upward that meets with confidence&#10;Brings great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pushing upward that meets with confidence&#10;Brings great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one is sincere,&#10;It furthers one to bring even a small offering.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one is sincere,&#10;It furthers one to bring even a small offering.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One pushes upward into an empty city.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One pushes upward into an empty city.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The king offers him Mount Ch’i.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The king offers him Mount Ch’i.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;One pushes upward by steps.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;One pushes upward by steps.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">46</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Growing Upward</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">升</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pushing upward in darkness.&#10;It furthers one&#10;To be unremittingly persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Pushing upward in darkness.&#10;It furthers one&#10;To be unremittingly persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the condition denoted by) Khwăn there may (yet be) progress and success. For the firm and correct, the (really) great man, there will be good fortune. He will fall into no error. If he make speeches, his words cannot be made good.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In (the condition denoted by) Khwăn there may (yet be) progress and success. For the firm and correct, the (really) great man, there will be good fortune. He will fall into no error. If he make speeches, his words cannot be made good.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a marsh, and (below it that for a defile, which has drained the other dry so that there is) no water in it, form Khwăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, will sacrifice his life in order to carry out his purpose.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a marsh, and (below it that for a defile, which has drained the other dry so that there is) no water in it, form Khwăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, will sacrifice his life in order to carry out his purpose.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject with bare buttocks straitened under the stump of a tree. He enters a dark valley, and for three years has no prospect (of deliverance).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject with bare buttocks straitened under the stump of a tree. He enters a dark valley, and for three years has no prospect (of deliverance).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject straitened amidst his wine and viands. There come to him anon the red knee-covers (of the ruler). It will be well for him (to maintain his sincerity as) in sacrificing. Active operations (on his part) will lead to evil, but he will be free from blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject straitened amidst his wine and viands. There come to him anon the red knee-covers (of the ruler). It will be well for him (to maintain his sincerity as) in sacrificing. Active operations (on his part) will lead to evil, but he will be free from blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject straitened before a (frowning) rock. He lays hold of thorns. He enters his palace, and does not see his wife. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject straitened before a (frowning) rock. He lays hold of thorns. He enters his palace, and does not see his wife. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided shows its subject proceeding very slowly (to help the subject of the first line), who is straitened by the carriage adorned with metal in front of him. There will be occasion for regret, but the end will be good.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided shows its subject proceeding very slowly (to help the subject of the first line), who is straitened by the carriage adorned with metal in front of him. There will be occasion for regret, but the end will be good.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject with his nose and feet cut off. He is straitened by (his ministers in their) scarlet aprons. He is leisurely in his movements, however, and is satisfied. It will be well for him to be (as sincere) as in sacrificing (to spiritual beings).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject with his nose and feet cut off. He is straitened by (his ministers in their) scarlet aprons. He is leisurely in his movements, however, and is satisfied. It will be well for him to be (as sincere) as in sacrificing (to spiritual beings).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows its subject straitened, as if bound with creepers; or n a high and dangerous position, and saying (to himself), ‘If I move, I shall repent it.’ If he do repent of former errors, there will be good fortune in his going forward.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows its subject straitened, as if bound with creepers; or n a high and dangerous position, and saying (to himself), ‘If I move, I shall repent it.’ If he do repent of former errors, there will be good fortune in his going forward.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OPPRESSION. Success. Perseverance.&#10;The great man brings about good fortune.&#10;No blame.&#10;When one has something to say,&#10;It is not believed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">OPPPRESSION. Success. Perseverance.&#10;The great man brings about good fortune.&#10;No blame.&#10;When one has something to say,&#10;It is not believed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no water in the lake:&#10;The image of EXHAUSTION.&#10;Thus the superior man stakes his life&#10;On following his will.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is no water in the lake:&#10;The image of EXHAUSTION.&#10;Thus the superior man stakes his life&#10;On following his will.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One sits oppressed under a bare tree&#10;And strays into a gloomy valley.&#10;For three years one sees nothing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One sits oppressed under a bare tree&#10;And strays into a gloomy valley.&#10;For three years one sees nothing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One is oppressed while at meat and drink.&#10;The man with the scarlet knee bands is just coming.&#10;It furthers one to offer sacrifice.&#10;To set forth brings misfortune.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One is oppressed while at meat and drink.&#10;The man with the scarlet knee bands is just coming.&#10;It furthers one to offer sacrifice.&#10;To set forth brings misfortune.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A man permits himself to be oppressed by stone,&#10;And leans on thorns and thistles.&#10;He enters his house and does not see his wife.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A man permits himself to be oppressed by stone,&#10;And leans on thorns and thistles.&#10;He enters his house and does not see his wife.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He comes very quietly, oppressed in a golden carriage.&#10;Humiliation, but the end is reached.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He comes very quietly, oppressed in a golden carriage.&#10;Humiliation, but the end is reached.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His nose and feet are cut off.&#10;Oppression at the hands of the man with the purple knee bands.&#10;Joy comes softly.&#10;It furthers one to make offerings and libations.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His nose and feet are cut off.&#10;Oppression at the hands of the man with the purple knee bands.&#10;Joy comes softly.&#10;It furthers one to make offerings and libations.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">47</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Exhausting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">困</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He is oppressed by creeping vines.&#10;He moves uncertainly and says,&#10;“Movement brings remorse.”&#10;If one feels remorse over this and makes a start,&#10;Good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He is oppressed by creeping vines.&#10;He moves uncertainly and says,&#10;“Movement brings remorse.”&#10;If one feels remorse over this and makes a start,&#10;Good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Looking at) Žing, (we think of) how (the site of) a town may be changed, while (the fashion of) its wells undergoes no change. (The water of a well) never disappears and never receives (any great) increase, and those who come and those who go can draw and enjoy the benefit. If (the drawing) have nearly been accomplished, but, before the rope has quite reached the water, the bucket is broken, this is evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Looking at) Žing, (we think of) how (the site of) a town may be changed, while (the fashion of) its wells undergoes no change. (The water of a well) never disappears and never receives (any great) increase, and those who come and those who go can draw and enjoy the benefit. If (the drawing) have nearly been accomplished, but, before the rope has quite reached the water, the bucket is broken, this is evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wood and above it that for water form Žing. The superior man, in accordance with this, comforts the people, and. stimulates them to mutual helpfulness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wood and above it that for water form Žing. The superior man, in accordance with this, comforts the people, and. stimulates them to mutual helpfulness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows a well so muddy that men will not drink of it; or an old well to which neither birds (nor other creatures) resort.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows a well so muddy that men will not drink of it; or an old well to which neither birds (nor other creatures) resort.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows a well from which by a hole the water escapes and flows away to the shrimps (and such small creatures among the grass), or one the water of which leaks away from a broken basket.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows a well from which by a hole the water escapes and flows away to the shrimps (and such small creatures among the grass), or one the water of which leaks away from a broken basket.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows a well, which has been cleared out, but is not used. Our hearts are sorry for this, for the water might be drawn out and used. If the king were (only) intelligent, both he and we might receive the benefit of it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows a well, which has been cleared out, but is not used. Our hearts are sorry for this, for the water might be drawn out and used. If the king were (only) intelligent, both he and we might receive the benefit of it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows a well, the lining of which is well laid. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows a well, the lining of which is well laid. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows a clear, limpid well, (the waters from) whose cold spring are (freely) drunk.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows a clear, limpid well, (the waters from) whose cold spring are (freely) drunk.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">King</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows (the water from) the well brought to the top, which is not allowed to be covered. This suggests the idea of sincerity. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows (the water from) the well brought to the top, which is not allowed to be covered. This suggests the idea of sincerity. There will be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE WELL. The town may be changed,&#10;But the well cannot be changed.&#10;It neither decreases nor increases.&#10;They come and go and draw from the well.&#10;If one gets down almost to the water&#10;And the rope does not go all the way,&#10;Or the jug breaks, it brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE WELL. The town may be changed,&#10;But the well cannot be changed.&#10;It neither decreases nor increases.&#10;They come and go and draw from the well.&#10;If one gets down almost to the water&#10;And the rope does not go all the way,&#10;Or the jug breaks, it brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water over wood: the image of THE WELL.&#10;Thus the superior man encourages the people at their work,&#10;And exhorts them to help one another.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water over wood: the image of THE WELL.&#10;Thus the superior man encourages the people at their work,&#10;And exhorts them to help one another.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One does not drink the mud of the well.&#10;No animals come to an old well.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One does not drink the mud of the well.&#10;No animals come to an old well.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the wellhole one shoots fishes.&#10;The jug is broken and leaks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the wellhole one shoots fishes.&#10;The jug is broken and leaks.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The well is cleaned, but no one drinks from it.&#10;This is my heart’s sorrow,&#10;For one might draw from it.&#10;If the king were clear-minded,&#10;Good fortune might be enjoyed in common.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The well is cleaned, but no one drinks from it.&#10;This is my heart’s sorrow,&#10;For one might draw from it.&#10;If the king were clear-minded,&#10;Good fortune might be enjoyed in common.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The well is being lined. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The well is being lined. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the well there is a clear, cold spring&#10;From which one can drink.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In the well there is a clear, cold spring&#10;From which one can drink.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">48</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Replenishing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">井</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One draws from the well&#10;Without hindrance.&#10;It is dependable.&#10;Supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">One draws from the well&#10;Without hindrance.&#10;It is dependable.&#10;Supreme good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(What takes place as indicated by) Ko is believed in only after it has been accomplished. There will be great progress and success. Advantage will come from being firm and correct. (In that case) occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(What takes place as indicated by) Ko is believed in only after it has been accomplished. There will be great progress and success. Advantage will come from being firm and correct. (In that case) occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the waters of) a marsh and that for fire in the midst of them form Ko. The superior man, in accordance with this, regulates his (astronomical) calculations, and makes clear the seasons and times.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the waters of) a marsh and that for fire in the midst of them form Ko. The superior man, in accordance with this, regulates his (astronomical) calculations, and makes clear the seasons and times.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject (as if he were) bound with the skin of a yellow ox.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject (as if he were) bound with the skin of a yellow ox.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject making his changes after some time has passed. Action taken will be fortunate. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject making his changes after some time has passed. Action taken will be fortunate. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows that action taken by its subject will be evil. Though he be firm and correct, his position is perilous. If the change (he contemplates) have been three times fully discussed, he will be believed in.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows that action taken by its subject will be evil. Though he be firm and correct, his position is perilous. If the change (he contemplates) have been three times fully discussed, he will be believed in.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows occasion for repentance disappearing (from its subject). Let him be believed in; and though he change (existing) ordinances, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows occasion for repentance disappearing (from its subject). Let him be believed in; and though he change (existing) ordinances, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the great man (producing his changes) as the tiger (does when he) changes (his stripes). Before he divines (and proceeds to action), faith has been reposed in him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the great man (producing his changes) as the tiger (does when he) changes (his stripes). Before he divines (and proceeds to action), faith has been reposed in him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ko</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows the superior man producing his changes as the leopard (does when he) changes (his spots), while small men change their faces (and show their obedience). To go forward (now) would lead to evil, but there will be good fortune in abiding firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows the superior man producing his changes as the leopard (does when he) changes (his spots), while small men change their faces (and show their obedience). To go forward (now) would lead to evil, but there will be good fortune in abiding firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">REVOLUTION. On your own day&#10;You are believed.&#10;Supreme success,&#10;Furthering through perseverance.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">REVOLUTION. On your own day&#10;You are believed.&#10;Supreme success,&#10;Furthering through perseverance.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire in the lake: the image of&#10;REVOLUTION.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Sets the calendar in order&#10;And makes the seasons clear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire in the lake: the image of&#10;REVOLUTION.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Sets the calendar in order&#10;And makes the seasons clear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wrapped in the hide of a yellow cow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wrapped in the hide of a yellow cow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When one’s own day comes, one may create revolution.&#10;Starting brings good fortune.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When one’s own day comes, one may create revolution.&#10;Starting brings good fortune.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Starting brings misfortune.&#10;Perseverance brings danger.&#10;When talk of revolution has gone the rounds three times,&#10;One may commit himself,&#10;And men will believe him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Starting brings misfortune.&#10;Perseverance brings danger.&#10;When talk of revolution has gone the rounds three times,&#10;One may commit himself,&#10;And men will believe him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears. Men believe him.&#10;Changing the form of government brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse disappears. Men believe him.&#10;Changing the form of government brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The great man changes like a tiger.&#10;Even before he questions the oracle&#10;He is believed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The great man changes like a tiger.&#10;Even before he questions the oracle&#10;He is believed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">49</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abolishing The Old</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">革</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The superior man changes like a panther.&#10;The inferior man molts in the face.&#10;Starting brings misfortune.&#10;To remain persevering brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The superior man changes like a panther.&#10;The inferior man molts in the face.&#10;Starting brings misfortune.&#10;To remain persevering brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting gives the intimation of great progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting gives the intimation of great progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wood and above it that for fire form Ting. The superior man, in accordance with this, keeps his every position correct, and maintains secure the appointment (of Heaven).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) wood and above it that for fire form Ting. The superior man, in accordance with this, keeps his every position correct, and maintains secure the appointment (of Heaven).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the caldron overthrown and its feet turned up. (But) there will be advantage in its getting rid of what was bad in it. (Or it shows us) the concubine (whose position is improved) by means of her son. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the caldron overthrown and its feet turned up. (But) there will be advantage in its getting rid of what was bad in it. (Or it shows us) the concubine (whose position is improved) by means of her son. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows the caldron with the things (to be cooked) in it. (If its subject can say), ‘My enemy dislikes me, but he cannot approach me,’ there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows the caldron with the things (to be cooked) in it. (If its subject can say), ‘My enemy dislikes me, but he cannot approach me,’ there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows the caldron with (the places of) its ears changed. The progress (of its subject) is (thus) stopped. The fat flesh of the pheasant (which is in the caldron) will not be eaten. But the (genial) rain will come, and the grounds for repentance will disappear. There will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows the caldron with (the places of) its ears changed. The progress (of its subject) is (thus) stopped. The fat flesh of the pheasant (which is in the caldron) will not be eaten. But the (genial) rain will come, and the grounds for repentance will disappear. There will be good fortune in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the caldron with its feet broken; and its contents, designed for the ruler’s use, overturned and spilt. Its Subject will be made to blush for shame. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the caldron with its feet broken; and its contents, designed for the ruler’s use, overturned and spilt. Its Subject will be made to blush for shame. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows the caldron with yellow ears and rings of metal in them. There will be advantage through being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth six, divided, shows the caldron with yellow ears and rings of metal in them. There will be advantage through being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the caldron with rings of jade. There will be great good fortune, and all action taken will be in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the caldron with rings of jade. There will be great good fortune, and all action taken will be in every way advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CALDRON. Supreme good fortune.&#10;Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE CALDRON. Supreme good fortune.&#10;Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire over wood:&#10;The image of THE CALDRON.&#10;Thus the superior man consolidates his fate&#10;By making his position correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire over wood:&#10;The image of THE CALDRON.&#10;Thus the superior man consolidates his fate&#10;By making his position correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A ting with legs upturned.&#10;Furthers removal of stagnating stuff.&#10;One takes a concubine for the sake of her son.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A ting with legs upturned.&#10;Furthers removal of stagnating stuff.&#10;One takes a concubine for the sake of her son.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is food in the ting.&#10;My comrades are envious,&#10;But they cannot harm me.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is food in the ting.&#10;My comrades are envious,&#10;But they cannot harm me.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The handle of the ting is altered.&#10;One is impeded in his way of life.&#10;The fat of the pheasant is not eaten.&#10;Once rain falls, remorse is spent.&#10;Good fortune comes in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The handle of the ting is altered.&#10;One is impeded in his way of life.&#10;The fat of the pheasant is not eaten.&#10;Once rain falls, remorse is spent.&#10;Good fortune comes in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The legs of the ting are broken.&#10;The prince’s meal is spilled&#10;And his person is soiled.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The legs of the ting are broken.&#10;The prince’s meal is spilled&#10;And his person is soiled.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ting has yellow handles, golden carrying rings.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ting has yellow handles, golden carrying rings.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">50</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Establishing The New</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">鼎</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ting has rings of jade.&#10;Great good fortune.&#10;Nothing that would not act to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The ting has rings of jade.&#10;Great good fortune.&#10;Nothing that would not act to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kăn gives the intimation of ease and development. When (the time of) movement (which it indicates) comes, (the subject of the hexagram) will be found looking out with apprehension, and yet smiling and talking cheerfully. When the movement (like a crash of thunder) terrifies all within a hundred lî, he will be (like the sincere worshipper) who is not (startled into) letting go his ladle and (cup of) sacrificial spirits.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kăn gives the intimation of ease and development. When (the time of) movement (which it indicates) comes, (the subject of the hexagram) will be found looking out with apprehension, and yet smiling and talking cheerfully. When the movement (like a crash of thunder) terrifies all within a hundred lî, he will be (like the sincere worshipper) who is not (startled into) letting go his ladle and (cup of) sacrificial spirits.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) thunder, being repeated, forms Kăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, is fearful and apprehensive, cultivates (his virtue), and examines (his faults).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) thunder, being repeated, forms Kăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, is fearful and apprehensive, cultivates (his virtue), and examines (his faults).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject, when the movement approaches, looking out and around with apprehension, and afterwards smiling and talking cheerfully. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject, when the movement approaches, looking out and around with apprehension, and afterwards smiling and talking cheerfully. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject, when the movement approaches, in a position of peril. He judges it better to let go the articles (in his possession), and to ascend a very lofty height. There is no occasion for him to pursue after (the things he has let go); in seven days he will find them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject, when the movement approaches, in a position of peril. He judges it better to let go the articles (in his possession), and to ascend a very lofty height. There is no occasion for him to pursue after (the things he has let go); in seven days he will find them.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third six, divided, shows its subject distraught amid the startling movements going on. If those movements excite him to (right) action, there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third six, divided, shows its subject distraught amid the startling movements going on. If those movements excite him to (right) action, there will be no mistake.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject, amid the startling movements, supinely sinking (deeper) in the mud.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject, amid the startling movements, supinely sinking (deeper) in the mud.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject going and coming amidst the startling movements (of the time), and always in peril; but perhaps he will not incur loss, and find business (which he can accomplish).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject going and coming amidst the startling movements (of the time), and always in peril; but perhaps he will not incur loss, and find business (which he can accomplish).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject, amidst the startling movements (of the time), in breathless dismay and looking round him with trembling apprehension. If he take action, there will be evil. If, while the startling movements have not reached his own person and his neighbourhood, (he were to take precautions), there would be no error, though his relatives might (still) speak against him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject, amidst the startling movements (of the time), in breathless dismay and looking round him with trembling apprehension. If he take action, there will be evil. If, while the startling movements have not reached his own person and his neighbourhood, (he were to take precautions), there would be no error, though his relatives might (still) speak against him.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SHOCK brings success.&#10;Shock comes—oh, oh!&#10;Laughing words—ha, ha!&#10;The shock terrifies for a hundred miles,&#10;And he does not let fall the sacrificial spoon and chalice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">SHOCK brings success.&#10;Shock comes—oh, oh!&#10;Laughing words—ha, ha!&#10;The shock terrifies for a hundred miles,&#10;And he does not let fall the sacrificial spoon and chalice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder repeated: the image of SHOCK.&#10;Thus in fear and trembling&#10;The superior man sets his life in order&#10;And examines himself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder repeated: the image of SHOCK.&#10;Thus in fear and trembling&#10;The superior man sets his life in order&#10;And examines himself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock comes—oh, oh!&#10;Then follow laughing words—ha, ha!&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock comes—oh, oh!&#10;Then follow laughing words—ha, ha!&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock comes bringing danger.&#10;A hundred thousand times&#10;You lose your treasures&#10;And must climb the nine hills.&#10;Do not go in pursuit of them.&#10;After seven days you will get them back again.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock comes bringing danger.&#10;A hundred thousand times&#10;You lose your treasures&#10;And must climb the nine hills.&#10;Do not go in pursuit of them.&#10;After seven days you will get them back again.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock comes and makes one distraught.&#10;If shock spurs to action&#10;One remains free of misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock comes and makes one distraught.&#10;If shock spurs to action&#10;One remains free of misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock is mired.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock is mired.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock goes hither and thither.&#10;Danger.&#10;However, nothing at all is lost.&#10;Yet there are things to be done.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock goes hither and thither.&#10;Danger.&#10;However, nothing at all is lost.&#10;Yet there are things to be done.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">51</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Taking Action</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">震</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock brings ruin and terrified gazing around.&#10;Going ahead brings misfortune.&#10;If it has not yet touched one’s own body&#10;But has reached one’s neighbor first,&#10;There is no blame.&#10;One’s comrades have something to talk about.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Shock brings ruin and terrified gazing around.&#10;Going ahead brings misfortune.&#10;If it has not yet touched one’s own body&#10;But has reached one’s neighbor first,&#10;There is no blame.&#10;One’s comrades have something to talk about.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When one’s resting is like that of the back, and he loses all consciousness of self; when he walks in his courtyard, and does not see any (of the persons) in it,—there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When one’s resting is like that of the back, and he loses all consciousness of self; when he walks in his courtyard, and does not see any (of the persons) in it,—there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Two trigrams representing) a mountain, one over the other, form Kăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, does not go in his thoughts beyond the (duties of the) position in which he is.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Two trigrams representing) a mountain, one over the other, form Kăn. The superior man, in accordance with this, does not go in his thoughts beyond the (duties of the) position in which he is.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject keeping his toes at rest. There will be no error; but it will be advantageous for him to be persistently firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject keeping his toes at rest. There will be no error; but it will be advantageous for him to be persistently firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject keeping the calves of his legs at rest. He cannot help (the subject of the line above) whom he follows, and is dissatisfied in his mind.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject keeping the calves of his legs at rest. He cannot help (the subject of the line above) whom he follows, and is dissatisfied in his mind.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject keeping his loins at rest, and separating the ribs (from the body below). The situation is perilous, and the heart glows with suppressed excitement.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject keeping his loins at rest, and separating the ribs (from the body below). The situation is perilous, and the heart glows with suppressed excitement.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject keeping his trunk at rest. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject keeping his trunk at rest. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject keeping his jawbones at rest, so that his words are (all) orderly. Occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject keeping his jawbones at rest, so that his words are (all) orderly. Occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject devotedly maintaining his restfulness. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows its subject devotedly maintaining his restfulness. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">KEEPING STILL. Keeping his back still&#10;So that he no longer feels his body.&#10;He goes into his courtyard&#10;And does not see his people.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">KEEPING STILL. Keeping his back still&#10;So that he no longer feels his body.&#10;He goes into his courtyard&#10;And does not see his people.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mountains standing close together:&#10;The image of KEEPING STILL.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Does not permit his thoughts&#10;To go beyond his situation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Mountains standing close together:&#10;The image of KEEPING STILL.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Does not permit his thoughts&#10;To go beyond his situation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his toes still.&#10;No blame.&#10;Continued perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his toes still.&#10;No blame.&#10;Continued perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his calves still.&#10;He cannot rescue him whom he follows.&#10;His heart is not glad.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his calves still.&#10;He cannot rescue him whom he follows.&#10;His heart is not glad.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his hips still.&#10;Making his sacrum stiff.&#10;Dangerous. The heart suffocates.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his hips still.&#10;Making his sacrum stiff.&#10;Dangerous. The heart suffocates.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his trunk still.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his trunk still.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his jaws still.&#10;The words have order.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping his jaws still.&#10;The words have order.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">52</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Keeping Still</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">艮</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Noblehearted keeping still.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Noblehearted keeping still.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien suggests to us the marriage of a young lady, and the good fortune (attending it). There will be advantage in being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien suggests to us the marriage of a young lady, and the good fortune (attending it). There will be advantage in being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and above it that for a tree form Kien. The superior man, in accordance with this, attains to and maintains his extraordinary virtue, and makes the manners of the people good.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and above it that for a tree form Kien. The superior man, in accordance with this, attains to and maintains his extraordinary virtue, and makes the manners of the people good.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the wild geese gradually approaching the shore. A young officer (in similar circumstances) will be in a position of danger, and be spoken against; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the wild geese gradually approaching the shore. A young officer (in similar circumstances) will be in a position of danger, and be spoken against; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the geese gradually approaching the large rocks, where they eat and drink joyfully and at ease. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the geese gradually approaching the large rocks, where they eat and drink joyfully and at ease. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows them gradually advanced to the dry plains. (It suggests also the idea of) a husband who goes on an expedition from which he does not return, and of a wife who is pregnant, but will not nourish her child. There will be evil. (The case symbolised) might be advantageous in resisting plunderers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows them gradually advanced to the dry plains. (It suggests also the idea of) a husband who goes on an expedition from which he does not return, and of a wife who is pregnant, but will not nourish her child. There will be evil. (The case symbolised) might be advantageous in resisting plunderers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows the geese gradually advanced to the trees. They may light on the flat branches. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows the geese gradually advanced to the trees. They may light on the flat branches. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the geese gradually advanced to the high mound. (It suggests the idea of) a wife who for three years does not become pregnant; but in the end the natural issue cannot be prevented. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows the geese gradually advanced to the high mound. (It suggests the idea of) a wife who for three years does not become pregnant; but in the end the natural issue cannot be prevented. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kien</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the geese gradually advanced to the large heights (beyond). Their feathers can be used as ornaments. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the geese gradually advanced to the large heights (beyond). Their feathers can be used as ornaments. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DEVELOPMENT. The maiden&#10;Is given in marriage.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DEVELOPMENT. The maiden&#10;Is given in marriage.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On the mountain, a tree:&#10;The image of DEVELOPMENT.&#10;Thus the superior man abides in dignity and virtue,&#10;In order to improve the mores.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">On the mountain, a tree:&#10;The image of DEVELOPMENT.&#10;Thus the superior man abides in dignity and virtue,&#10;In order to improve the mores.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the shore.&#10;The young son is in danger.&#10;There is talk. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the shore.&#10;The young son is in danger.&#10;There is talk. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the cliff.&#10;Eating and drinking in peace and concord.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the cliff.&#10;Eating and drinking in peace and concord.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the plateau.&#10;The man goes forth and does not return.&#10;The woman carries a child but does not bring it forth.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;It furthers one to fight off robbers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the plateau.&#10;The man goes forth and does not return.&#10;The woman carries a child but does not bring it forth.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;It furthers one to fight off robbers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the tree.&#10;Perhaps it will find a flat branch. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the tree.&#10;Perhaps it will find a flat branch. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the summit.&#10;For three years the woman has no child.&#10;In the end nothing can hinder her.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the summit.&#10;For three years the woman has no child.&#10;In the end nothing can hinder her.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">53</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Developing Gradually</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">漸</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the cloud heights.&#10;Its feathers can be used for the sacred dance.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wild goose gradually draws near the cloud heights.&#10;Its feathers can be used for the sacred dance.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei indicates that (under the conditions which it denotes) action will be evil, and in no wise advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei indicates that (under the conditions which it denotes) action will be evil, and in no wise advantageous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the waters of) a marsh and over it that for thunder form Kwei Mei. The superior man, in accordance with this, having regard to the far-distant end, knows the mischief (that may be done at the beginning).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the waters of) a marsh and over it that for thunder form Kwei Mei. The superior man, in accordance with this, having regard to the far-distant end, knows the mischief (that may be done at the beginning).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows the younger sister married off in a position ancillary to the real wife. (It suggests the idea of) a person lame on one leg who yet manages to tramp along. Going forward will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows the younger sister married off in a position ancillary to the real wife. (It suggests the idea of) a person lame on one leg who yet manages to tramp along. Going forward will be fortunate.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows her blind of one eye, and yet able to see. There will be advantage in her maintaining the firm correctness of a solitary widow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows her blind of one eye, and yet able to see. There will be advantage in her maintaining the firm correctness of a solitary widow.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows the younger sister who was to be married off in a mean position. She returns and accepts an ancillary position.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows the younger sister who was to be married off in a mean position. She returns and accepts an ancillary position.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the younger sister who is to be married off protracting the time. She may be late in being married, but the time will come.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the younger sister who is to be married off protracting the time. She may be late in being married, but the time will come.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, reminds us of the marrying of the younger sister of (king) Tî-yî, when the sleeves of her the princess were not equal to those of the (still) younger sister who accompanied her in an inferior capacity. (The case suggests the thought of) the moon almost full. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, reminds us of the marrying of the younger sister of (king) Tî-yî, when the sleeves of her the princess were not equal to those of the (still) younger sister who accompanied her in an inferior capacity. (The case suggests the thought of) the moon almost full. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kwei Mei</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows the young lady bearing the basket, but without anything in it, and the gentleman slaughtering the sheep, but without blood flowing from it. There will be no advantage in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows the young lady bearing the basket, but without anything in it, and the gentleman slaughtering the sheep, but without blood flowing from it. There will be no advantage in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE MARRYING MAIDEN.&#10;Undertakings bring misfortune.&#10;Nothing that would further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE MARRYING MAIDEN.&#10;Undertakings bring misfortune.&#10;Nothing that would further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder over the lake:&#10;The image of THE MARRYING MAIDEN.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Understands the transitory&#10;In the light of the eternity of the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder over the lake:&#10;The image of THE MARRYING MAIDEN.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Understands the transitory&#10;In the light of the eternity of the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The marrying maiden as a concubine.&#10;A lame man who is able to tread.&#10;Undertakings bring good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The marrying maiden as a concubine.&#10;A lame man who is able to tread.&#10;Undertakings bring good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A one-eyed man who is able to see.&#10;The perseverance of a solitary man furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A one-eyed man who is able to see.&#10;The perseverance of a solitary man furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The marrying maiden as a slave.&#10;She marries as a concubine.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The marrying maiden as a slave.&#10;She marries as a concubine.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The marrying maiden draws out the allotted time.&#10;A late marriage comes in due course.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The marrying maiden draws out the allotted time.&#10;A late marriage comes in due course.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sovereign I gave his daughter in marriage.&#10;The embroidered garments of the princess&#10;Were not as gorgeous&#10;As those of the servingmaid.&#10;The moon that is nearly full&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sovereign I gave his daughter in marriage.&#10;The embroidered garments of the princess&#10;Were not as gorgeous&#10;As those of the servingmaid.&#10;The moon that is nearly full&#10;Brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">54</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Marrying Maiden</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">歸妹</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The woman holds the basket, but there are no fruits in it.&#10;The man stabs the sheep, but no blood flows.&#10;Nothing that acts to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The woman holds the basket, but there are no fruits in it.&#10;The man stabs the sheep, but no blood flows.&#10;Nothing that acts to further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Făng intimates progress and development. When a king has reached the point (which the name denotes) there is no occasion to be anxious (through fear of a change). Let him be as the sun at noon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Făng intimates progress and development. When a king has reached the point (which the name denotes) there is no occasion to be anxious (through fear of a change). Let him be as the sun at noon.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams representing) thunder and lightning combine to form Făng. The superior man, in accordance with this, decides cases of litigation, and apportions punishments with exactness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigrams representing) thunder and lightning combine to form Făng. The superior man, in accordance with this, decides cases of litigation, and apportions punishments with exactness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject meeting with his mate. Though they are both of the same character, there will be no error. Advance will call forth approval.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject meeting with his mate. Though they are both of the same character, there will be no error. Advance will call forth approval.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject surrounded by screens so large and thick that at midday he can see from them the constellation of the Bushel. If he go (and try to enlighten his ruler who is thus emblemed), he will make himself to be viewed with suspicion and dislike. Let him cherish his feeling of sincere devotion that he may thereby move (his ruler’s mind), and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject surrounded by screens so large and thick that at midday he can see from them the constellation of the Bushel. If he go (and try to enlighten his ruler who is thus emblemed), he will make himself to be viewed with suspicion and dislike. Let him cherish his feeling of sincere devotion that he may thereby move (his ruler’s mind), and there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject with an (additional) screen of a large and thick banner, through which at midday he can see (the small) Mei star. (In the darkness) he breaks his right arm; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject with an (additional) screen of a large and thick banner, through which at midday he can see (the small) Mei star. (In the darkness) he breaks his right arm; but there will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">T he fourth line, undivided, shows its subject in a tent so large and thick that at midday he can see from it the constellation of the Bushel. But he meets with the subject of the (first) line, undivided like himself. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">T he fourth line, undivided, shows its subject in a tent so large and thick that at midday he can see from it the constellation of the Bushel. But he meets with the subject of the (first) line, undivided like himself. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject bringing around him the men of brilliant ability. There will be occasion for congratulation and praise. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject bringing around him the men of brilliant ability. There will be occasion for congratulation and praise. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fung</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject with his house made large, but only serving as a screen to his household. When he looks at his door, it is still, and there is nobody about it. For three years no one is to be seen. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject with his house made large, but only serving as a screen to his household. When he looks at his door, it is still, and there is nobody about it. For three years no one is to be seen. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ABUNDANCE has success.&#10;The king attains abundance.&#10;Be not sad.&#10;Be like the sun at midday.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">ABUNDANCE has success.&#10;The king attains abundance.&#10;Be not sad.&#10;Be like the sun at midday.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Both thunder and lightning come:&#10;The image of ABUNDANCE.&#10;Thus the superior man decides lawsuits&#10;And carries out punishments.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Both thunder and lightning come:&#10;The image of ABUNDANCE.&#10;Thus the superior man decides lawsuits&#10;And carries out punishments.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When a man meets his destined ruler,&#10;They can be together ten days,&#10;And it is not a mistake.&#10;Going meets with recognition.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">When a man meets his destined ruler,&#10;They can be together ten days,&#10;And it is not a mistake.&#10;Going meets with recognition.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The curtain is of such fullness&#10;That the polestars can be seen at noon.&#10;Through going one meets with mistrust and hate.&#10;If one rouses him through truth,&#10;Good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The curtain is of such fullness&#10;That the polestars can be seen at noon.&#10;Through going one meets with mistrust and hate.&#10;If one rouses him through truth,&#10;Good fortune comes.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The underbrush is of such abundance&#10;That the small stars can be seen at noon.&#10;He breaks his right arm. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The underbrush is of such abundance&#10;That the small stars can be seen at noon.&#10;He breaks his right arm. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The curtain is of such fullness&#10;That the polestars can be seen at noon.&#10;He meets his ruler, who is of like kind.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The curtain is of such fullness&#10;That the polestars can be seen at noon.&#10;He meets his ruler, who is of like kind.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lines are coming,&#10;Blessing and fame draw near.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lines are coming,&#10;Blessing and fame draw near.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">55</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Abundance</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">豐</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His house is in a state of abundance.&#10;He screens off his family.&#10;He peers through the gate&#10;And no longer perceives anyone.&#10;For three years he sees nothing.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His house is in a state of abundance.&#10;He screens off his family.&#10;He peers through the gate&#10;And no longer perceives anyone.&#10;For three years he sees nothing.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lü intimates that (in the condition which it denotes) there may be some little attainment and progress. If the stranger or traveller be firm and correct as he ought to be, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lü intimates that (in the condition which it denotes) there may be some little attainment and progress. If the stranger or traveller be firm and correct as he ought to be, there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and above it that for fire form Lü. The superior man, in accordance with this, exerts his wisdom and caution in the use of punishments and not allowing litigations to continue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a mountain and above it that for fire form Lü. The superior man, in accordance with this, exerts his wisdom and caution in the use of punishments and not allowing litigations to continue.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the stranger mean and meanly occupied. It is thus that he brings on himself (further) calamity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows the stranger mean and meanly occupied. It is thus that he brings on himself (further) calamity.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the stranger, occupying his lodging-house, carrying with him his means of livelihood, and provided with good and trusty servants.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows the stranger, occupying his lodging-house, carrying with him his means of livelihood, and provided with good and trusty servants.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows the stranger, burning his lodging-house, and having lost his servants. However firm and correct he (try to) be, he will be in peril.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows the stranger, burning his lodging-house, and having lost his servants. However firm and correct he (try to) be, he will be in peril.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the traveller in a resting-place, having (also) the means of livelihood and the axe, (but still saying), ‘I am not at ease in my mind.’</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows the traveller in a resting-place, having (also) the means of livelihood and the axe, (but still saying), ‘I am not at ease in my mind.’</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject shooting a pheasant. He will lose his arrow, but in the end he will obtain praise and a (high) charge.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject shooting a pheasant. He will lose his arrow, but in the end he will obtain praise and a (high) charge.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, suggests the idea of a bird burning its nest. The stranger, (thus represented), first laughs and then cries out. He has lost his ox(-like docility) too readily and easily. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, suggests the idea of a bird burning its nest. The stranger, (thus represented), first laughs and then cries out. He has lost his ox(-like docility) too readily and easily. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE WANDERER. Success through smallness.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune&#10;To the wanderer.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE WANDERER. Success through smallness.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune&#10;To the wanderer.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire on the mountain:&#10;The image of THE WANDERER.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Is clear-minded and cautious&#10;In imposing penalties,&#10;And protracts no lawsuits.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire on the mountain:&#10;The image of THE WANDERER.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Is clear-minded and cautious&#10;In imposing penalties,&#10;And protracts no lawsuits.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If the wanderer busies himself with trivial things,&#10;He draws down misfortune upon himself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If the wanderer busies himself with trivial things,&#10;He draws down misfortune upon himself.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wanderer comes to an inn.&#10;He has his property with him.&#10;He wins the steadfastness of a young servant.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wanderer comes to an inn.&#10;He has his property with him.&#10;He wins the steadfastness of a young servant.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wanderer’s inn burns down.&#10;He loses the steadfastness of his young servant.&#10;Danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wanderer’s inn burns down.&#10;He loses the steadfastness of his young servant.&#10;Danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wanderer rests in a shelter.&#10;He obtains his property and an ax.&#10;My heart is not glad.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wanderer rests in a shelter.&#10;He obtains his property and an ax.&#10;My heart is not glad.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He shoots a pheasant.&#10;It drops with the first arrow.&#10;In the end this brings both praise and office.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He shoots a pheasant.&#10;It drops with the first arrow.&#10;In the end this brings both praise and office.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">56</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Travelling</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">旅</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bird’s nest burns up.&#10;The wanderer laughs at first,&#10;Then must needs lament and weep.&#10;Through carelessness he loses his cow.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bird’s nest burns up.&#10;The wanderer laughs at first,&#10;Then must needs lament and weep.&#10;Through carelessness he loses his cow.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun intimates that (under the conditions which it denotes) there will be some little attainment and progress. There will be advantage in movement onward in whatever direction. It will be advantageous (also) to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun intimates that (under the conditions which it denotes) there will be some little attainment and progress. There will be advantage in movement onward in whatever direction. It will be advantageous (also) to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Two trigrams representing) wind, following each other, form Sun. The superior man, in accordance with this, reiterates his orders, and secures the practice of his affairs.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Two trigrams representing) wind, following each other, form Sun. The superior man, in accordance with this, reiterates his orders, and secures the practice of his affairs.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject (now) advancing, (now) receding. It would be advantageous for him to have the firm correctness of a brave soldier.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject (now) advancing, (now) receding. It would be advantageous for him to have the firm correctness of a brave soldier.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows the representative of Sun beneath a couch, and employing diviners and exorcists in a way bordering on confusion. There will be good fortune and no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows the representative of Sun beneath a couch, and employing diviners and exorcists in a way bordering on confusion. There will be good fortune and no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject penetrating (only) by violent and repeated efforts. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject penetrating (only) by violent and repeated efforts. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows all occasion for repentance (in its subject) passed away. He takes game for its threefold use in his hunting.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows all occasion for repentance (in its subject) passed away. He takes game for its threefold use in his hunting.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows that with firm correctness there will be good fortune (to its subject). All occasion for repentance will disappear, and all his movements will be advantageous. There may have been no (good) beginning, but there will be a (good) end. Three days before making any changes, (let him give notice of them); and three days after, (let him reconsider them). There will (thus) be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows that with firm correctness there will be good fortune (to its subject). All occasion for repentance will disappear, and all his movements will be advantageous. There may have been no (good) beginning, but there will be a (good) end. Three days before making any changes, (let him give notice of them); and three days after, (let him reconsider them). There will (thus) be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sun</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the representative of penetration beneath a couch, and having lost the axe with which he executed his decisions. However firm and correct he may (try to) be, there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, undivided, shows the representative of penetration beneath a couch, and having lost the axe with which he executed his decisions. However firm and correct he may (try to) be, there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE GENTLE. Success through what is small.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE GENTLE. Success through what is small.&#10;It furthers one to have somewhere to go.&#10;It furthers one to see the great man.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Winds following one upon the other:&#10;The image of THE GENTLY PENETRATING.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Spreads his commands abroad&#10;And carries out his undertakings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Winds following one upon the other:&#10;The image of THE GENTLY PENETRATING.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Spreads his commands abroad&#10;And carries out his undertakings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In advancing and in retreating,&#10;The perseverance of a warrior furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">In advancing and in retreating,&#10;The perseverance of a warrior furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Penetration under the bed.&#10;Priests and magicians are used in great number.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Penetration under the bed.&#10;Priests and magicians are used in great number.&#10;Good fortune. No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Repeated penetration. Humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Repeated penetration. Humiliation.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse vanishes.&#10;During the hunt&#10;Three kinds of game are caught.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Remorse vanishes.&#10;During the hunt&#10;Three kinds of game are caught.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse vanishes.&#10;Nothing that does not further.&#10;No beginning, but an end.&#10;Before the change, three days.&#10;After the change, three days.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse vanishes.&#10;Nothing that does not further.&#10;No beginning, but an end.&#10;Before the change, three days.&#10;After the change, three days.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">57</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Proceeding Humbly</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">巽</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Penetration under the bed.&#10;He loses his property and his ax.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Penetration under the bed.&#10;He loses his property and his ax.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui intimates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and attainment. (But) it will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui intimates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and attainment. (But) it will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Two symbols representing) the waters of a marsh, one over the other, form Tui. The superior man, in accordance with this, (encourages) the conversation of friends and (the stimulus of) their (common) practice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(Two symbols representing) the waters of a marsh, one over the other, form Tui. The superior man, in accordance with this, (encourages) the conversation of friends and (the stimulus of) their (common) practice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows the pleasure of (inward) harmony. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows the pleasure of (inward) harmony. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows the pleasure arising from (inward) sincerity. There will be good fortune. Occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows the pleasure arising from (inward) sincerity. There will be good fortune. Occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject bringing round himself whatever can give pleasure. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject bringing round himself whatever can give pleasure. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject deliberating about what to seek his pleasure in, and not at rest. He borders on what would be injurious, but there will be cause for joy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject deliberating about what to seek his pleasure in, and not at rest. He borders on what would be injurious, but there will be cause for joy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject trusting in one who would injure him. The situation is perilous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject trusting in one who would injure him. The situation is perilous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Tui</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows the pleasure of its subject in leading and attracting others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows the pleasure of its subject in leading and attracting others.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE JOYOUS. Success.&#10;Perseverance is favorable.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">THE JOYOUS. Success.&#10;Perseverance is favorable.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lakes resting one on the other:&#10;The image of THE JOYOUS.&#10;Thus the superior man joins with his friends&#10;For discussion and practice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Lakes resting one on the other:&#10;The image of THE JOYOUS.&#10;Thus the superior man joins with his friends&#10;For discussion and practice.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contented joyousness. Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contented joyousness. Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sincere joyousness. Good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sincere joyousness. Good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Coming joyousness. Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Coming joyousness. Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyousness that is weighed is not at peace.&#10;After ridding himself of mistakes a man has joy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyousness that is weighed is not at peace.&#10;After ridding himself of mistakes a man has joy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sincerity toward disintegrating influences is dangerous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sincerity toward disintegrating influences is dangerous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">58</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Joyful</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">兌</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seductive joyousness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Seductive joyousness.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwân intimates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and success. The king goes to his ancestral temple; and it will be advantageous to cross the great stream. It will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwân intimates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and success. The king goes to his ancestral temple; and it will be advantageous to cross the great stream. It will be advantageous to be firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) water and that for wind moving above the water form Hwân. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, presented offerings to God and established the ancestral temple.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) water and that for wind moving above the water form Hwân. The ancient kings, in accordance with this, presented offerings to God and established the ancestral temple.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject engaged in rescuing (from the impending evil) and having (the assistance of) a strong horse. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject engaged in rescuing (from the impending evil) and having (the assistance of) a strong horse. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject, amid the dispersion, hurrying to his contrivance (for security). All occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject, amid the dispersion, hurrying to his contrivance (for security). All occasion for repentance will disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject discarding any regard to his own person. There will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject discarding any regard to his own person. There will be no occasion for repentance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject scattering the (different) parties (in the state); which leads to great good fortune. From the dispersion (he collects again good men standing out, a crowd) like a mound, which is what ordinary men would not have thought of.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject scattering the (different) parties (in the state); which leads to great good fortune. From the dispersion (he collects again good men standing out, a crowd) like a mound, which is what ordinary men would not have thought of.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject amidst the dispersion issuing his great announcements as the perspiration (flows from his body). He scatters abroad (also) the accumulations in the royal granaries. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject amidst the dispersion issuing his great announcements as the perspiration (flows from his body). He scatters abroad (also) the accumulations in the royal granaries. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject disposing of (what may be called) its bloody wounds, and going and separating himself from its anxious fears. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject disposing of (what may be called) its bloody wounds, and going and separating himself from its anxious fears. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DISPERSION. Success.&#10;The king approaches his temple.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">DISPERSION. Success.&#10;The king approaches his temple.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind drives over the water:&#10;The image of DISPERSION.&#10;Thus the kings of old sacrificed to the Lord&#10;And built temples.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The wind drives over the water:&#10;The image of DISPERSION.&#10;Thus the kings of old sacrificed to the Lord&#10;And built temples.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brings help with the strength of a horse.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brings help with the strength of a horse.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the dissolution&#10;He hurries to that which supports him.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">At the dissolution&#10;He hurries to that which supports him.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He dissolves his self. No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He dissolves his self. No remorse.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He dissolves his bond with his group.&#10;Supreme good fortune.&#10;Dispersion leads in turn to accumulation.&#10;This is something that ordinary men do not think of.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He dissolves his bond with his group.&#10;Supreme good fortune.&#10;Dispersion leads in turn to accumulation.&#10;This is something that ordinary men do not think of.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His loud cries are as dissolving as sweat.&#10;Dissolution! A king abides without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">His loud cries are as dissolving as sweat.&#10;Dissolution! A king abides without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">59</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dispersing</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">渙</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He dissolves his blood.&#10;Departing, keeping at a distance, going out,&#10;Is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He dissolves his blood.&#10;Departing, keeping at a distance, going out,&#10;Is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh intimates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and attainment. (But) if the regulations (which it prescribes) be severe and difficult, they cannot be permanent.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh intimates that (under its conditions) there will be progress and attainment. (But) if the regulations (which it prescribes) be severe and difficult, they cannot be permanent.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a lake, and above it that for water, form Kieh. The superior man, in accordance with this, constructs his (methods of) numbering and measurement, and discusses (points of) virtue and conduct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a lake, and above it that for water, form Kieh. The superior man, in accordance with this, constructs his (methods of) numbering and measurement, and discusses (points of) virtue and conduct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject not quitting the courtyard outside his door. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject not quitting the courtyard outside his door. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject not quitting the courtyard inside his gate. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject not quitting the courtyard inside his gate. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject with no appearance of observing the (proper) regulations, in which case we shall see him lamenting. But there will be no one to blame (but himself).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject with no appearance of observing the (proper) regulations, in which case we shall see him lamenting. But there will be no one to blame (but himself).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject quietly and naturally (attentive to all) regulations. There will be progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject quietly and naturally (attentive to all) regulations. There will be progress and success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject sweetly and acceptably enacting his regulations. There will be good fortune. The onward progress with them will afford ground for admiration.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject sweetly and acceptably enacting his regulations. There will be good fortune. The onward progress with them will afford ground for admiration.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kieh</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject enacting regulations severe and difficult. Even with firmness and correctness there will be evil. But though there will be cause for repentance, it will (by and by) disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject enacting regulations severe and difficult. Even with firmness and correctness there will be evil. But though there will be cause for repentance, it will (by and by) disappear.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">LIMITATION. Success.&#10;Galling limitation must not be persevered in.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">LIMITATION. Success.&#10;Galling limitation must not be persevered in.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water over lake: the image of&#10;LIMITATION.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Creates number and measure,&#10;And examines the nature of virtue and correct conduct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water over lake: the image of&#10;LIMITATION.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Creates number and measure,&#10;And examines the nature of virtue and correct conduct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not going out of the door and the courtyard&#10;Is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not going out of the door and the courtyard&#10;Is without blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not going out of the gate and the courtyard&#10;Brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not going out of the gate and the courtyard&#10;Brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who knows no limitation&#10;Will have cause to lament.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He who knows no limitation&#10;Will have cause to lament.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contented limitation. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Contented limitation. Success.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sweet limitation brings good fortune.&#10;Going brings esteem.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Sweet limitation brings good fortune.&#10;Going brings esteem.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">60</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Restricting</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">節</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Galling limitation.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Galling limitation.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fû (moves even) pigs and fish, and leads to good fortune. There will be advantage in crossing the great stream. There will be advantage in being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fû (moves even) pigs and fish, and leads to good fortune. There will be advantage in crossing the great stream. There will be advantage in being firm and correct.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the waters of) a marsh and that for wind above it form Kung Fû. The superior man, in accordance with this, deliberates about cases of litigation and delays (the infliction of) death.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing the waters of) a marsh and that for wind above it form Kung Fû. The superior man, in accordance with this, deliberates about cases of litigation and delays (the infliction of) death.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject resting (in himself). There will be good fortune. If he sought to any other, he would not find rest.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, shows its subject resting (in himself). There will be good fortune. If he sought to any other, he would not find rest.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject (like) the crane crying out in her hidden retirement, and her young ones responding to her. (It is as if it were said), ‘I have a cup of good spirits,’ (and the response were), ‘I will partake of it with you.’</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject (like) the crane crying out in her hidden retirement, and her young ones responding to her. (It is as if it were said), ‘I have a cup of good spirits,’ (and the response were), ‘I will partake of it with you.’</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject having met with his mate. Now he beats his drum, and now he leaves off. Now he weeps, and now he sings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject having met with his mate. Now he beats his drum, and now he leaves off. Now he weeps, and now he sings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject (like) the moon nearly full, and (like) a horse (in a chariot) whose fellow disappears. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject (like) the moon nearly full, and (like) a horse (in a chariot) whose fellow disappears. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject perfectly sincere, and linking (others) to him in closest union. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject perfectly sincere, and linking (others) to him in closest union. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kung Fu</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject in chanticleer (trying to) mount to heaven. Even with firm correctness there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject in chanticleer (trying to) mount to heaven. Even with firm correctness there will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INNER TRUTH. Pigs and fishes.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">INNER TRUTH. Pigs and fishes.&#10;Good fortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.&#10;Perseverance furthers.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wind over lake: the image of INNER&#10;TRUTH.&#10;Thus the superior man discusses criminal cases&#10;In order to delay executions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wind over lake: the image of INNER&#10;TRUTH.&#10;Thus the superior man discusses criminal cases&#10;In order to delay executions.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Being prepared brings good fortune.&#10;If there are secret designs, it is disquieting.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Being prepared brings good fortune.&#10;If there are secret designs, it is disquieting.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A crane calling in the shade.&#10;Its young answers it.&#10;I have a good goblet.&#10;I will share it with you.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">A crane calling in the shade.&#10;Its young answers it.&#10;I have a good goblet.&#10;I will share it with you.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He finds a comrade.&#10;Now he beats the drum, now he stops.&#10;Now he sobs, now he sings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He finds a comrade.&#10;Now he beats the drum, now he stops.&#10;Now he sobs, now he sings.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The moon nearly at the full.&#10;The team horse goes astray.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The moon nearly at the full.&#10;The team horse goes astray.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He possesses truth, which links together.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He possesses truth, which links together.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">61</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Innermost Sincerity</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">中孚</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Cockcrow penetrating to heaven.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Cockcrow penetrating to heaven.&#10;Perseverance brings misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsiâo Kwo indicates that (in the circumstances which it implies) there will be progress and attainment. But it will be advantageous to be firm and correct. (What the name denotes) may be done in small affairs, but not in great affairs. (It is like) the notes that come down from a bird on the wing;—to descend is better than to ascend. There will (in this way) be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsiâo Kwo indicates that (in the circumstances which it implies) there will be progress and attainment. But it will be advantageous to be firm and correct. (What the name denotes) may be done in small affairs, but not in great affairs. (It is like) the notes that come down from a bird on the wing;—to descend is better than to ascend. There will (in this way) be great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a hill and that for thunder above it form Hsiâo Kwo. The superior man, in accordance with this, in his conduct exceeds in humility, in mourning exceeds in sorrow, and in his expenditure exceeds in economy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) a hill and that for thunder above it form Hsiâo Kwo. The superior man, in accordance with this, in his conduct exceeds in humility, in mourning exceeds in sorrow, and in his expenditure exceeds in economy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, suggests (the idea of) a bird flying, (and ascending) till the issue is evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, suggests (the idea of) a bird flying, (and ascending) till the issue is evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject passing by his grandfather, and meeting with his grandmother; not attempting anything against his ruler, but meeting him as his minister. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, shows its subject passing by his grandfather, and meeting with his grandmother; not attempting anything against his ruler, but meeting him as his minister. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject taking no extraordinary precautions against danger; and some in consequence finding opportunity to assail and injure him. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, shows its subject taking no extraordinary precautions against danger; and some in consequence finding opportunity to assail and injure him. There will be evil.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject falling into no error, but meeting (the exigency of his situation), without exceeding (in his natural. course). If he go forward, there will be peril, and he must be cautious. There is no occasion to be using firmness perpetually.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject falling into no error, but meeting (the exigency of his situation), without exceeding (in his natural. course). If he go forward, there will be peril, and he must be cautious. There is no occasion to be using firmness perpetually.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, (suggests the idea) of dense clouds, but no rain, coming from our borders in the west. It also (shows) the prince shooting his arrow, and taking the bird in a cave.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, (suggests the idea) of dense clouds, but no rain, coming from our borders in the west. It also (shows) the prince shooting his arrow, and taking the bird in a cave.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Hsien Kwan</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows. its subject not meeting (the exigency of his situation), and exceeding (his proper course). (It suggests the idea of) a bird flying far aloft. There will be evil. The case is what is called one of calamity and self-produced injury.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The sixth line, divided, shows. its subject not meeting (the exigency of his situation), and exceeding (his proper course). (It suggests the idea of) a bird flying far aloft. There will be evil. The case is what is called one of calamity and self-produced injury.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PREPONDERANCE OF THE SMALL. Success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;Small things may be done; great things should not be done.&#10;The flying bird brings the message:&#10;It is not well to strive upward,&#10;It is well to remain below.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">PREPONDERANCE OF THE SMALL. Success.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;Small things may be done; great things should not be done.&#10;The flying bird brings the message:&#10;It is not well to strive upward,&#10;It is well to remain below.&#10;Great good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder on the mountain:&#10;The image of PREPONDERANCE OF THE&#10;SMALL.&#10;Thus in his conduct the superior man gives preponderance to reverence.&#10;In bereavement he gives preponderance to grief.&#10;In his expenditures he gives preponderance to thrift.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Thunder on the mountain:&#10;The image of PREPONDERANCE OF THE&#10;SMALL.&#10;Thus in his conduct the superior man gives preponderance to reverence.&#10;In bereavement he gives preponderance to grief.&#10;In his expenditures he gives preponderance to thrift.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bird meets with misfortune through flying.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The bird meets with misfortune through flying.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">She passes by her ancestor&#10;And meets her ancestress.&#10;He does not reach his prince&#10;And meets the official.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">She passes by her ancestor&#10;And meets her ancestress.&#10;He does not reach his prince&#10;And meets the official.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one is not extremely careful,&#10;Somebody may come up from behind and strike him.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">If one is not extremely careful,&#10;Somebody may come up from behind and strike him.&#10;Misfortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No blame. He meets him without passing by.&#10;Going brings danger. One must be on guard.&#10;Do not act. Be constantly persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">No blame. He meets him without passing by.&#10;Going brings danger. One must be on guard.&#10;Do not act. Be constantly persevering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dense clouds,&#10;No rain from our western territory.&#10;The prince shoots and hits him who is in the cave.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Dense clouds,&#10;No rain from our western territory.&#10;The prince shoots and hits him who is in the cave.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">62</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Little Exceeding</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">小過</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He passes him by, not meeting him.&#10;The flying bird leaves him.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;This means bad luck and injury.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He passes him by, not meeting him.&#10;The flying bird leaves him.&#10;Misfortune.&#10;This means bad luck and injury.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kî Žî intimates progress and success in small matters. There will be advantage in being firm and correct. There has been good fortune in the beginning; there may be disorder in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Kî Žî intimates progress and success in small matters. There will be advantage in being firm and correct. There has been good fortune in the beginning; there may be disorder in the end.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) fire and that for water above it form Kî Žî. The superior man, in accordance with this, thinks of evil (that may come), and beforehand guards against it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) fire and that for water above it form Kî Žî. The superior man, in accordance with this, thinks of evil (that may come), and beforehand guards against it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, (shows its subject as a driver) who drags back his wheel, (or as a fox) which has wet his tail. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, undivided, (shows its subject as a driver) who drags back his wheel, (or as a fox) which has wet his tail. There will be no error.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, (shows its subject as) a wife who has lost her (carriage-)screen. There is no occasion to go in pursuit of it. In seven days she will find it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, divided, (shows its subject as) a wife who has lost her (carriage-)screen. There is no occasion to go in pursuit of it. In seven days she will find it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, (suggests the case of) Kâo Žung, who attacked the Demon region, but was three years in subduing it. Small men should not be employed (in such enterprises).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, undivided, (suggests the case of) Kâo Žung, who attacked the Demon region, but was three years in subduing it. Small men should not be employed (in such enterprises).</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject with rags provided against any leak (in his boat), and on his guard all day long.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, divided, shows its subject with rags provided against any leak (in his boat), and on his guard all day long.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject (as) the neighbour in the east who slaughters an ox (for his sacrifice); but this is not equal to the (small) spring sacrifice of the neighbour in the west, whose sincerity receives the blessing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, undivided, shows its subject (as) the neighbour in the east who slaughters an ox (for his sacrifice); but this is not equal to the (small) spring sacrifice of the neighbour in the west, whose sincerity receives the blessing.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Ki Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject with (even) his head immersed. The position is perilous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, divided, shows its subject with (even) his head immersed. The position is perilous.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">AFTER COMPLETION. Success in small matters.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;At the beginning good fortune,&#10;At the end disorder.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">AFTER COMPLETION. Success in small matters.&#10;Perseverance furthers.&#10;At the beginning good fortune,&#10;At the end disorder.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water over fire: the image of the condition&#10;In AFTER COMPLETION.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Takes thought of misfortune&#10;And arms himself against it in advance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Water over fire: the image of the condition&#10;In AFTER COMPLETION.&#10;Thus the superior man&#10;Takes thought of misfortune&#10;And arms himself against it in advance.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brakes his wheels.&#10;He gets his tail in the water.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brakes his wheels.&#10;He gets his tail in the water.&#10;No blame.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The woman loses the curtain of her carriage.&#10;Do not run after it;&#10;On the seventh day you will get it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The woman loses the curtain of her carriage.&#10;Do not run after it;&#10;On the seventh day you will get it.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Illustrious Ancestor&#10;Disciplines the Devil’s Country.&#10;After three years he conquers it.&#10;Inferior people must not be employed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The Illustrious Ancestor&#10;Disciplines the Devil’s Country.&#10;After three years he conquers it.&#10;Inferior people must not be employed.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The finest clothes turn to rags.&#10;Be careful all day long.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The finest clothes turn to rags.&#10;Be careful all day long.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The neighbor in the east who slaughters an ox&#10;Does not attain as much real happiness&#10;As the neighbor in the west&#10;With his small offering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The neighbor in the east who slaughters an ox&#10;Does not attain as much real happiness&#10;As the neighbor in the west&#10;With his small offering.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">63</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Already Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">既濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He gets his head in the water. Danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He gets his head in the water. Danger.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Žî intimates progress and success (in the circumstances which it implies). (We see) a young fox that has nearly crossed (the stream), when its tail gets immersed. There will be no advantage in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Žî intimates progress and success (in the circumstances which it implies). (We see) a young fox that has nearly crossed (the stream), when its tail gets immersed. There will be no advantage in any way.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) water and that for fire above it form Wei Žî. The superior man, in accordance with this, carefully discriminates among (the qualities of) things, and the (different) positions they (naturally) occupy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">(The trigram representing) water and that for fire above it form Wei Žî. The superior man, in accordance with this, carefully discriminates among (the qualities of) things, and the (different) positions they (naturally) occupy.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject (like a fox) whose tail gets immersed. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The first line, divided, shows its subject (like a fox) whose tail gets immersed. There will be occasion for regret.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject dragging back his (carriage-) wheel. With firmness and correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The second line, undivided, shows its subject dragging back his (carriage-) wheel. With firmness and correctness there will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject, with (the state of things) not yet remedied, advancing on; which will lead to evil. But there will be advantage in (trying to) cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The third line, divided, shows its subject, with (the state of things) not yet remedied, advancing on; which will lead to evil. But there will be advantage in (trying to) cross the great stream.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject by firm correctness obtaining good fortune, so that all occasion for repentance disappears. Let him stir himself up, as if he were invading the Demon region, where for three years rewards will come to him (and his troops) from the great kingdom.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fourth line, undivided, shows its subject by firm correctness obtaining good fortune, so that all occasion for repentance disappears. Let him stir himself up, as if he were invading the Demon region, where for three years rewards will come to him (and his troops) from the great kingdom.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject by firm correctness obtaining good fortune, and having no occasion for repentance. (We see in him) the brightness of a superior man, and the possession of sincerity. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The fifth line, divided, shows its subject by firm correctness obtaining good fortune, and having no occasion for repentance. (We see in him) the brightness of a superior man, and the possession of sincerity. There will be good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Wei Zi</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">legge</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject full of confidence and therefore feasting (quietly). There will be no error. (If he) cherish this confidence, till he (is like the fox who) gets his head immersed, it will fail of what is right.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">The topmost line, undivided, shows its subject full of confidence and therefore feasting (quietly). There will be no error. (If he) cherish this confidence, till he (is like the fox who) gets his head immersed, it will fail of what is right.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">judgment</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Juicio</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BEFORE COMPLETION. Success.&#10;But if the little fox, after nearly completing the crossing,&#10;Gets his tail in the water,&#10;There is nothing that would further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">BEFORE COMPLETION. Success.&#10;But if the little fox, after nearly completing the crossing,&#10;Gets his tail in the water,&#10;There is nothing that would further.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">image</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Imagen</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire over water:&#10;The image of the condition before transition.&#10;Thus the superior man is careful&#10;In the differentiation of things,&#10;So that each finds its place.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Fire over water:&#10;The image of the condition before transition.&#10;Thus the superior man is careful&#10;In the differentiation of things,&#10;So that each finds its place.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 1</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He gets his tail in the water.&#10;Humiliating.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He gets his tail in the water.&#10;Humiliating.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 2</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brakes his wheels.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">He brakes his wheels.&#10;Perseverance brings good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 3</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Before completion, attack brings misfortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Before completion, attack brings misfortune.&#10;It furthers one to cross the great water.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 4</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.&#10;Shock, thus to discipline the Devil’s Country.&#10;For three years, great realms are awarded.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;Remorse disappears.&#10;Shock, thus to discipline the Devil’s Country.&#10;For three years, great realms are awarded.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 5</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">7</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;No remorse.&#10;The light of the superior man is true.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Perseverance brings good fortune.&#10;No remorse.&#10;The light of the superior man is true.&#10;Good fortune.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
<Row><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">64</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Not Yet Fulfilled</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">未濟</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">wilhelm</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">L6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">Línea 6</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">8</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is drinking of wine&#10;In genuine confidence. No blame.&#10;But if one wets his head,&#10;He loses it, in truth.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">There is drinking of wine&#10;In genuine confidence. No blame.&#10;But if one wets his head,&#10;He loses it, in truth.</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String">YES</Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell><Cell><Data ss:Type="String"></Data></Cell></Row>
</Table>
</Worksheet>
